	descriptions={
		["(DEVELOPMENT) A test skill for highlighting a certain range in-game"]="（開發）在遊戲內標示特定範圍的測試技能",
		["A bloody scythe swipes across a selected area, applying a physical damage over time debuff and hitting enemies with physical damage. If any survive, you gain a blood charge which raises the damage and cost of the skill. Players can have 5 maximum blood charges."]="一把血腥鐮刀橫掃指定區域，對敵人造成物理傷害和物理持續傷害減益效果。若敵人存活，你會獲得 1 顆血腥球，會增加技能傷害和消耗。玩家最多有 5 顆血腥球。",
		["A bloody scythe swipes around you, applying a physical damage over time debuff and hitting enemies with physical damage. If any survive, you gain a blood charge which raises the damage and cost of the skill. Players can have 5 maximum blood charges."]="一把血腥鐮刀橫掃你周遭的區域，對敵人造成物理傷害和物理持續傷害減益效果。若敵人存活，你會獲得 1 顆血腥球，會增加技能傷害和消耗。玩家最多有 5 顆血腥球。",
		["A bolt of Beidat's lightning strikes an area, dealing lightning damage."]="以貝達特的雷電打擊一片區域，造成閃電傷害。",
		["A bolt of lightning strikes an area, dealing lightning damage."]="使用雷擊攻擊一個區域，造成閃電傷害。",
		["A burst of flame errupts from the location of a hit, dealing fire damage."]="火焰將會在擊中的區域內噴發，造成火焰傷害。",
		["A chilling circle of ice expands from the caster, repeating from every enemy it hits."]="一個冰冷之環在施法者四周膨脹，每次擊中敵人時會重複一次。",
		["A chilling circle of ice expands from the caster. If the caster targets near their Frostbolt projectiles, it will expand from a number of those projectiles instead. If this skill would repeat when cast this way, it will instead expand again from the same projectiles after a short delay."]="一個冰冷之環在施法者四周膨脹。如果施法目標區域附近存在著寒冰彈，則冰冷之環將在寒冰彈的四周膨脹。若此技能以此方式重複施放，則會在同一個投射物再次使冰冷之環膨脹。",
		["A circle of ice expands from the caster."]="一個冰冷之環在施法者四周膨脹。",
		["A circle of ice expands from the caster. If the caster targets near their Frostbolt projectiles, it will expand from a number of those projectiles instead. If this skill would repeat when cast this way, it will instead expand again from the same projectiles after a short delay."]="一個冰冷之環在施法者四周膨脹。如果施法目標區域附近存在著寒冰彈，則冰冷之環將在寒冰彈的四周膨脹。若此技能以此方式重複施放，則會在同一個投射物再次使冰冷之環膨脹。",
		["A corpse near the targeted location explodes, dealing damage in a small area and creating an orb which moves towards nearby enemies before dealing spell damage in a larger area. The explosion of the corpse is not affected by modifiers to spell damage, and cannot be reflected."]="目標附近的屍體爆炸造成小範圍傷害，並製造一個熔核朝附近敵人移動造成較大的範圍傷害。屍體爆炸不受法術屬性影響且不能被反射。",
		["A dagger skill that deals a critical strike and additional damage to an enemy if the attack is made from behind the enemy. Has high mana cost and cooldown"]="一個匕首專用的技能，若是在敵人背後施放則會增加傷害且必定暴擊。高魔力消耗及技能冷卻。",
		["A fiery blast removes your energy shield and all but 1 life, exploding outwards to deal fire damage to nearby enemies based on the life and energy shield lost."]="燃燒自身所有生命及能量護盾直到剩下 1 點生命，將此能量轉化爆發並對周圍的敵人造成火焰傷害。傷害取決於燃燒的生命及能量護盾數值。",
		["A fixed number of flaming bolts rain down in a spiral, culminating in the central one impacting the targeted location. They explode when landing, dealing damage to nearby enemies and leaving burning ground, which deals fire damage over time."]="固定數量的火球以螺旋落下，最終在衝擊中央目標位置。它們在撞擊地面時爆炸，對附近的敵人造成傷害並留下燃燒地面，造持火焰持續傷害。",
		["A giant crystal of abyssal soulstone is called from above, falling to slam down at the targeted location."]="自空中召喚一顆巨大的深淵魂石水晶，墜落並重擊目標地點。",
		["A large flaming bolt falls towards the targeted area. The bolt explodes when landing, dealing damage to nearby enemies."]="一個巨大火焰之球朝目標區域砸落。每顆火球落地時將會爆炸，並對附近的敵人造成傷害。",
		["A sequence of ice crystals erupts from the ground around the caster, damaging enemies and leaving the ground chilled."]="冰之結晶以施法者為中心向外爆發。對敵人造成傷害並使地面冰結。",
		["A shocking arc of lightning reaches from the caster to a targeted enemy and chains to other enemies. Each time the arc chains from an enemy, it will do so simultaneously to two further enemies, but never to enemies that have already been hit by any of these chains. Also grants a buff making your Arc damage lucky for a short duration."]="一道感電的電弧從施放者射向目標，並會在多個目標間彈跳。每次射線連鎖會同時連鎖兩名敵人，但同一名敵人無法被擊中兩次。同時會獲得一個增益效果，你的電弧傷害在一小段時間內很幸運。",
		["A targeted corpse explodes, dealing area damage and turning into a volcanic geyser, which will repeatedly unleash projectiles sequentially over the surrounding area and detonate nearby corpses for a duration. Corpse explosions are not affected by modifiers to spell damage, and cannot be reflected."]="指定的屍體爆炸，造成範圍傷害並變成火山噴泉，在一段時間內會連續釋放爆炸性的投射物來攻擊附近的區域，並引爆附近的屍體。屍體爆炸不受法術傷害詞綴影響，並且不會被反射。",
		["A targeted corpse explodes, dealing area damage and turning into a volcanic geyser, which will repeatedly unleash projectiles sequentially over the surrounding area for a duration. The explosion of the corpse is not affected by modifiers to spell damage, and cannot be reflected."]="指定的屍體爆炸，造成範圍傷害並變成火山噴泉，在一段時間內會連續釋放爆炸性的投射物來攻擊附近的區域。屍體爆炸不受法術傷害詞綴影響，並且不會被反射。",
		["A toad leaps towards enemies and explodes, dealing spell damage in an area."]="一隻蟾蜍向敵人跳去並引爆，在區域內造成法術傷害。",
		["A toad spawns from the corpse of the slain enemy, leaps towards enemies and explodes, dealing forty percent of the slain enemy's Life as Chaos Damage. This skill's damage is not affected by modifiers to spell damage and cannot be reflected."]="從被擊殺的敵人屍體中生成一隻蟾蜍，牠會跳向敵人並引爆，造成等同於被擊殺敵人百分之四十生命的混沌傷害。此技能的傷害不受法術傷害詞綴影響，且無法被反射。",
		["A wave of divine fire deals damage in a line, then creates Consecrated Ground and deals damage in an area around the targeted location. A larger shockwave then expands outwards, damaging enemies standing on Consecrated Ground that were not already hit."]="一道神聖火焰對直線上造成傷害，並製造奉獻地面，對目標地區週圍也造成傷害。之後會有波較大的衝擊波向外擴散，對站在奉獻地面上且未被擊中的敵人造成傷害。",
		["Adds a buff that deals Physical Damage over time, while increasing Attack Speed and Life Leech. Killing an enemy while this buff is active refreshes the buff duration, and can grant a Frenzy Charge."]="使用後將會給予角色時間內一個物理攻擊增益。此增益會對角色增加攻擊速度以及給予額外的生命偷取。擊殺任意敵人將會重置此增益的時間，且獲得一個狂怒球。",
		["Adopt the power of the forest, gradually covering your body in bark. Getting hit by enemy attacks causes bark to be removed. You take reduced damage from physical attack hits the more bark builds up, but higher chance to evade when less covered in bark."]="適應森林的力量，逐漸讓木質覆蓋你的身體。被敵人攻擊及中會使木直被移除。隨著累積越多木質，獲得越高的物理傷害減免，但當被少量木質覆蓋時會有更高的閃避率。",
		["After a short preparation time, you fire individual projectiles repeatedly with a Bow or Wand. These projectiles have a small randomised spread. This skill cannot be Triggered."]="在短暫的準備之後，使用弓或法杖重複發射個別投射物。這些投射物會稍微隨機散射。此技能不能被觸發。",
		["After a short preparation time, you fire projectiles repeatedly with a Bow or Wand. These projectiles have a small randomised spread. This skill cannot be Triggered."]="在短暫的準備之後，使用弓或法杖重複發射投射物。這些投射物會稍微隨機散射。此技能不能被觸發。",
		["Alternates triggering Flames of Judgement and Storm of Judgement"]="交替觸發審判風暴和審判烈焰",
		["An arc of lightning reaches from the caster to a targeted enemy and chains to other enemies, but not immediately back. Each time the arc chains, it will also chain a secondary arc to another enemy that the main arc has not already hit, which cannot chain further."]="一道電弧從施放者射向目標，並會彈跳至另其他目標，彈不會立即彈回。每次電弧連鎖，它還會生成一條二段電弧，連鎖到主要電弧尚未擊中的另一個敵人，但這條二段電弧不能再進一步連鎖。",
		["An arc of lightning reaches from the caster to a targeted enemy and chains to other enemies. Each time the arc chains, it will also chain a secondary arc to another enemy, but this secondary arc cannot chain further."]="一道電弧從施放者射向目標，並會彈跳至另其他目標。每次電弧連鎖，它還會生成一條二段電弧，連鎖到主要電弧尚未擊中的另一個敵人，但這條二段電弧不能再進一步連鎖。",
		["An arc of lightning reaches from the caster to a targeted enemy and splits to simultaneously hit several other enemies."]="一道電弧從施放者射向目標，並同時裂化擊中其他敵人。",
		["An ethereal blade spins around you for a duration, repeatedly damaging enemies that it passes through."]="在你的四周召喚出虛空的武器，以你為中心不斷飛舞旋轉，將周圍的敵人削成肉泥。",
		["An expanding wave of energy surges forward, damaging enemies in a cone-shaped area over a duration. Each enemy hit is inflicted with Exposure matching the element of which they took the highest damage. Only one Wave of Conviction can be active at a time"]="向前方大範圍錐形發送一股滾動的能量一段時間，造成敵人物理、火焰和閃電傷害，對擊中的敵人造成第二次持續更久的減益效果，降低對應屬性的抗性。當浪湧還在啟用時，再次施放技能會停止第一波浪湧。你一次只能有一波浪湧。",
		["An expanding wave of energy surges outwards from you, damaging enemies in a ring-shaped area over a duration. The ring then returns, damaging enemies again on the way back. Only one Wave of Conviction can be active at a time"]="向你前方的環形範圍發送一股滾動的能量一段時間，對敵人造成傷害。隨後環形返回，在回程途中再次對敵人造成傷害。同一時間只能發動一次信念浪湧。",
		["An icy blast explodes around the caster, dealing cold damage to enemies, and leaving behind a whirling vortex which deals cold damage over time and chills enemies caught in it."]="一個會在施法者周圍爆炸的冰爆，對敵人造成冰冷傷害，並留下一個漩渦，對於在其中的敵人繼續造成持續冰冷傷害和冰緩。",
		["An icy blast explodes around the caster, dealing cold damage to enemies, and leaving behind a whirling vortex which deals cold damage over time and chills enemies caught in it. If the caster targets near their Frostbolt projectiles, it will explode from a number of those projectiles instead, destroying them."]="一個會在施法者周圍爆炸的冰爆，對敵人造成冰冷傷害，並留下一個漩渦，對於在其中的敵人繼續造成持續冰冷傷害和冰緩。若施法目標區域附近有寒冰彈，冰爆則會出現在寒冰彈的位置，並摧毀它們。",
		["An icy projectile which has a chance to freeze enemies it passes through. The projectile fades quickly, reducing damage and freezing chance until it dissipates."]="發出一個半月形的寒冰投射物，被擊中的敵人將有機率被冰凍。這個投射物很快就會消散，而其傷害與凍結機率將會隨著消逝而遞減。",
		["Animates a Melee Weapon Item or Lingering Blade to fight by your side. You cannot animate unidentified Weapons. Will not animate weapons with 6 sockets. Cannot be used by Traps or Mines."]="幻化一把近戰武器或剩餘的劍刃來為你而戰。但是不能幻化未鑑定的武器。不會幻化 6 洞武器，除非有特別指定。不能被陷阱或地雷使用。",
		["Animates a Ranged Weapon Item or Lingering Blade to fight by your side. You cannot animate unidentified Weapons. Will not animate weapons with 6 sockets. Cannot be used by Traps or Mines."]="幻化一把遠程武器或剩餘的劍刃來為你而戰。但是不能幻化未鑑定的武器。不會幻化 6 洞武器，除非有特別指定。不能被陷阱或地雷使用。",
		["Animates a copy of your Animated Guardian's main-hand weapon to fight by your side."]="幻化一個你的幻化守衛的主手武器複製品在你身旁戰鬥。",
		["Animates a copy of your main hand Melee Weapon to fight by your side. Cannot be used by Totems, Traps or Mines."]="幻化你主手近戰武器的複製體來為你而戰。不能被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用。",
		["Animates a melee weapon or armour, attaching it to an invisible Guardian that fights by your side using Smite of Divine Judgement, ignoring weapon restrictions. Animating multiple items attaches them to the same Guardian. You cannot animate unidentified items. Cannot be used by Traps or Mines. If your Guardian dies you cannot summon an Animated Guardian again in that area."]="幻化一個近戰武器或護甲，並附加到隱形守護者身上，讓它使用雷鳴重擊．聖判，且無視武器限制來與你並肩作戰。幻化的多件物品都會附加到同一個守護者身上。你無法幻化未鑑定的物品。無法被陷阱或地雷使用。若守護者陣亡，你無法在該區域再次召喚幻化守護者。",
		["Animates a melee weapon or armour, attaching it to an invisible Guardian that fights by your side. Animating multiple items attaches them to the same Guardian. You cannot animate unidentified items. Cannot be used by Traps or Mines. If your Guardian dies you cannot summon an Animated Guardian again in that area."]="幻化一個近戰武器或護甲，並附加到隱形守護者身上，讓他與你並肩作戰。幻化的多件物品都會附加到同一個守護者身上。你無法幻化未鑑定的物品。無法被陷阱或地雷使用。若守護者陣亡，你無法在該區域再次召喚幻化守護者。",
		["Animates multiple Melee Weapon Items and Lingering Blades to fight by your side, and transforms them into different, unique weapons. You cannot animate unidentified Weapons. Will not animate weapons with 6 sockets. Cannot be used by Traps or Mines."]="操控一把近戰武器或剩餘的劍刃來為你而戰，並將它們轉換至不同的傳奇物品。不能幻化未鑑定的武器。不會幻化有 6 個插槽的武器。不能被陷阱或地雷使用。",
		["Applies a buff boosting chance to shock. When you shock an enemy while you have this buff, creates a spherical field of energy attached to the shocked enemy for a duration, which will damage it and other nearby enemies with beams of lightning."]="套用一個增加感電機率的增益效果。當你有此增益效果感電敵人時，製造一個能量領域附著至感電的敵人持續一段時間，並對附近敵人造成雷電光束傷害。",
		["Applies a buff boosting chance to shock. When you shock an enemy while you have this buff, creates a spherical field of energy attached to the shocked enemy for a duration, which will damage it and other nearby enemies with beams of lightning. The strength of the field depends on the magnitude of shock affecting the enemy when it is created."]="套用一個增加感電機率的增益效果。當你有此增益效果感電敵人時，製造一個能量領域附著至感電的敵人持續一段時間，並對附近敵人造成雷電光束傷害。領域的強度取決於製造時影響敵人的感電幅度。",
		["Applies a buff that adds to your armour, and can take some of the damage from hits for you before being depleted. When the buff expires or is depleted, the skill deals reflected damage to enemies around you based on the total damage that was taken from the buff. Shares a cooldown with other Guard skills."]="套用一個增益效果至你的護甲，並在你受到傷害前可以先承受部分擊中傷害。當增益效果消耗殆盡時，技能會對你附近的敵人造成反射傷害，此傷害根據此增益效果總共承受多少傷害而定。與其它守護技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Applies a buff that protects the lower half of your life, preventing some of the immediate life loss when damaged by hits and applying the loss over time instead. Your life cannot be raised above low life other than by flasks, and while above low life, skills will cost life as well as mana."]="施放一個保護你剩下一半生命的增益效果，當傷害擊中時避免部分立即損失生命，而改為持續損失。你的生命除了使用藥劑，不然無法提升至貧血以上，且在貧血以上時，技能會消耗生命和魔力。",
		["Applies a buff that raises your armour, and takes some of the damage from hits for you before being depleted. Each second, the skill deals reflected damage to surrounding enemies based on the damage taken by the buff in that second. When the buff is removed, the skill deals reflected damage to enemies around you based on the total damage that was taken by the buff. You cannot have the buff at the same time as any other Guard skill."]="套用一個增益效果至你的護甲，在效果消逝前，你受到傷害前可以先承受部分擊中傷害。每秒根據你當時所承受的傷害，對附近敵人造成反射傷害。當增益效果消耗殆盡時，技能會對你附近的敵人造成反射傷害，此傷害根據此增益效果總共承受多少傷害而定。與其它守護技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Applies a buff to you and each of your minions, which will take some of the damage from enemy hits before being depleted. The buff also grants immunity to bleeding. Shares a cooldown with other Guard skills."]="對你和你的每個召喚物施放一個增益效果，該效果在耗盡前可承受部分來自敵人的擊中傷害。此增益效果同時也提供免疫流血。與其他守護技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Applies a buff which can take some of the damage from hits for you before being depleted. Shares a cooldown with other Guard skills."]="套用一個增益效果，在它被消耗完畢前可以替你承受部分擊中傷害。與其它守護技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Applies a debuff to Enemies, removing some of their resistance to Chaos damage."]="給與敵人一個減益效果，減少他們一點混沌傷害抗性。",
		["Applies a debuff to a specific enemy which signals your minions to consider that enemy to be the Prey. All minions from skills supported by any Predator Support will target that enemy. Only one enemy can be the Prey at a time. This skill cannot be used by Totems, Traps, or Mines."]="對指定敵人施放減益效果，使你的召喚物將敵人視為獵物。所有被掠奪者輔助的召喚物將會瞄準該敵人。同一時間只能有一個敵人為獵物。此技能無法被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用。",
		["Applies a debuff to enemies in a small area, which deals chaos damage over Time. Linked hex curses are also applied to those enemies. The debuff deals more damage and lasts longer for each hex applied this way.  This skill cannot be used by Totems, Traps, or Mines."]="對小範圍內敵人造成一個造成混沌持續傷害的減益效果，同時串聯的咒術詛咒也會對範圍敵人造成影響。每個以此方式造成的咒術，使減益效果造成更多持續傷害持續更久。此技能不能被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用。",
		["Applies a debuff to enemies in an area, which deals chaos damage over Time. Linked hex curses are also applied to those enemies. The debuff deals more damage and lasts longer for each hex applied this way.  This skill cannot be used by Totems, Traps, or Mines."]="對範圍內敵人造成一個造成混沌持續傷害的減益效果，同時串聯的咒術詛咒也會對範圍敵人造成影響。每個以此方式造成的咒術，使減益效果造成更多持續傷害持續更久。此技能不能被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用。",
		["Apply a debuff to Enemies which deals Chaos Damage over Time."]="給與敵人一個減益效果，造成混沌持續傷害。",
		["Apply a debuff to enemies in front of you which deals chaos damage over time. Enemies who aren't already debuffed by Blight are also hindered for a longer secondary duration, slowing their movement and reducing their life regeneration rate. Continued channelling adds layers of damage to the debuff, each with their own duration."]="對你前方的敵人套用一個減益效果，對其造成持續的混沌傷害。那些尚未受到萎滅減益的敵人還會在較長的次要時間內受到阻礙效果，減緩其移動速度並降低其生命回復率。持續引導將為減益效果添加傷害層，每層都有自己的持續時間。",
		["Apply a debuff to enemies in front of you which deals chaos damage over time. Enemies who aren't already debuffed by Blight are also hindered for a shorter secondary duration, slowing their movement. Continued channelling adds layers of damage to the debuff, each with their own duration."]="對你前方的敵人套用一個減益效果，對其造成持續的混沌傷害。那些尚未受到萎滅減益的敵人還會在較短的次要時間內受到阻礙效果，減緩其移動速度。持續引導將為減益效果添加傷害層，每層都有自己的持續時間。",
		["Apply a debuff to enemies in front of you which deals chaos damage over time. Enemies who aren't already debuffed by Blight are also hindered for a shorter secondary duration, slowing their movement. Continued channelling adds layers of damage to the debuff, each with their own duration. The damaging debuff is spread by Contagion."]="對你前方的敵人套用一個減益效果，對其造成持續的混沌傷害。那些尚未受到萎滅減益的敵人還會在較短的次要時間內受到阻礙效果，減緩其移動速度。持續引導將為減益效果添加傷害層，每層都有自己的持續時間。造成傷害的減益效果可由瘟疫擴散。",
		["Apply a powerful debuff to enemies around you which deals chaos damage over time. Then applies two additional layers in a larger area, growing greatly in size each time. Enemies are also substantially hindered for a shorter secondary duration, slowing their movement."]="引導施放時對所有扇形範圍中的敵人疊加強力的減益效果，每層減益效果各自存在持續時間，並造成混沌持續傷害。敵人會持續受到較短的二階阻礙效果，減少他們的移動速度。",
		["As you channel this spell, it spreads its effect to more of your minions. When you stop channelling, each affected minion explodes, and this skill deals spell damage around them.  The explosion of the minion is not affected by modifiers to spell damage, and cannot be reflected."]="當你引導施放此技能，他的效果會擴散至更多你的召喚物。當你停止引導施放時，每個被影響的召喚物會爆炸，此技能會他們附近造成法術傷害。召喚物的爆炸不受法術傷害詞綴影響，且不能被反射。",
		["Attack enemies with a forceful melee strike that also hurts you. Successive uses will raise the damage dealt both to enemies and you. Stunning an enemy with the strike releases a damaging pulse. Requires a Mace, Sceptre, Axe or Staff."]="用強力的近戰攻擊攻擊敵人，同時也會傷害你。連續使用將提高對敵人和對你造成的傷害。用打擊擊暈敵人時會釋放一個傷害型脈衝。限定錘、權杖、斧或長杖。",
		["Attack enemies with a forceful melee strike. Stunning an enemy with the strike releases a damaging pulse. Requires a Mace, Sceptre, Axe or Staff."]="用強力的近戰攻擊攻擊敵人。用打擊擊暈敵人時會釋放一個傷害型脈衝。限定錘、權杖、斧或長杖。",
		["Attack enemies with greatly increased range, creating a chilling area that deals cold damage over time if it hits. Requires a Melee Weapon."]="大幅增加攻擊範圍，若擊中製造冰緩區域造成冰冷持續傷害。限定近戰武器。",
		["Attack enemies with increased range, releasing icy blades from the first enemy hit which fly at other enemies. Requires a Melee Weapon."]="增加攻擊範圍，當被擊飛的敵人與其他敵人碰撞時釋放冰霜之刃。限定近戰武器。",
		["Attack with a melee weapon, gaining a Gathering Lightning buff for a duration if you hit an enemy. While you have Gathering Lightning, attacks with this skill will cause chaining beams of lightning, which chain additional times the more Gathering Lightning you have."]="使用近戰武器攻擊，若有擊中目標則獲得一層持續一段時間的電光凝聚增益效果。當你有電光凝聚時，使用此技能攻擊將產生能夠連鎖的電光，並根據電光凝聚的層數提高連鎖次數。",
		["Attack with a melee weapon, gaining static energy for a duration if you hit an enemy. While you have static energy, you'll frequently hit a number of nearby enemies with beams, dealing attack damage."]="使用近戰武器攻擊，若有擊中目標則獲得一層穩定之能。當你有穩定之能時，你會不斷用光束對附近數個敵人造成攻擊傷害。",
		["Attacks an area in front of you. Each Reave that hits an enemy grants stages, which you will begin to lose after a short period without hitting anything. Only works with Daggers, Claws, and One-Handed Swords."]="對前方區域攻擊。每個擊中敵人的衝擊波獲得疊層。若是一段時間內沒有使用衝擊波擊中敵人時會開始失去疊層。限定匕首、爪、單手劍。",
		["Attacks enemies with a forceful blow, sending them flying backwards. Requires a Mace, Sceptre, Axe, Sword or Two-Handed Weapon."]="對目標進行一次強而有力的攻擊並把目標擊飛。限定斧、錘、劍或雙手武器。",
		["Attacks enemies with a forceful blow. Requires a Mace, Sceptre, Axe, Sword or Staff."]="對目標進行一次強而有力的攻擊。限定劍、斧、錘、權杖或長杖。",
		["Attacks enemies with a forceful blow. Requires a Staff."]="以強力揮擊攻擊敵人。需要長杖。",
		["Attacks enemies with a melee strike, applying a debuff for a short duration. If a non-unique enemy dies while affected by the debuff, the enemy's corpse will be consumed and a Sentinel of Dominance with the same rarity, prefix and suffix modifiers will be summoned for a longer secondary duration."]="使用近戰攻擊打擊敵人，給予一小段時間的減益效果。若非傳奇敵人在減益效果持續時間內死亡，敵人的屍體將會被消耗並召喚一個相同稀有度和前後綴的統御護衛，持續一段時間。",
		["Attacks enemies with a powerful melee strike which grants Fortification, reducing damage you take from hits. The cooldown can be bypassed by expending an Endurance Charge. Requires a Melee Weapon."]="對敵人進行奮力一擊，使你獲得護體，減少承受擊中傷害。冷卻時間可以透過消耗耐力球無視。限定近戰武器。",
		["Attacks with both weapons, dealing the damage of both in one strike. Dual wield only. Does not work with wands."]="使用兩把武器對目標同時進行攻擊並造成傷害。限定雙持（不包含法杖）。",
		["Attacks with both weapons, dealing the damage of both in one strike. Requires dual-wielding two different melee weapon types to use."]="使用兩把武器對目標同時進行攻擊並造成傷害。限定雙持不同近戰武器來使用。",
		["Attacks with your weapon, applying a charged debuff to enemies hit by your strike, and an uncharged debuff to any other enemies hit. Upon reaching 6 charges, expiring, or the enemy's death, the charged debuff is removed to damage that and other surrounding enemies. Enemies with either debuff explode when they die, damaging other surrounding enemies. Damage from this explosion cannot be reflected. Requires a Sword, Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Staff or Unarmed."]="使用你的武器攻擊，對敵人產生一個充能的減益效果，同時也對其他擊中的敵人產生一個無充能的減益效果。當充能減益效果消逝、累積6層充能或敵人死亡時，效果將被移除並對該敵人和附近敵人造成傷害。當有任何減益效果的敵人死亡時會爆炸。此爆炸的傷害不能被反射。限定劍、斧、錘、權杖、長杖或是空手。",
		["Attacks with your weapon, applying a charged debuff to you the first time you hit an enemy with this skill. Upon reaching 6 charges, or charges expiring, the charged debuff is removed to damage nearby enemies. Requires a Sword, Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Staff or Unarmed."]="使用你的武器攻擊，對你使用此技能擊中的第一個敵人產生一個充能的減益效果。當充能減益效果消逝或累積6層充能時，效果將被移除並對該敵人和附近敵人造成傷害。限定劍、斧、錘、權杖、長杖或是空手。",
		["Attacks with your weapon, inflicting a debuff on enemies hit by the strike. If a debuffed enemy dies while poisoned, Pestilent Strike inflicts a secondary chaos damage over time debuff on enemies around them, based on the poisons on the slain enemy. This damage is not affected by your damage modifiers. Requires a Claw or Dagger."]="使用你的武器攻擊，打擊時對敵人造成一個減益效果。若被減益效果的敵人死亡時有中毒，瘟疫打擊會產生對附近敵人造成二階段混沌持續傷害的減益效果，該傷害根據被擊殺敵人身上的中毒。此傷害不受你的傷害詞綴影響。限定爪或匕首。",
		["Become touched by the flames of the Cleansing Fire."]="你被淨化之火的烈焰碰觸",
		["Bloody scythes swipe around a selected area, hitting enemies with physical damage. An area of boiling blood is left beneath them for a duration which deals physical damage over time. Also gives a bonus to maximum Blood Charges for a secondary duration."]="一把血腥鐮刀橫掃指定區域，物理傷害擊中敵人。在它們下方留下沸騰之血一段時間，並造成物理持續傷害。同時在二階持續時間給予最大血腥球加成。",
		["Bones erupt around enemies you hit, dealing physical damage."]="從施法者散發出一圈刺骨之環，造成物理傷害。",
		["Buffs you, and affects nearby enemies with an aura, differently depending on your stance. Both stances are more impactful against enemies closer to you. Using the skill again alternates between Blood Stance and Sand Stance."]="根據不同的姿態，以光環賦予自己增益效果並影響附近的敵人。兩種姿態都會對越靠近你的敵人產生較大的影響。再次使用此技能會在血腥姿態和沙姿態之間進行切換。",
		["Calls forth a protective aegis which takes cold damage from hits for you until depleted. The aegis will be restored to its full value after a short delay if you stop taking cold damage from hits, or if depleted."]="召喚一個防禦聖盾抵擋冰冷傷害直到消殆盡。若近期沒有受到冰冷傷害或耗盡時，一段時間後聖盾會回復到滿溢狀態。",
		["Calls forth a protective aegis which takes elemental damage from hits for you until depleted. The aegis will be restored to its full value after a short delay if you stop taking elemental damage from hits, or if depleted."]="召喚一個防禦聖盾抵擋元素傷害直到消耗殆盡。若近期沒有受到元素傷害或耗盡時，一段時間後聖盾會回復到滿溢狀態。",
		["Calls forth a protective aegis which takes fire damage from hits for you until depleted. The aegis will be restored to its full value after a short delay if you stop taking fire damage from hits, or if depleted."]="召喚一個防禦聖盾抵擋火焰傷害直到消耗殆盡。若近期沒有受到火焰傷害或耗盡時，一段時間後聖盾會回復到滿溢狀態。",
		["Calls forth a protective aegis which takes lightning damage from hits for you until depleted. The aegis will be restored to its full value after a short delay if you stop taking lightning damage from hits, or if depleted."]="召喚一個防禦聖盾抵擋閃電傷害直到消耗殆盡。若近期沒有受到閃電傷害或耗盡時，一段時間後聖盾會回復到滿溢狀態。",
		["Calls forth a protective aegis which takes physical damage from hits for you until depleted. The aegis will be restored to its full value after a short delay if you stop taking physical damage from hits, or if depleted."]="召喚一個防禦聖盾抵擋理傷害直到消耗殆盡。若近期沒有受到物理傷害或耗盡時，一段時間後聖盾會回復到滿溢狀態。",
		["Calls forth pillars of ashen flame. These pillars deal Fire damage in an area, and cover Enemies they hit in Ash. Requires a Melee Weapon or Unarmed."]="召喚灰燼之炎構成的火柱。這些火柱會在區域內造成火焰傷害，並使被擊中的敵人餘燼纏身。需求近戰武器或是空手。",
		["Calls impale debuffs from enemies, alive or dead, in a large area around you to gain steel shards. Deals reflected damage in a smaller area around each such enemy based on the impales removed from them. Continues to grant shards over time until you reach maximum or spend them."]="在你附近大範圍內呼喚活著或死亡敵人身上的穿刺減益效果，使你獲得鋼鐵碎片。並根據移除穿刺敵人的位置造成小範圍的反射範圍傷害。你會持續獲得碎片直到最大上限，或是消耗它們時。",
		["Calls lightning down to infuse your weapon, then performs a melee attack and causes lightning to strike nearby enemies, dealing damage in an area. Hitting an enemy grants an aura for a duration. Requires a Sword, Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Staff or Unarmed."]="呼喚雷電注入你的武器，進行近戰攻擊並使雷擊攻擊附近的敵人，造成範圍傷害。擊中敵人獲得一個光環，使你和你的友方獲得一段時間額外閃電傷害。限定劍、斧、錘、權杖、長杖或空手。",
		["Cast a pact, Empowering non-channelling spells that either fire projectiles, apply an effect to an area around a targeted location or fire chaining beams, causing them to deal more damage and have enhanced coverage. However, using this skill also burdens you with an Affliction."]="施放一項誓約，強化那些會發射投射物、對目標地點周圍區域施加效果，或發射連鎖光束的非引導法術，使其造成更多傷害並強化覆蓋範圍。然而，使用此技能也會使你背負一項苦難。",
		["Cast a pact, Empowering the next channelling spells you cast yourself but burdening you with an Affliction. Empowered spells deal more damage and periodically trigger lightning bolts while channelling."]="施放一項誓約，強化你下一個施放的引導法術，但同時會使你背負一項苦難。被強化的法術會造成更多傷害，且在引導期間持續觸發雷擊。",
		["Cast a pact, Empowering your damage over time spells but burdening you with an Affliction. This skill also grants the Hunger of Ghorr buff for a duration causing Fleshrend to trigger periodically."]="施放一項誓約，強化你的持續傷害法術，但同時會使你背負一項苦難。此技能還會在一段持續時間內賦予戈沃之飢渴增益效果，進而週期性的觸發血肉撕扯。",
		["Cast a pact, Empowering your damaging Vaal spells but burdening you with an Affliction. Empowered Vaal spells deal more damage, have less soul gain prevention duration and regain consumed souls on use."]="施放一項誓約，強化你造成傷害的瓦爾法術，但同時會使你背負一項苦難。被強化的瓦爾法術會造成更多傷害、停止獲得靈魂的持續時間更短，且使用時回復已消耗的靈魂。",
		["Cast your fishing rod towards a number of enemies in front of you. Non-unique enemies far away from you are pulled towards you."]="朝你面前的數個敵人拋出魚竿。遠方的非傳奇敵人會被拉向你。",
		["Casts a buff that grants different bonuses to attack skills depending on your stance. Using the skill again alternates between Blood Stance and Sand Stance."]="施放一個增益效果，根據你的姿態給予攻擊技能不同加成。再次使用技能會在血腥姿態和沙戮姿態中切換。",
		["Casts a buff that grants different bonuses to melee skills depending on your stance. Using the skill again alternates between Blood Stance and Sand Stance."]="根據你的姿態獲得不同的近戰技能加成效果。再次使用技能可以切換血腥姿態和沙戮姿態。",
		["Casts a debilitating debuff on enemies in an area, hindering their movement and also inflicts the Withered debuff, which increases the Chaos Damage they take and can stack up to 15 times."]="施放一個對敵人造成虛弱的範圍效果，造成阻礙並且疊加一個使他們增加受到的混沌傷害之凋零減益效果。此減益效果可疊加 15 層。",
		["Casts a debilitating effect on enemies in an area, Hindering their movement and applying a stacking Withered debuff that increases the Chaos Damage they take. This effect can stack up to 15 times."]="施放一個對敵人造成虛弱的範圍效果，造成阻礙並且疊加一個使他們增加受到的混沌傷害之凋零減益效果。此減益效果可疊加 15 層。",
		["Casts a delayed teleport for nearby enemies to a target destination. When the teleport occurs, lightning damage is dealt to the enemies both before and after they teleport."]="在指定位置施放一個法陣，在數秒之後將周圍的敵人傳送過去。當傳送時，在原本位置與傳送法陣位置的敵人都會受到閃電傷害。",
		["Casts a ring of Lightning around you, followed by a larger Lightning nova. Each effect hits enemies caught in their area with Lightning Damage."]="在你的周圍施放環狀閃電，接著散發更大範圍的閃電新星。每次被擊中的敵人會受到閃電傷害。",
		["Casts a ring of Lightning around you, followed by a larger Lightning nova. Each effect hits enemies caught in their area with Lightning Damage. This then repeats, with each repeat offset from the previous in the direction you target."]="在你的周圍施放環狀閃電，接著散發更大範圍的閃電新星。每次被擊中的敵人會受到閃電傷害。此效果會重複施放，且新星將會朝施放的方向行進。",
		["Casts a shocking ring of lightning which deals damage to monsters it touches. Monsters in the centre of the ring receive no damage."]="從施法者散發出一圈閃電之環，被擊中的敵人會受到閃電傷害。位在環中心的敵人將不會受到任何傷害。",
		["Casts a temporary aura that grants life regeneration to you and your allies."]="施放一個短暫的光環，使你與受光環影響友方獲得額外的生命回復。",
		["Casts a temporary aura that grants physical damage reduction and elemental resistances to you and your allies."]="施放一個短暫的光環，使你與受光環影響友方獲得物理傷害減免以即元素抗性。",
		["Casts a temporary aura that grants you and your allies additional chance to evade attacks, and makes suppressed spell damage unlucky against you."]="施放一個短暫的光環，使你與受光環影響友方獲得閃避攻擊和對你壓抑的法術傷害很不幸的能力。",
		["Casts a temporary aura that increases the movement speed, attack speed and cast speed of you and your allies."]="施放一個短暫的光環，使你與受光環影響友方獲得額外移動速度、攻擊速度以及施放速度。",
		["Casts a temporary aura that lets you and your allies cast skills without paying their mana costs."]="施放一個短暫的光環，使你與受光環影響友方施放技能時無須消耗魔力。",
		["Casts a temporary aura that prevents energy shield recharge being delayed by damage taken for you and your allies."]="施放一個短暫的光環，使你與受光環影響友方獲得額外的能量護盾，並且不會因為受到攻擊而延遲護盾的回復。",
		["Casts an aura that adds chaos damage to the attacks and spells of you and your allies."]="施放一個光環，使你與受光環影響友方在攻擊和施放法術時額外附帶混沌傷害。",
		["Casts an aura that adds fire damage to the attacks and spells of you and your allies."]="施放一個光環，使你與受光環影響友方在攻擊和施放法術時額外附帶火焰傷害。",
		["Casts an aura that adds lightning damage to the attacks of you and your allies, and makes your spells deal more lightning damage."]="施放一個光環，使你與受光環影響友方在攻擊時額外附帶閃電傷害，並且造成更多法術閃電傷害。",
		["Casts an aura that blinds enemies in a radius."]="施放一個光環使範圍內敵人致盲。",
		["Casts an aura that causes nearby enemies to take more physical damage."]="施放一個光環增加附近敵人承受更多物理傷害。",
		["Casts an aura that causes taking elemental damage to heal you and nearby allies instead."]="施展治癒你和友方的光環，治癒量等同所受的元素傷害量。",
		["Casts an aura that deals Chaos Damage over Time to nearby Enemies. This skill cannot be cast by Totems."]="施放一個光環，對附近敵人造成持續混沌傷害。此技能無法被圖騰施放。",
		["Casts an aura that grants accuracy and critical strike chance to you and your allies."]="施放一個光環，使你與受光環影響友方獲得額外的命中和暴擊率。",
		["Casts an aura that grants additional energy shield and increased energy shield recharge rate to you and your allies."]="施放一個光環，使你與受光環影響友方獲得額外的能量護盾和增加能量護盾回復率。",
		["Casts an aura that grants armour to you and your allies."]="施放一個光環，使你與受光環影響友方獲得額外的護甲。",
		["Casts an aura that grants bonuses to damage and critical strike chance of spells to you and your allies, and gives a chance to create Consecrated Ground against stronger enemies."]="施放一個光環，提供你和你的友方法術傷害和暴擊加成，並對強大的敵人有機率製造奉獻地面。",
		["Casts an aura that grants cold resistance to you and your allies."]="施放一個光環，使你與受光環影響的友方獲得額外的冰冷抗性。",
		["Casts an aura that grants elemental resistances and elemental ailment immunity to you and your allies."]="施放一個光環，使你與受光環影響友方獲得元素抗性和免疫元素異常狀態。",
		["Casts an aura that grants evasion to you and your allies."]="施放一個光環，使你與受光環影響友方獲得額外的閃避。",
		["Casts an aura that grants extra cold damage based on physical damage to you and your allies."]="施放一個光環，使你與受光環影響友方獲得根據物理傷害的額外冰冷傷害。",
		["Casts an aura that grants fire resistance to you and your allies."]="施放一個光環，使你與受光環影響的友方獲得額外的火焰抗性。",
		["Casts an aura that grants life regeneration to you and your allies."]="施放一個光環，使你與受光環影響友方獲得額外的生命回復。",
		["Casts an aura that grants lightning resistance to you and your allies."]="施放一個光環，使你與受光環影響的友方獲得額外的閃電抗性。",
		["Casts an aura that grants mana regeneration to you and your allies."]="施放一個光環，使你與受光環影響友方獲得額外的魔力回復。",
		["Casts an aura that increases the movement speed, attack speed and cast speed of you and your allies."]="施放一個光環，使你與受光環影響友方獲得額外的移動速度、攻擊速度以及施放速度。",
		["Casts an aura that multiplies damage over time and increases skill effect duration of you and your allies."]="施放一個光環，增加你和友方的技能持續時間，並使你和友方造成更多持續傷害。",
		["Casts an aura that reduces cold damage taken and provides freeze and chill immunity to you and nearby allies, and makes hits against nearby enemies ignore their cold resistance."]="施放一個光環使你和附近的友方減少承受冰冷傷害和免疫冰凍、冰緩，並擊中附近的敵人時無視他們的冰冷抗性。",
		["Casts an aura that reduces fire damage taken and provides ignite immunity to you and nearby allies, and makes hits against nearby enemies ignore their fire resistance."]="施放一個光環使你和附近的友方減少承受火焰傷害和免疫點燃，並擊中附近的敵人時無視他們的火焰抗性。",
		["Casts an aura that reduces lightning damage taken and provides shock immunity to you and nearby allies, and makes hits against nearby enemies ignore their lightning resistance."]="施放一個光環使你和附近的友方減少承受閃電傷害和免疫感電，並擊中附近的敵人時無視他們的閃電抗性。",
		["Cause spires of bone to erupt from the earth around you. When you use a slam on them, these spires will explode to deal damage in an area and inflicting bleeding."]="令你周圍的地面爆發出骨之尖刺。當你使用竭盡攻擊時，這些尖刺會爆炸，對其周圍區域造成傷害，並使敵人流血與穿刺。",
		["Causes one of your existing Sentinels of Absolution to Ascend, becoming more powerful, gaining new spells, and overriding its duration, while maintaining its other bonuses, including from support gems. If you cannot have more Ascended Sentinels of Absolution, an existing one will be refreshed instead."]="昇華其中一個現有的赦免護衛，變得更加強大、獲得新法術和刷新它的持續時間，同時保留其它加成效果，包含輔助寶石。若你不能獲得更多昇華的赦免護衛，則會刷新一個現有護衛的持續時間。",
		["Chance to perform a swift counter-attack against all enemies around you when you are hit. Weapon range increases the area of this attack. Requires a Melee Weapon."]="你被擊中時有機會對周圍的敵人進行一次快速的反擊。攻擊區域範圍會受到武器攻擊範圍的影響。需要裝備近戰武器。",
		["Channel this skill to move towards a targeted location while spinning constantly attacking enemies in an area around you. While channelling this skill, you cannot be knocked back."]="引導施放此技能，邊旋轉邊向目標地點路徑上的敵人攻擊。當引導施放此技能時，你不會被擊退。",
		["Channel this skill to reserve more and more of your life, building up power in a marker on the ground under you. Release to deal physical damage in an area based on how much life you reserved. Cannot be cast by Totems."]="導施放此技能會保留越來越多你的生命，在你腳下的地面畫起印記累積能量。釋放後根據你保留的生命對範圍造成物理傷害。",
		["Channel to charge up your bow, gaining stages. Release to trigger one supported bow skill for each stage gained. If there are no supported skills, but at least one stage was gained, this skill will fire its own arrow instead. Cannot be used by Totems."]="引導施放拉弓以獲得疊層。釋放後根據每個疊層觸發一個被輔助的弓技能。若沒有技能連結，但又獲得至少 1 疊層，此技能會發射它自己的箭矢。不能被圖騰使用。",
		["Channel to conjure an orb above you, which pelts nearby enemies with projectiles that impact the ground and explode. Channelling for longer builds up stages on the skill. When you stop channelling, the stages decay over a duration."]="引導施放念咒召喚出一個凜冬球於你的上方，球體會向附近敵人投擲投射物，並在撞擊地面後爆炸。引導施放技能更長時間可以累積疊層。當你停止引導施放時，疊層會隨著時間慢慢減少。",
		["Channel to create an expanding circle area around you that blinds enemies within it. When you stop channelling, deals damage in a smaller area around each enemy in the circle. Requires a Dagger, Claw or One-Handed Sword."]="引導施放一個在你附近擴張的環形範圍，並致盲範圍內的敵人。當你引導施放時對環形中的每個敵人造成小範圍的傷害。限定匕首、爪或單手劍。",
		["Channel to improve runes placed by Stormbind based on the mana you spend channelling this skill. Release to detonate the targeted rune, which will cause other runes to detonate in a chain reaction."]="根據你引導施此技能的魔力放來優化風暴術符放置的符文。釋放來引爆目標符文，該福文會使其它符文產生連鎖爆破。",
		["Channel to improve runes placed by Stormbind based on the mana you spend channelling this skill. Release to detonate the targeted rune, which will cause other runes to detonate in a chain reaction. Detonation can teleport you to the targeted Rune."]="根據你引導施此技能的魔力放來優化風暴術符放置的符文。釋放來引爆目標符文，該福文會使其它符文產生連鎖爆破。引爆可以傳送你至指定的符文。",
		["Channel to infuse an arrow with chaos, gaining stages while it is held. Release to fire it, leaving spore pods in its wake. Each spore pod blooms, firing thorn arrows, which travel for a short time before dissipating. Modifiers that cause additional projectiles to be fired will only apply to the initial arrows, and the spore pods will be divided between those arrows."]="引導施放此技能拉弓並注入混沌之力，將弓拉住時會累積層數。發射後在它行進的路途掉下黴孢，黴孢將會依據引導施放時的層數。每個黴孢都會爆裂，發射星形荊棘箭矢，在消逝前會飛行一段距離。有額外投射物的詞綴影響第一發箭矢，黴孢會在這些箭矢之間散落。",
		["Channel to project a mirage forward in the direction you're facing, based on your movement speed. Release to teleport to the mirage dealing area of effect damage multiple times along the way. Travelling further applies a bonus to the damage as well as dealing damage in larger areas. Faster attack speed and lower movement speed will both cause damage to be dealt more frequently along the path."]="引導一個幻象根據你的移動速度往你面向的方向前進。施放傳送至幻象並對路徑上造成多次範圍傷害。範圍效果隨著你傳送的距離越遠越大。更快的攻擊速度和較慢的移動速度都可以讓路徑上造成更多次傷害。",
		["Channel to project an illusion which you steer. You gain stages while it moves, until it stops at a maximum total distance. Waves of area damage frequently pulse along its path, based on your attack speed. Stop channelling to release the illusion, dealing a final wave of damage. Requires a Melee Weapon."]="引導一個你駕馭的幻象。當它移動時你獲得層數，直到到達最大距離。你和幻影之間會根據你的攻擊速度不斷釋放脈衝傷害。停止引導後將會傳送至幻影位置，並造成最後一波傷害。限定近戰武器。",
		["Channel to project an illusion which you steer. You gain stages while it moves, until it stops at a maximum total distance. Waves of area damage frequently pulse along its path, based on your attack speed. Stop channelling to teleport to the illusion, dealing a final wave of damage. Requires a Melee Weapon."]="引導一個你駕馭的幻象。當它移動時你獲得層數，直到到達最大距離。你和幻影之間會根據你的攻擊速度不斷釋放脈衝傷害。停止引導後將會傳送至幻影位置，並造成最後一波傷害。限定近戰武器。",
		["Channel to spread runes on the ground in a growing pattern. The runes fade away after a duration, or will be immediately removed and deal damage in a circular area when detonated by Rune Blast. Enemies standing on the runes are Hindered, reducing their movement speed."]="引導施放以使在地面上的符文擴散。符文在一段時間後消逝，或被符文爆破引爆時立即消失並造成圓形範圍傷害。站在符文上的敵人被阻礙，減少他們的移動速度。",
		["Channelling draws in energy around you to repeatedly build up stages, damaging a number of nearby enemies when you do so. Release to unleash this energy in a burst around you and a beam in front of you. Modifiers to area of effect do not affect the beam. Maximum of 10 Stages."]="引導施放吸收你附近的能量，不斷累積疊層，每當這樣做時對附近的多個敵人造成傷害。向前方釋放此能量光束。範圍效果詞綴不會影響光束。疊層上限為 10。",
		["Channelling draws in energy around you to repeatedly build up stages, damaging a number of nearby enemies when you do so. Release to unleash this energy in a powerful burst around you. Maximum of 10 Stages."]="引導施放吸收你附近的能量，不斷累積疊層，每當這樣做時對附近的多個敵人造成傷害。在你身邊釋放此能量光束。疊層上限為 10。",
		["Channelling draws in energy around you to repeatedly build up stages. Release to unleash this energy in a beam in front of you. Modifiers to area of effect do not affect this skill. Maximum of 10 Stages."]="引導施放吸收你附近的能量，不斷累積疊層。向前方釋放此能量光束。範圍效果詞綴不影響此技能。疊層上限為 10。",
		["Channels to build up a large explosion, which is released when you stop using the skill. The longer you channel, the larger the area of effect and damage of the explosion."]="引導施放累積大型的爆炸，當停止使用技能時釋放。引導持續時間越長，範圍效果和爆炸傷害越大。",
		["Channels to build up a large explosion. The longer you channel, the larger the area of effect and damage of the explosion. The explosion occurs after using another skill or after a short period without casting."]="引導施放來施放大型的爆炸。引導的時間越長，爆炸的範圍與造成的傷害越大。當停止引導後一段時間或使用其他技能時便會觸發爆炸。",
		["Channels to build up an explosion, which is released when you stop using the skill or automatically at maximum stages. The longer you channel, the larger the area of effect and damage of the explosion."]="引導施放累積爆炸，當停止使用技能或自動到最大疊層時釋放。引導持續時間越長，範圍效果和爆炸傷害越大。",
		["Channels to concentrate an explosion, which is released when you stop using the skill. The longer you channel, the larger the damage of the explosion, but the smaller the area."]="引導施放緊縮爆炸，當停止使用技能時釋放。引導持續時間越長，爆炸傷害更大，但更小的範圍。",
		["Charges at a targeted location or enemy, pushing away enemies in your path and repeatedly dealing damage in a small area in front of you. You deal damage in a larger area when you reach the target. The further you travel, the more damage you deal, and the greater your chance of stunning enemies."]="向一個區域或目標衝鋒，將路線上的敵人推開並持續在你前方區域造成傷害。衝鋒距離越遠，造成的傷害越高，並且擊暈敵人的機率越高。",
		["Charges at a targeted location or enemy, pushing away enemies in your path and repeatedly dealing off-hand damage in a small area in front of you. You deal damage in a larger area when you reach the target. The further you travel, the more damage you deal, and the greater your chance of stunning enemies."]="向一個區域或目標衝鋒，將路線上的敵人推開並持續在你前方區域造成副手傷害。衝鋒距離越遠，造成的傷害越高，並且擊暈敵人的機率越高。",
		["Charges at an enemy, bashing it with the character's shield and striking it. This knocks it back and stuns it. Enemies in the way are pushed to the side. Damage and stun are proportional to distance travelled."]="向一個目標衝鋒，使用盾牌對其猛擊的同時也用近戰武器順手補刀。此攻擊將會擊退目標並將其擊暈，在路徑上的敵人將會被推向兩旁。傷害與擊暈機率將視衝鋒距離而定。",
		["Charges you with lightning which lasts a duration before unleashing, damaging surrounding enemies."]="在短暫聚能之後釋放，對你週遭的敵人造成傷害。有短暫的冷卻時間。",
		["Chooses an element at random and deals damage of that type in an area. Having higher strength makes it more likely to choose fire, higher dexterity makes it more likely to choose cold, and higher intelligence makes it more likely to choose lightning."]="隨機選擇一種元素，在一個區域造成該類型的傷害。具有較高力量可以增加選擇火焰的機率，具有較高敏捷可以增加選擇冰冷的機率，而具有較高智慧可以增加選擇閃電的機率。",
		["Coalesce holy energy into a series of unstable rings hovering around a target. When you warcry, all Rings of Light within the warcry area will collapse, in a sequence of progressively larger explosions."]="在目標身上匯聚一系列不穩定的環狀神聖能量。當你戰吼時，所有戰吼範圍內的聖芒之環會崩毀，造成一系列越來越大的爆炸。",
		["Command your equipped Grafts to use their Skills."]="號令你所裝備的接肢施放其技能。",
		["Conjures an icy barrier that chills enemies when they hit you. You drop chilled ground while moving, and take less Fire and Physical damage while stationary."]="召喚刺骨的冰霜之盾，做用期間對於擊中你的敵人造成冰緩。移動時造成冰結地面，並且靜止受到較少火焰及物理傷害。",
		["Consume Remembrance to summon a memory of the Shaper, which will use a skill once before fading away."]="消耗回想來召喚塑界者的記憶，召喚後會使用一個技能並消失。",
		["Consume Steel Shards to fire a single projectile that splits on impact or at the targeted location, dealing area damage when it splits and again when the split projectiles explode at the end of their flight. Projectiles from this skill cannot return. Requires a Sword or Axe. Steel Shards are gained with the Call of Steel Skill."]="消耗鋼鐵碎片來發射單一投射物，在撞擊或抵達目標位置時裂化，當它裂化時會造成範圍傷害，裂化的投射物在飛行結束時會爆炸並再次造成範圍傷害。這個技能的投射物不會返回。需要劍或斧。鋼鐵碎片可透過鋼之呼喚技能來獲得。",
		["Consume a number of corpses around you to recover life, mana and energy shield."]="消耗你附近多個屍體來回復生命、魔力和能量護盾。",
		["Consumes Petals to cause affected monsters to revive on death, dropping loot and granting experience again. The number of Petals consumed is proportional to the Power of affected monsters. Does not affect Unique monsters."]="消耗花瓣讓受到影響的怪物在死亡時復甦，使其再次掉落戰利品並給予經驗值。消耗的花瓣數量與受影響怪物的強度成正比。無法對傳奇怪物造成影響。",
		["Consumes Petals to cause affected nearby monsters to have 200% increased Item Rarity and convert non-unique equipment items to Gold. The number of Petals consumed is proportional to the Power of affected monsters."]="消耗花瓣，使物品稀有度增加 200%，並把非傳奇裝備物品轉化成金幣。消耗的花瓣數量與受影響怪物的強度成正比。",
		["Consumes Petals to cause affected nearby monsters to have a chance to gain bonus rewards and 100% increased Toughness. Higher rarity monsters have a higher chance to gain rewards. The number of Petals consumed is proportional to the Power of affected monsters."]="消耗花瓣，使附近受影響的怪物有機會掉落額外獎勵，並使堅韌增加 100%。怪物的稀有度越高，掉落獎勵的機率也越高。消耗的花瓣數量與受影響怪物的強度成正比。",
		["Consumes Petals to cause affected nearby monsters to have either 200% more item quantity or 90% less item quantity, and have all non-unique dropped items be of the same type. The number of Petals consumed is proportional to the Power of affected monsters."]="消耗花瓣，使附近受影響的怪物有 200% 更多物品數量或 90% 更少物品數量，且掉落的所有非傳奇物品會是相同類型。消耗的花瓣數量與受影響怪物的強度成正比。",
		["Consumes Petals to cause affected nearby monsters to not be able to drop items that can have rarity. The number of Petals consumed is proportional to the Power of affected monsters."]="消耗花瓣，使附近受影響的怪物無法掉落具有稀有度的物品。消耗的花瓣數量與受影響怪物的強度成正比。",
		["Consumes Petals to cause affected nearby normal monsters to have a chance to be upgraded to magic or rare rarity."]="消耗花瓣，使附近受影響的普通怪物有機會升級成魔法或稀有怪。",
		["Consumes Petals to extract Souls from nearby monsters. The number of Petals consumed is proportional to the Power of nearby monsters."]="消耗花瓣，從附近的怪物抽取靈魂。消耗的花瓣數量與附近怪物的強度成正比。",
		["Consumes Petals to gain the modifiers of affected nearby magic and rare monsters for 30 seconds. The number of Petals consumed is proportional to the Power of affected monsters."]="消耗花瓣，獲得附近受影響的魔法和稀有怪物的詞綴，持續 30 秒。消耗的花瓣數量與受影響怪物的強度成正比。",
		["Consumes Rage at an accelerating rate to increase the effects of Rage."]="以逐漸加快的速度消耗盛怒，以強化盛怒的效果。",
		["Consumes a corpse, and sacrifices a portion of your life, granting your minions life regeneration based on the life sacrificed, and a bonus to damage. The skill consumes other nearby corpses, increasing the duration and life regeneration for each corpse consumed."]="消耗一個屍體和獻祭你的部分生命，根據獻祭的生命給與召喚物生命回復和傷害加成。技能會消耗附近其他屍體，每消耗一個屍體會增加持續時間和生命回復。",
		["Consumes a corpse, granting all of your minions the power to block both attacks and spells. The skill consumes other nearby corpses, increasing the duration for each corpse consumed."]="獻祭一具屍體，使你的召喚物獲得格擋攻擊與法術的能力。這個技能會持續獻祭附近的屍體，每具獻祭的屍體將會延長強化召喚物的時間。",
		["Consumes a corpse, granting increased critical strike chance and additional critical strike multiplier to your minions. The skill consumes other nearby corpses, increasing the duration for each corpse consumed."]="消耗一具屍體，給予你的召喚物增加暴擊率和暴擊加成。此技能會消耗其他在附近的屍體，每具消耗的屍體會增加持續時間。",
		["Consumes a corpse, which temporarily empowers your minions with swiftness. The skill consumes other nearby corpses, increasing the duration for each corpse consumed."]="獻祭一具屍體，短暫的強化與加速你的召喚物。這個技能會持續獻祭附近的屍體，每具獻祭的屍體將會延長強化召喚物的時間。",
		["Consumes a spirit charge to fire projectiles which deals physical damage."]="消耗一個靈體能量球發射投射物，造成物理傷害。",
		["Consumes a targeted corpse, granting you a buff that gives you bonuses against enemies of the same monster category as the corpse."]="消耗指定的屍體，給予你增益效果，使你對與屍體種類相同的怪物有額外加成。",
		["Continuously launches a torrent of fire from your hand, repeatedly damaging enemies. As you channel this spell longer, the flames spread wider close to you and spread longer directly in front of you."]="持續從手中散發出火焰之柱，持續對敵人造成傷害。你引導施放此技能越久，火焰會在你面前擴散更廣更遠。",
		["Continuously launches a torrent of fire from your hand, repeatedly damaging enemies. As you channel this spell longer, the flames spread wider close to you and spread longer directly in front of you. When you stop channelling you release a slow-moving wave of fire damage over a very large area that will apply a powerful Ignite."]="持續從手中散發出火焰之柱，持續對敵人造成傷害。你引導施放此技能越久，火焰會在你面前擴散更廣更遠。當你停止引導施放時，你釋放出一個緩慢移動的火焰傷害波，覆蓋一個非常大的區域，並造成強大的點燃。",
		["Continuously launches a torrent of fire from your hand, repeatedly damaging enemies. As you channel this spell longer, the flames spread wider close to you and spread longer directly in front of you. When you stop channelling you release a wave of fire damage over a wide and long area that will apply a powerful Ignite."]="持續從手中散發出火焰之柱，持續對敵人造成傷害。你引導施放此技能越久，火焰會在你面前擴散更廣更遠。當你停止引導施放時，你會對廣大的範圍釋放一道火焰造成強大的點燃。",
		["Continuously launches a torrent of fire from your hand. The longer you channel this spell, the larger and more damaging the flames become."]="持續從手中散發出火焰之柱。當你站在同個地點引導的時間越久，火焰的範圍和傷害都會隨之增加。",
		["Continuously launches unpredictable sparks in all directions that move randomly until they hit an enemy or expire."]="持續的施放出大量變幻莫測的電球，這些電球將會隨機移動直到撞到敵人或是自然消失。",
		["Corpses near the targeted location explode, dealing damage in a small area and creating an orb which detonates after a duration, dealing spell damage in a larger area. The explosion of the corpse is not affected by modifiers to spell damage, and cannot be reflected."]="目標附近的屍體爆炸造成小範圍傷害，並製造一個熔核，在一段時間後爆炸，造成較大的範圍傷害。屍體爆炸不受法術屬性影響且不能被反射。",
		["Corpses near the targeted location explode, dealing damage in a small area and creating an orb which moves towards nearby enemies before dealing spell damage in a larger area. The explosion of the corpse is not affected by modifiers to spell damage, and cannot be reflected."]="目標附近的屍體爆炸造成小範圍傷害，並製造一個熔核朝附近敵人移動造成較大的範圍傷害。屍體爆炸不受法術屬性影響且不能被反射。",
		["Create a Tornado of a random element that hinders and repeatedly damages enemies around it, converting physical damage to its element. The Tornado will chase down enemies for a duration."]="製造1道隨機元素的龍捲風，干擾並持續傷害附近的敵人。龍捲風會將物理傷害轉為其元素，還會追擊敵人一小段時間。",
		["Create a Tornado that hinders and repeatedly damages enemies around it. It will move forward for a duration, during which your projectiles can collide with it to deal damage as though it was an enemy. Then it will chase down enemies for a secondary duration, and reflect a portion of the damage it took from your projectiles to them in addition to its own damage."]="製造一個龍捲風，持續對附近的敵人造成傷害。它會向前移動一段時間，在此期間你的投射物可以它碰撞並造成傷害，就像它是敵人一樣。 然後它會在第二階段持續時間追擊敵人，並將它從你的投射物中受到的傷害的一部分反射給他們，而不是它自己的傷害。",
		["Create a burst of lightning from your Bow, firing no arrows but damaging enemies in a cone in front of you."]="從你的弓中創造出一道閃電爆發，不發射箭矢，但對你前方的扇形範圍內的敵人造成傷害。",
		["Create a slipstream at your location."]="在你的位置製造一道氣流。",
		["Create a sphere of water, or move an existing sphere and reset its duration. The sphere continually applies a drenched debuff with a short duration to enemies in its area or those it moves through. You can hit the sphere with other skills to inflict Cold and Lightning Ailments (other than Chill). The sphere pulses when created, at regular intervals while afflicted by an Ailment, and after moving, damaging all drenched enemies in a large area."]="製造一顆水球，或移動現有的球並重置它的持續時間。水球持續對範圍內或穿過它的敵人造成一個短時間的濕透減益效果。你可以使用其他技能攻擊水球，使其造成冰冷和閃電異常狀態（除了冰緩）。水球被製造出來時產生脈衝，當被異常狀態影響時會有頻率的發射脈衝，並在移動後對大範圍已濕透的敵人造成傷害。",
		["Create a wall of fire for a duration, which deals burning damage to everything in its area. Each enemy that enters the wall also receives a secondary burning debuff which persists for a short duration after leaving the wall. Any projectiles fired through the wall by you and allies deal added fire damage and apply the wall's secondary debuff on hit."]="製造一面火牆持續一段時間，並對範圍內造成燃燒傷害。敵人進入牆時會受到第二階段的燃燒減益效果，並在離開牆後持續一小段時間。你和友方發射的任何投射物穿過牆，都會附加火焰傷害，並在擊中時造成第二階段的減益效果。",
		["Create a wall of fire for a duration, which deals burning damage to everything in its area. Each enemy that enters the wall also receives a secondary burning debuff which persists for a short duration after leaving the wall. Any projectiles fired through the wall by you and allies fork, deal added fire damage and apply the wall's secondary debuff on hit."]="製造一面火牆持續一段時間，並對範圍內造成燃燒傷害。敵人進入牆時會受到第二階段的燃燒減益效果，並在離開牆後持續一小段時間。你和友方發射的任何投射物穿過牆都會分裂，造成附加火焰傷害並在擊中時造成第二階段的減益效果。",
		["Creates a Dark Effigy tethered to you. It's level matches your own. You and the Effigy take damage for each other. The Effigy is destroyed if you get too far away from it."]="製造一個黑暗雕像連結你。它的等級與你相同。你和雕像互相替對方承受傷害。若你離雕像太遠，則雕像會被摧毀。",
		["Creates a Gravity Sphere which Hinders enemies in an area around it, with the debuff being stronger on enemies closer to the sphere. The Gravity Sphere will consume the corpses of any enemies which die in its area. Can only have one Gravity Sphere at a time."]="製造一個重力象限，阻礙它範圍內的敵人，越靠近它的敵人受到更強減益效果的影響。重力象限會吞噬任何在它範圍內死亡的敵人。同時只能有一個重力象限。",
		["Creates a Lesser Shrine, which will grant a bonus when touched. The Lesser Shrine will disappear after a short duration, or when used. This skill starts on cooldown."]="產生一座低階神殿，處碰後獲得其效果。神殿會在使用後，或時間經過後消失。此技能有初始冷卻時間。",
		["Creates a Petrification Statue in front of you, which will slow enemies with its gaze, until they become fully petrified."]="在你前面召喚一個石化雕像，它發出的凝視可以緩速敵人，直到他們被石化為止。",
		["Creates a Smoke Cloud in an area, which blinds enemies within it."]="製造一個範圍迷霧，致盲在裡面的敵人。",
		["Creates a Suspended Mirage - an astral-infused clone of yourself that is suspended in time, just before the release of the spellcast that triggered them. On reaching three Suspended Mirages, all Suspended Mirages will be released, using the spell which was cast to create them. Suspended Mirages are not created by Vaal spells, channelling spells, instant spells, or spells which create minions."]="你施放法術時會創造一道時禁幻影 - 一道以星界能量注能、在創造它的法術被釋放之前會被困在時間之中的星界分身。在你達到三道時禁幻影數量後，所有時禁幻影會一起被釋放，施放創造它的法術。時禁幻影無法透過瓦爾、引導、立即、和會創造召喚物的技能創造。",
		["Creates a Void Sphere which Hinders enemies in an area around it, with the debuff being stronger on enemies closer to the sphere. It also regularly releases pulses of area damage. The Void Sphere will consume the corpses of any enemies which die in its area. Can only have one Void Sphere at a time."]="製造一個虛無玉，阻礙它附近的敵人，越靠近它的敵人會受到更強大的減益效果。它同時會定期釋放範圍傷害的脈衝。虛無玉會吞噬在他附近死亡敵人的屍體。同時只能有一個虛無玉。",
		["Creates a ball of lightning at a location that damages each enemy in an area around it repeatedly with bolts of lightning. Cannot be supported by Spell Echo or used by Totems."]="在指定區域製造天雷之珠，對區域內的每個敵人反覆雷擊造成傷害。無法以施放迴響輔助或讓圖騰使用。",
		["Creates a clone of you that attacks with your weapon."]="製造一個與你使用同樣武器攻擊的複製體。此技能有短暫冷卻時間。",
		["Creates a crystal that pulses with cold for a duration. Each pulse applies a debuff to nearby enemies for a secondary duration which reduces life regeneration rate, and also inflicts Cold Exposure. When the crystal's duration ends, it explodes, dealing heavy cold damage to enemies around it."]="製造一個冰晶，在一段時間內發射冰霜脈衝。每次脈衝對對敵人到用二段持續時間的減益效果，減少生命回復率和造成冰冷曝曬。當冰晶的持續時間結束，它將會爆裂，並對敵人造成大量冰冷傷害。",
		["Creates a crystal which lasts for a duration. When the crystal's duration ends, it explodes, dealing cold damage to enemies around it."]="製造一個持續一段時間的水晶。當水晶的持續時間結束時，它爆炸，對附近的敵人造成冰冷傷害。",
		["Creates a crystal which lasts for a duration. When the crystal's duration ends, it explodes, dealing heavy cold damage to enemies around it."]="製造一個持續一段時間的水晶。當水晶的持續時間結束時，它爆炸，對附近的敵人造成大量冰冷傷害。",
		["Creates a giant barnacle that continually snaps at enemies, dealing off-hand area damage augmented by the defences of the shield. Increases and reductions to attack speed affect the rate at which damage occurs."]="創造一個巨大的藤壺，持續對敵人進行猛夾，造成根據盾牌防禦屬性強化的副手範圍傷害。對攻擊速度的增加與減少將會影響其傷害發生的頻率。",
		["Creates a magical brand which can attach to a nearby enemy, dealing cold damage over time and chilling them. It periodically activates while attached, gaining stages that raise the damage. When removed, a short-duration debuff dealing the same damage over time and chill is applied to each nearby enemy. The brand keeps its charges while detached."]="製造 1 個可以附著附近敵人的魔幻烙印，並造成冰冷持續傷害和冰緩他們。當附著時會定期啟動，獲得疊層提高傷害。當被移除時，會對附近每個敵人套用短暫的減益效果，造成相同的持續傷害和冰緩。",
		["Creates a magical brand which can attach to a nearby enemy. It activates once, causing a fiery meteor to fall from the sky, then is destroyed."]="製造一個可以附著於附近敵人的魔法烙印。它只會啟動一次，使天上落下熾炎的流星後被摧毀。",
		["Creates a magical brand which can attach to a nearby enemy. It periodically activates while attached, adding energy to the branded enemy and causing a pulse that deals damage to the branded enemy and other nearby enemies. The pulse gains area of effect and damage for each energy on the branded enemy, up to 20. All energy is removed from the enemy when the brand is detached."]="製造 1 個可以附著附近敵人的魔幻烙印。當附著時會定期啟動，對烙印的敵人附加能量，脈衝會對烙印的敵人和它附近造成傷害。根據烙印敵人身上的能量，最多 20 層，脈衝會獲得範圍效果和傷害。當烙印脫離時，移除敵人身上全部能量。",
		["Creates a magical brand which can attach to a nearby enemy. It periodically activates while attached, adding energy to the branded enemy and nearby enemies who do not have energy. When the brand is detached, all enemies with energy are dealt damage."]="製造 1 個可以附著附近敵人的魔幻烙印。當附著時會定期啟動，對烙印的敵人附加能量，也會對附近沒有能量的敵人附加。當烙印掉落時，全部有能量的敵人都會被傷害。",
		["Creates a magical brand which can attach to a nearby enemy. It periodically activates while attached, adding energy to the branded enemy. When the branded enemy reaches 20 energy, a large explosion occurs and the brand is removed. All energy is removed from the enemy when the brand is detached."]="製造 1 道魔幻烙印附著在鄰近敵人身上。烙印會定期啟動，對附著的敵人施加能量。一旦烙印的敵人身上能量達到 20 層，便會引發劇烈爆炸，並移除烙印。所有能量會隨著烙印一同移除。",
		["Creates a magical brand which can attach to a nearby enemy. It periodically activates while attached, causing a fiery meteor to fall from the sky. The brand will detach if the enemy dies."]="製造一個可以附著於附近敵人的魔法烙印。當附著時，會定期發動從天上落下熾炎的流星。當敵人死亡時烙印會掉落。",
		["Creates a magical brand which can attach to a nearby enemy. It periodically activates while attached, firing a beam which deals damage to the branded enemy and those around it. The brand will detach if the enemy dies."]="製造一個可以附著於附近敵人的魔法烙印。當附著時，會定期發動向附近敵人和他們周圍發射一道光束造成傷害。當敵人死亡時烙印會掉落。",
		["Creates a magical brand which can attach to a nearby enemy. It periodically activates while attached, firing beams which deal damage to nearby enemies and those around them. The brand will detach if the enemy dies."]="製造一個可以附著於附近敵人的魔法烙印。當附著時，會定期發動向附近敵人和他們周圍發射光束造成傷害。當敵人死亡時烙印會掉落。",
		["Creates a magical brand which can attach to a nearby enemy. It periodically activates while attached, triggering linked spells. The brand will detach if the enemy dies."]="製造 1 個可以附著附近敵人的魔幻烙印。當附著時會定期啟動，觸發連結的法術。當敵人死亡時烙印會分離。",
		["Creates a new home for your pet Raccoon."]="為你的寵物：浣熊做一個新家。",
		["Creates a number of markers around the targeted location, which will explode after a duration, dealing lightning damage. Cannot be supported by Spell Cascade."]="在目標位置附近製造數個印記，一段時間後會爆炸並造成閃電傷害。不能被秘能爆發輔助。",
		["Creates a patch of Fungal Ground at the targeted location."]="在指定位置製造一道毒菌地面。",
		["Creates a patch of Shocked Ground in a radius around you."]="在你的周圍產生一塊感電地面。",
		["Creates a patch of Shocked Ground."]="在你的周圍產生一塊感電地面。",
		["Creates a portal to the current area's town."]="開啟一個連結城鎮的時空之門。",
		["Creates a stationary electrical orb that strikes enemies in its area of effect with beams of lightning that can then split to hit more enemies. Modifiers to cast speed will increase how frequently it does this. Casting this skill again will replace the previous orb."]="創造出一個靜止的帶電球體，在其範圍內以電光打擊敵人，電光可裂化並擊中更多敵人。施放速度詞綴會增加此頻率。再次使用技能會取代原先的球體。",
		["Creates a sudden burst of cold around you, damaging enemies. This also creates a chilling area around you which expands and deals cold damage over time to surrounding enemies in addition to chilling them. Enemies that die while in the area grant Frenzy Charges, and you will passively gain Frenzy Charges while there are enemies in the area."]="在你周圍製造瞬間冰爆，對敵人造成傷害。同時在你周圍製造一個擴散的冰緩區域，範圍內的敵人除了被冰緩也會受到冰冷持續傷害。敵人死於範圍內時獲得狂怒球，並且範圍內有敵人時你會獲得狂怒球。",
		["Creates a sudden burst of cold in a targeted area, damaging enemies. Also creates an expanding area which is filled with chilled ground, and deals cold damage over time to enemies. Enemies that die while in the area have a chance to grant Frenzy Charges. The cooldown can be bypassed by expending a Frenzy Charge."]="在指定地點製造瞬間冰爆，對範圍內敵人造成傷害。同時也對範圍產生冰緩地面，並對擴散範圍內的敵人造成持續冰冷傷害。敵人死於範圍內有機率使你獲得狂怒球。可以消耗 1 顆狂怒球無視冷卻時間。",
		["Creates a sudden burst of cold in a targeted area, damaging enemies. The cooldown can be bypassed by expending a Power Charge."]="在指定地點製造瞬間冰爆，對範圍內敵人造成傷害。可以消耗 1 顆暴擊球無視冷卻時間。",
		["Creates a voidstorm that blinds enemies within it. Entering the storm will cause it to explode, dealing attack damage in an area."]="產生一個能致盲其區域內敵人的虛空風暴。進入風暴將會使其引爆，並在區域內造成攻擊傷害。",
		["Creates a volcanic geyser at a location, which will repeatedly unleash projectiles sequentially over the surrounding area for a duration."]="製造火山噴泉，在一段時間內會連續釋放爆炸性的投射物來攻擊附近的區域。",
		["Creates a wall of force which allies and enemies can pass through, but allied projectiles which can collide with enemies will also collide with this wall, and can chain from it to other targets. Projectiles can only collide with a single Wall of Force, and no more than once."]="創造一道友方和敵人皆可穿越的力量之牆。能夠與敵方碰撞的友方投射物將會與此牆發生碰撞，並從牆上連鎖至附近目標。每一投射物只能與力量之牆碰撞一次。",
		["Creates a wall of ice which holds back enemies. Targets under the wall are damaged and pushed back, with more damage dealt the more frost walls are currently active."]="聚集空氣中的水分，製造一堵能阻擋敵人行動的冰牆。在冰牆成形位置的敵人將會受到傷害並且被擊退，同時存在的冰牆越多，造成的傷害就越高。",
		["Creates a wall of ice which holds back enemies. Targets under the wall are damaged and pushed back."]="聚集空氣中的水分，製造一堵能阻擋敵人行動的冰牆。在冰牆成形位置的敵人將會受到傷害並且被擊退。",
		["Creates already-caught projectiles without firing them first, both immediately and over a secondary duration. Caught projectiles spiral outwards when you use Whirling Blades and do not return. Requires a Dagger or Claw."]="在不先發射的情況下立即和在次要持續時間內，製造已接住的投射物。當你使用迴旋之刃時，接住的投射物會向外旋轉並不會返回。限定匕首或爪。",
		["Creates an Abyssal Maw which Hinders enemies in an area around it, with the debuff being stronger on enemies closer to the Maw. Pulses from the Maw will draw enemies in, while also inflicting a potent damage over time debuff. The Maw will consume any corpses within its area. Can only have one Maw at a time."]="製造一個深淵之口，阻礙它附近的敵人，越靠近它的敵人會受到更強大的減益效果。它同時會定期釋放範圍傷害的脈衝。深淵之口會吞噬在他附近死亡敵人的屍體。同時只能有一個深淵之口。",
		["Creates an Eternity Sphere at your location, which reduces the Action Speed of enemies within it. The amount of Action Speed reduction applied by the sphere decreases to zero over its duration."]="在你的位置製造一個永恆的領域，減少範圍內敵人的行動速度。行動速度減少總量為其持續時間內減少到零。",
		["Creates an area of Consecrated Ground, providing life regeneration and reducing the effect of curses for you and allies who stand in it."]="奉獻一塊地面，提供站在上方的你和友方生命回復和減少詛咒效果。",
		["Creates an electrical orb that will strike enemies in its area of effect with beams of lightning when placed, as well as when you use a lightning skill while within its area. These beams of lightning can then split to hit more enemies. When striking enemies, this orb will teleport to a random enemy struck. Casting this skill again will replace the previous orb."]="創造出一個帶電球體，放置時在其範圍內以電光打擊敵人，當你在其範圍內使用閃電技能時也會觸發電光。電光可裂化並擊中更多敵人。當電光擊中敵人時，球體會傳送至隨機一個被擊中的敵人位置。再次使用技能會取代原先的球體。",
		["Creates an independently-moving vortex of ethereal blades which lasts for a duration. The vortex moves toward nearby enemies, repeatedly damaging enemies that it passes through."]="製造獨立行動的虛空刀刃持續一段時間。刀刃會飛向附近的敵人並持續穿透他們造成傷害。",
		["Creates an orb which moves towards nearby enemies, exploding after a duration or when it gets close enough. The explosion deals cold spell damage in an area, and leaves behind a Vortex on the ground for a secondary duration which continues to deal cold damage over time and chill enemies caught in it."]="製造一個球體朝附近敵人移動，並在一段時間內爆炸或是夠靠近敵人。爆炸後造成範圍內冰冷法術傷害，並流下漩渦持續造成冰冷傷害和緩速敵人。",
		["Creates markers at your location and a targeted location, which grow over time based on cast speed, then explode, dealing fire damage. Cannot be supported by Spell Cascade."]="在你和目標位置製造印記，根據施放速度持續成長直到爆炸，造成火焰傷害。不能被秘能爆發輔助。",
		["Creates multiple fissures that deal area damage while travelling outwards. Requires an Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Staff or Unarmed."]="產生多個向外延伸並造成範圍傷害的裂隙。需裝備斧、錘、權杖、長杖或空手。",
		["Curse all targets in an area, causing them to take increased physical damage. Attacks against the cursed enemies have a chance to inflict bleeding."]="對目標區域降下詛咒，受到詛咒的敵人將會增加受到的物理傷害。攻擊被詛咒的敵人有機率造成流血。",
		["Curses a single enemy, causing them to spawn multiple phantasms when hit. The phantasms will be allies of the marked enemy with the same monster level. They cast a projectile spell which deals physical damage, and are immune to curses and knockback. You can only have one Mark at a time."]="詛咒單一敵人，使它們被擊中時產生多個幻影。幻影為印記敵人的友方，且有著相同的怪物等級。它們施放造成物理傷害的投射物法術，且免疫詛咒和擊退。你同時只能印記一個敵人。",
		["Curses a single enemy, giving a chance to double the duration of stuns on them. Attacking the cursed enemy will leech life and mana, stunning them will grant rage, and killing it will grant an endurance charge. You can only have one Mark at a time."]="詛咒敵人，有機率使受到詛咒的敵人暈眩兩倍的時間。在攻擊帶有印記的敵人時會獲得額外的生命與魔力偷取，造成暈眩時會獲得盛怒，此外在擊殺帶有印記的敵人時會有機會獲得耐力球。你同時只能有一個印記。",
		["Curses a single enemy, granting flask charges when you hit them and creating Burning Ground under them if your hit Ignites them, and Caustic Ground if it Poisons them. Damage modifiers do not apply to these ground effects. You can only have one Mark at a time."]="詛咒敵人，當你擊中他們時獲得藥劑充能，若你的擊中點燃或擊中造成中毒，會在敵人下方製造燃燒地面和腐蝕地面。傷害詞綴不會套用至地面效果。你同時只能有一個印記。",
		["Curses a single enemy, increasing the damage they take from projectiles, and making projectiles split when hitting them, to hit other targets around them. You can only have one Mark at a time."]="詛咒敵人，受到詛咒的敵人增加承受投射物傷害，且投射物擊中他們時會裂化並擊中附近目標。你同時只能有一個印記。",
		["Curses a single enemy, lowering their physical damage reduction, and adding physical damage to all hits against them. Attacking the cursed enemy will grant life and mana, and killing them will grant a frenzy charge. You can only have one Mark at a time."]="詛咒敵人，降低他們的物理傷害減免，且對他們的擊中附加物理傷害。在命中帶有印記的敵人時會獲得生命、魔力，在擊殺怪物時會獲得狂怒球。你同時只能有一個印記。",
		["Curses a single enemy, making them more vulnerable to Critical Strikes. Killing the cursed enemy will grant life and mana, and a power charge. You can only have one Mark at a time."]="詛咒敵人，受到詛咒的敵人更容易受到更多暴擊傷害。此外，在擊殺帶有印記的敵人時會獲得生命與魔力，並有機會獲得暴擊球。你同時只能有一個印記。",
		["Curses all enemies in an area, lowering their action speed and making other effects on them expire more slowly."]="對目標區域降下詛咒，受到詛咒的敵人變慢，並且延長它們所受到的效果之持續時間。",
		["Curses all targets in an area, causing them to be debilitated when they hit enemies and increasing damage they take while on low life."]="對目標區域降下詛咒，擊中敵人時使他們虛弱並在貧血時增加承受傷害。",
		["Curses all targets in an area, having no effect at first, but causing them to deal no damage once 60% of the curse's duration has expired."]="平靜詛咒區域內全部目標，初始沒有效果，但當詛咒的持續時間失效 60% 時，始他們不造成傷害",
		["Curses all targets in an area, lowering their chaos resistance."]="對目標區域降下詛咒，降低目標混沌抗性。",
		["Curses all targets in an area, lowering their cold resistance and giving them a chance to be frozen when hit."]="對目標區域降下詛咒，使受到詛咒敵人的冰冷抗性降低，並在被擊中時時有機率被冰凍。",
		["Curses all targets in an area, lowering their elemental resistances."]="對目標區域降下詛咒，受到詛咒的敵人對於元素的抗性將會降低。",
		["Curses all targets in an area, lowering their fire resistance and giving them a chance to be ignited when hit."]="對目標區域降下詛咒，使受到詛咒敵人的火焰抗性降低，並在被擊中時時有機率被點燃。",
		["Curses all targets in an area, lowering their lightning resistance and giving them a chance to be shocked when hit."]="對目標區域降下詛咒，使受到詛咒敵人的閃電抗性降低，並在被擊中時時有機率被感電。",
		["Curses all targets in an area, reducing their accuracy and making them deal less damage."]="對目標區域降下詛咒，受到詛咒的敵人降低命中和造成更少傷害。",
		["DNT Unused (replaced)"]="施展戰吼，使自身和盟友傷害和魔力恢復增加。 傷害增加量隨著周圍敵人數量提升。 嘲諷周圍所有敵人，使他們攻擊施放者。 與其他戰吼技能共用技能冷卻。",
		["Damage enemies around you, then perform a spinning series of attacks as you travel to a target location. Cannot be supported by Ruthless or Multistrike."]="對周圍敵人造成傷害，接而進行一連串的旋轉攻擊，邊向目標地點前進邊攻擊路徑上的敵人。不能被多重打擊或殘暴輔助。",
		["Damages enemies in an area, applying a debuff for a short duration. If a non-unique enemy dies while affected by the debuff, the corpse will be consumed to summon a Sentinel of Absolution for a secondary duration, or to refresh the duration and life of an existing one instead if you have the maximum number of them."]="對範圍內敵人造成傷害，套用一小段時間的減益效果。若非傳奇敵人被此減益效果影響時死亡，屍體會被消耗來召喚 1 個二階持續時間的赦免護衛，或是若你的護衛數量達最大上限，則刷新現有的生命和持續時間。",
		["Damaging cones of lightning surround you."]="在你的四周造成扇形的閃電傷害。此技能有短暫冷卻時間。",
		["Dash backwards, leaving a short-lived mist copy of yourself that Taunts nearby Enemies for a short duration. The copy can be damaged by Enemies, and copies that are killed by an Enemy will apply a debuff in an area that makes affected targets take 30% increased Damage and deal 30% less Damage for 4 seconds."]="向後衝刺，留下一個模仿自身的短暫迷霧複製體。複製體有你一小部分的生命，且可以被敵人攻擊。被敵人破壞的複製體會在一定範圍內施加使被影響目標承受30%更多傷害、和造成30%更少傷害的減益，持續4秒。",
		["Deals a portion of your main hand damage in an area around you and creates Consecrated Ground, causing you and your allies to regenerate life."]="在你的四周製造奉獻地面，並造成一定比例的主手武器傷害。奉獻地面增加你和你的友方額外生命回復。此技能有短暫冷卻時間。",
		["Deals attack damage in an area."]="製造範圍攻擊傷害。",
		["Deals attack damage in an area. A number of enemies hit by the wave will release an additional wave."]="在區域內造成攻擊傷害。若震波擊中一定數量敵人將會釋放出額外的一道震波。",
		["Deals chaos damage in an area."]="對區域造成混沌傷害。",
		["Deals chaos damage to a single enemy, dealing more damage if they are Hexed, then removing the Hex. If the enemy was Hexed, also deals area damage to other enemies around the target, boosting damage and removing Hexes from those enemies in the same way."]="對單一敵人造成混沌傷害，若敵人被咒術則造成更多傷害，並移除咒術。若敵人被咒術，會對目標附近敵人造成範圍傷害，同樣以此方式，從這些敵人的加成效果和移除咒術。",
		["Deals chaos damage to a single enemy. If the enemy was Hexed, also deals area damage to other enemies around the target."]="對單一敵人造成混沌傷害。若敵人被咒術，會對目標附近敵人造成範圍傷害。",
		["Deals lightning damage based upon your missing mana in a circular area around the targeted location, as well as in four rectangular extensions whose lengths depend upon your remaining mana."]="對目標區域造成環形閃電傷害，和四個方形延伸區域造成閃電傷害，其長度將根據你剩餘的魔力。根據你遺失的魔力造成額外的閃電傷害。",
		["Deals spell damage in a targeted area. Each time this spell deals damage,  it will detonate any of your Lingering Blades it touches, dealing damage again in an area around them. Up to 50 Blades can be detonated this way."]="對目標區域造成法術傷害。每次此法術造成傷害，你剩餘的劍刃在接觸時引爆，並在它們附近再次造成傷害。至多 50 把劍刃可透過此方式引爆。",
		["Deals spell damage in an area around you. If you have Blade Vortex blades orbiting you, it will detonate each of them in turn, dealing damage again in an area around you for each one."]="對你附近區域造成法術傷害。若你有飛刃風暴圍繞你，它將依次引爆，每個對你附近區域再次造成傷害。",
		["Deals spell damage in an area around you. Your equipped daggers add to this damage."]="對你附近區域造成法術傷害。你裝備中的匕首附加至此傷害。",
		["Desecrates the ground, spawning corpses based on monsters in the current area and dealing chaos damage over time to enemies. If you are using the Raise Spectre skill there is a chance to spawn spectral corpses matching your most recently raised Spectres. Spectral corpses cannot be interacted with except by Minion skills."]="腐化一塊地面，基於當前區域內的怪物生成屍體，並對敵人造成持續性的混沌傷害。如果你正在使用喚醒幽魂技能，有機率生成與你最近召喚的幽魂同樣的幽魂亡體。除了召喚物技能外，不能以其他方式與幽魂亡體互動。",
		["Detonates a Mine, starting a Detonation Sequence which will detonate other Mines around it."]="引爆地雷開始爆炸序列，會引爆附近其他地雷。",
		["Die?"]="死？",
		["Direct your feline companion to mesmerize another player's pet."]="命令竊靈夥伴催眠另一名玩家的寵物。",
		["Direct your finned companion to feast upon another player's pet."]="指揮你的有鰭夥伴去盡情享用另一名玩家的寵物。",
		["Direct your flying companion to eviscerate another player's pet."]="指示你的飛行夥伴將另一名玩家的寵物開腸剖腹。",
		["Directs your ants to move to the target location."]="引導你的螞蟻移動到指定位置。",
		["Discharge all the character's charges to deal elemental damage to all nearby monsters."]="釋放角色身上所有的充能球並對周圍所有敵人造成元素傷害。",
		["Discharges Endurance Charges, making the character invulnerable to physical damage for a short time, proportional to how many endurance charges were expended."]="仰天怒吼，釋放耐力球，並使你的角色免疫物理攻擊一小段時間。免疫物理攻擊時間長短視釋放的耐力球數量而定。\n「金！鐘！罩！」",
		["Discharges Endurance Charges, making the character unable to die or gain Vaal souls for a short time, proportional to how many endurance charges were expended."]="消耗耐力球，根據消耗的耐力球，使你的角色在一段時間無法死亡或無法獲得瓦爾靈魂。",
		["Disguise yourself as an inanimate object."]="將自己偽裝成無生命的物體。",
		["Dive through enemies, dealing weapon damage. If dual wielding attacks with both weapons, dealing the damage of both in one hit. Only works with Daggers, Claws, and One-Handed Swords."]="迅速穿越敵人並同時造成武器傷害。如果雙持武器攻擊，會使用兩把武器打出一次性傷害。限定匕首、爪以及單手劍。",
		["Draws out your own blood to power a buff for a duration, letting this skill inflict the Corrupting Blood debuff on enemies you hit, dealing physical damage over time for a short secondary duration. The buff's duration will be refreshed if you spend enough life before it expires."]="抽出你自己的鮮血來加強增益效果，對你擊中的敵人造成腐化之血減益效果，在二階段短期間造成物理持續傷害。若你在增益效果失效前消耗足量的血，可以刷新持續時間。",
		["Drops a Flare at your feet. The Flare temporarily illuminates an area, protecting those within its radius from the darkness. The Flare fades over its duration."]="在你的腳下投擲一個閃光。閃光短暫的照亮該地區，保護在它的光線範圍內的事物，免於黑暗侵襲。閃光會隨著時間逝去。",
		["Drops a meteor from above on a nearby foe, dealing fire damage in an area around them."]="從天上降下一顆隕石，對周圍敵人造成火焰傷害。此技能有短暫冷卻時間。",
		["Each attack with a melee weapon will choose an element at random, and will only be able to deal damage of that element. If the attack hits an enemy, it will deal damage in an area around them, with the radius being larger if that enemy is suffering from an ailment of the chosen element. It will avoid choosing the same element twice in a row."]="每次使用此近戰武器攻擊將會隨機選擇 1 種元素，並只會使用該元素造成傷害。攻擊擊中敵人時會對周圍的敵人造成傷害，若被攻擊的敵人已經受到被選中元素的異常狀態，半徑會更大。不會連續選擇到相同的元素。",
		["Each attack with this skill will choose an element at random, and will only be able to deal damage of that element. If the attack hits an enemy, it will deal damage in an area around them, with the radius being larger if that enemy is suffering from an ailment of the chosen element. It will avoid choosing the same element twice in a row."]="每次使用此技能攻擊將會隨機選擇1種元素，並只會使用該元素造成傷害。攻擊擊中敵人時會對周圍的敵人造成傷害，若被攻擊的敵人已經受到被選中元素的異常狀態，半徑會更大。不會連續選擇到相同的元素。",
		["Each cast of this spell waits for a short duration, releasing a burst of lightning and chaos spell damage in an area around you when that duration ends. Enemies killed by this damage, or shortly after, will explode. The explosions of the corpses are not affected by modifiers to spell damage, and cannot be reflected."]="該法術的每次施展都會在短時間內為你施加一個增益效果，當該增益效果結束時，會在你附近的區域釋放一陣閃電和混沌法術傷害。被這種傷害殺死的敵人或在短時間內死亡都會爆炸。屍體的爆炸不受法術傷害詞綴的影響，也不會被反射。",
		["Each supported spell skill will be triggered when you die. Cannot support skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Vaal skills, channelling skills, and skills with a reservation cannot be triggered."]="當你死亡時觸發所有輔助寶石。不能輔助圖騰、陷阱和地雷技能。瓦爾技能、引導時施放技能和保留技能無法被觸發。",
		["Each supported spell skill will be triggered when your Ward breaks. Cannot support skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Vaal skills, channelling skills, and skills with a reservation cannot be triggered."]="當你的保護破碎時會觸發每一個被輔助的法術技能。無法輔助由圖騰、陷阱、或地雷使用的技能。瓦爾技能、引導技能、和有保留需求的技能無法被觸發。",
		["Each supported spell skill will have a chance to be triggered when you are stunned. Cannot support skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Vaal skills, channelling skills, and skills with a reservation cannot be triggered."]="當你被暈眩時有機率觸發所有輔助寶石。不能輔助圖騰、陷阱和地雷技能。瓦爾技能、引導時施放技能和保留技能無法被觸發。",
		["Each supported spell skill will track damage you take, and be triggered when the total damage taken reaches a threshold. Cannot support skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Vaal skills, channelling skills, and skills with a reservation cannot be triggered."]="當受到一定程度的傷害時會觸發所有輔助的寶石。不能輔助圖騰、陷阱和地雷技能。瓦爾技能、引導時施放技能和保留技能無法被觸發。",
		["Each supported spell will track how much mana you spend on it, granting a buff when the total mana spent reaches a threshold. Cannot support skills used by totems, traps, mines or skills with a reservation."]="當被輔助的法術消耗一定的魔力會獲得增益效果。不能輔助圖騰、陷阱、地雷或有保留的技能。",
		["Enchants your shield with the power of storms, which lashes out to deal arcing lightning damage to attackers when you block them."]="以暴風之力強化你的盾牌，當你格擋攻擊時將會對攻擊者造成閃電傷害。",
		["Enemies affected by this aura will be dealt damage on using a movement skill"]="在此光環下的敵人使用位移技能時會受到傷害",
		["Enemies affected by this aura will take increased damage from all sources"]="在此光環下的敵人會增加受到的傷害",
		["Enemies hit by this nova will bleed"]="被此冰霜擊中的敵人會流血",
		["Enemies hit by this nova will lose half of their current stored flask charges"]="被此冰霜擊中的敵人會失去目前一半的藥劑充能",
		["Engulfs you in magical fire that rapidly burns you and nearby enemies. Your cast speed is substantially increased while under this effect. The effect ends when you have 1 life remaining. Requires mana."]="以魔法之火快速的燃燒自己及周圍的敵人。在此效果下，你的施放速度大幅增加。當你的生命只剩下 1 時將會自動停止此法術。需要魔力。",
		["Engulfs you in magical fire that rapidly burns you and nearby enemies. Your spell damage is substantially increased while under this effect. The effect ends when you have 1 life remaining."]="以魔法之火快速的燃燒自己及周圍的敵人。在此效果下，你的法術傷害大幅增加。當你的生命只剩下 1 時將會自動停止此法術。",
		["Engulfs you in magical lightning that rapidly damages nearby enemies and drains your mana. Your critical strike chance is substantially increased while under this effect. The effect ends when you have no mana remaining."]="讓閃電的能量滿溢，包覆住你全身。對周圍敵人造成大量傷害，並且持續消耗魔力。效果期間暴擊率大幅地增加，並且當魔力消耗殆盡時效果消失。",
		["Ethereal weapons rain from the sky, dealing damage to enemies in a sequence of volleys, each wider and more damaging than the last. Enemies can be hit multiple times where these overlap."]="從天空降下的虛空武器，對敵人連續發射造成傷害。每次降下的範圍都更廣，傷害也更大。敵人可被擊中複數次。",
		["Ethereal weapons rain from the sky, dealing damage to enemies in a sequence of volleys. Enemies can be hit multiple times where these overlap."]="從天空降下的虛空武器，對敵人連續發射造成傷害。敵人可被擊中複數次。",
		["Explodes an unused corpse, dealing fire damage to nearby enemies. Nearby corpses will also explode in a chain reaction. The explosions are not affected by modifiers to spell damage."]="使一個未使用過的屍體爆炸，對附近的敵人造成火焰傷害。附近未使用過的屍體也會連鎖爆炸。屍體爆炸不受法術傷害屬性影響。",
		["Fire a damaging projectile from your wand which aims itself towards an enemy and applies a shell to the first enemy struck. Damage from hits against that target is taken from the shell first. If fully depleted, the shell will explode, dealing area damage and firing a projectile at another target to apply a new shell to it. If multiple projectiles are fired by an exploding shell, only the first one to hit a target can apply a shell."]="用你的法杖發射一個能造成傷害的投射物，它會自動瞄準敵人並對第一個擊中的敵人施加一個護盾。對該目標造成的擊中傷害會優先由這個護盾承受。當護盾耗盡，將會爆炸，造成範圍傷害並向另一個目標發射一個投射物，對其施加一個新的護盾。如果一個爆炸的護盾發射多個投射物，只有第一個擊中目標的投射物能施加護盾。",
		["Fire a projectile from your wand that changes direction in a zig-zag pattern at regular intervals or when hitting enemies. Each time it changes direction, a secondary projectile breaks off, flying in the direction it changed away from."]="從你的法杖發射一個投射物，該投射物以規律或擊中敵人時，以 Z 字型改變方向。每次改變方向，二階段投射物會爆開，並朝另一個方向飛去。",
		["Fire a projectile from your wand that changes direction in a zig-zag pattern at regular intervals or when hitting enemies. Each time it changes direction, a secondary projectile breaks off, flying in the direction it changed away from. Multiple of these projectiles can hit the same target."]="從你的法杖發射一個投射物，該投射物以規律或擊中敵人時，以 Z 字型改變方向。每次改變方向，二階段投射物會爆開，並朝另一個方向飛去。這些投射物可以擊中同個目標多次。",
		["Fire a single icy projectile that bursts on impact or when reaching the targeted area, dealing area damage and creating a chilling area that deals cold damage over time. This area will creep rapidly across the ground towards nearby enemies until its duration expires."]="射出一個寒冰投射物，在接觸到敵人或到達目標區域時會爆炸，造成範圍傷害和製造會造成冰冷持續傷害的冰緩區域。此冰緩區域會迅速蔓延至附近的敵人，直到它的持續時間結束。",
		["Fire a single projectile that splits on impact or at the targeted location, dealing area damage when it splits and again when the split projectiles explode at the end of their flight. Projectiles from this skill cannot return. Requires a Sword or Axe."]="發射單一投射物，在撞擊或抵達目標位置時裂化，當它裂化時會造成範圍傷害，裂化的投射物在飛行結束時會爆炸並再次造成範圍傷害。這個技能的投射物不會返回。需要劍或斧。",
		["Fire a trio of electrical arrows that quickly dissipate, vanishing shortly after being loosed. If the arrows' flight is stopped by colliding with a target, they create a burst of lightning, damaging enemies in a cone behind the target"]="發射迅速消逝的三支電流箭矢，如果箭矢的飛行被撞擊到目標而停止，它們將在目標後方創造一道閃電爆發，對敵人造成傷害。",
		["Fire a trio of electrical arrows that quickly dissipate, vanishing shortly after being loosed. The arrows are fired with such force that they create a burst of lightning, damaging enemies in a cone in front of you."]="發射迅速消逝的三支電流箭矢，它們在釋放後不久就消失。這些箭矢以極大的力量射出，製造出一道閃電爆發，對你前方扇形範圍內的敵人造成傷害。",
		["Fire an arrow that leaves a spore pod in its wake. The spore pod blooms, firing thorn arrows, which travel for a short time before dissipating. Modifiers that cause additional projectiles to be fired will only apply to the initial arrows, each of which leaves its own spore pod."]="發射會在軌道留下黴孢的的箭矢。黴孢會爆裂，發射荊棘箭矢，在飛行一小段時間就會消逝。發射額外投射物詞綴只會影響初始的箭矢，每到軌跡都會留下黴孢。",
		["Fire an icy projectile that bursts on impact or when reaching the targeted area, dealing area damage and creating a chilling area that deals cold damage over time. This area will creep across the ground towards nearby enemies until its duration expires."]="射出一個寒冰投射物，在接觸到敵人或到達目標區域時會爆炸，造成範圍傷害和製造會造成冰冷持續傷害的冰緩區域。此冰緩區域會蔓延至附近的敵人，直到它的持續時間結束。",
		["Fire arrows into the air that rain down around the targeted area, dealing area damage on impact and leaving the arrows stuck in the ground for a duration. If you move close to a stuck arrow, it will explode, dealing area damage and applying a fire damage over time debuff, as well as causing other stuck arrows in range to also explode."]="向空中射出箭矢，在目標區域周圍落下，命中時造成範圍傷害並使箭矢嵌在地面上一段時間。如果你接近嵌在地面上的箭矢，它將會爆炸，造成範圍傷害並施加一個造成火焰持續傷害的減益效果，同時引爆範圍內地面上的其他箭矢。",
		["Fire arrows into the air that rain down around the targeted area, dealing damage to enemies they hit and creating spore pods where they land. Each spore pod deals chaos damage over time to nearby enemies and slows their movement speed. The pods last for a duration before bursting, dealing area damage."]="朝空中發射數個箭矢並在目標區域如雨般降下，對擊中的敵人造成傷害並於它們降下的地方製造黴孢。每個黴孢對附近敵人造成混沌持續傷害並減緩它們的移動速度。短暫時間過後，黴孢會爆炸造成範圍傷害。",
		["Fire arrows into the air that rain down around the targeted area, dealing damage to enemies they hit and creating spore pods where they land. Each spore pod deals chaos damage over time to nearby enemies and withers them, causing them to take increased chaos damage. The pods last for a duration before bursting, dealing area damage."]="朝空中發射數個箭矢並在目標區域如雨般降下，對擊中的敵人造成傷害並於它們降下的地方製造黴孢。每個黴孢對附近敵人造成混沌持續傷害並凋零它們，使它們增加承受混沌傷害。短暫時間過後，黴孢會爆炸造成範圍傷害。",
		["Fire arrows into the air that rain down around the targeted area, dealing damage to enemies they hit and creating spore pods where they land. Each spore pod slows the movement speed of nearby enemies. The pods last for a duration before bursting, dealing area damage."]="朝空中發射數個箭矢並在目標區域如雨般降下，對擊中的敵人造成傷害並於它們降下的地方製造黴孢。每個黴孢對附近敵人減緩移動速度。短暫時間過後，黴孢會爆炸造成範圍傷害。",
		["Fire damages and ignites those around a targeted enemy. This effect chains and repeats on other enemy targets."]="對目標敵人周圍造成火焰傷害並點燃效果。此技能將會連鎖彈跳至另外一個敵人身上再進行一次攻擊。",
		["Fire icy projectiles around you in all directions."]="製造一個寒冰投射物的新星。",
		["Fires a burning arrow that deals fire damage and has a chance to ignite."]="發射一支燃燒箭矢並造成火焰傷害並有機率造成點燃。",
		["Fires a burst of three piercing projectiles in an arc in front of you."]="朝你前方以弧形發射出三枚穿透性投射物。",
		["Fires a chaining burst of ethereal blades."]="發射一連串的虛空飛刀。此技能有短暫冷卻時間。",
		["Fires a charged arrow which damages enemies by causing them to be struck by a bolt of lightning, which also damages a number of surrounding enemies."]="射出一發充滿閃電能量的箭矢，箭矢擊中敵人時會造成電擊，同時電擊附近一群敵人。",
		["Fires a charged arrow which damages enemies by causing them to be struck by a bolt of lightning. It sticks into the final target, causing them to be struck and damaged multiple times."]="射出一發充滿閃電能量的箭矢，箭矢擊中敵人時會造成電擊。它會卡在最終目標，使它們被電擊並重複造成傷害。",
		["Fires a circle of knives outwards around the caster which deal physical damage."]="向前依圓形射出虛空匕首，造成物理傷害。",
		["Fires a large number of arrows into the air, to land at the target after a short delay."]="對空射出無數箭矢，並在一段時間後如雨般灑落在目標區域。",
		["Fires a large number of arrows into the air, to land at the target after a short delay. Enemies hit by the arrows are pinned in place, unable to move for a time."]="對空射出無數箭矢，並在一段時間後如雨般灑落在目標區域。被擊中的敵人將被釘在原地無法移動一段時間。",
		["Fires a nova of projectiles which deal cold damage."]="以新星的方式釋放會對敵人造成冰霜傷害的投射物。",
		["Fires a piercing arrow that converts some physical damage to cold on its target and converts all physical damage to cold in two cones perpendicular to the target."]="發射一支能將部分物理傷害轉為冰冷傷害的穿刺箭，並將目標正反兩面扇形範圍的所有物理傷害轉為冰冷傷害。",
		["Fires a piercing projectile that applies a damage over time debuff when it hits. You are healed for a portion of the debuff damage."]="投射出一個造成持續性混沌傷害減益效果的穿透投射物。一部分減益效果的傷害將會回你的生命。",
		["Fires a piercing shot that travels until it reaches the targeted location. It will then fire projectiles out in all directions from that point, which will travel for a short time before disappearing."]="射出一支穿透之箭直到它抵達目標地。當它抵達目標地後，會在該地產生一道龍捲，向全方位射出飛箭，在飛行一段距離後消逝。",
		["Fires a poisonous arrow which deals chaos damage in an area on impact."]="射出一發帶有腐蝕效果的箭矢，落地時對範圍造成混沌傷害。",
		["Fires a poisonous projectile based on your weapon that will chain between enemies. Requires a Dagger or Claw."]="根據你的武器發射一個有毒的投射物，該投射物會在敵人之間連鎖。限定匕首或爪。",
		["Fires a projectile and teleports you in the opposite direction"]="發射一個投射物並將你傳送至相反方向",
		["Fires a projectile from a Wand that causes a series of area explosions in a secondary radius around its point of impact, each damaging enemies."]="從法杖中射出一個投射物，在接觸到物體或敵人時對周圍二段範圍連續爆破造成傷害。",
		["Fires a projectile that applies a damage over time debuff when it hits. You are healed for a portion of the debuff damage. The debuff is spread by Contagion."]="投射出一個造成持續性混沌傷害減益效果的投射物。一部分減益效果的傷害將會回你的生命。減益效果可以透過瘟疫擴散。",
		["Fires a projectile that applies a damage over time debuff when it hits. You lose Life and Energy Shield equal to a portion of the debuff damage. The debuff is spread by Contagion."]="投射出一個造成持續性混沌傷害減益效果的投射物。你失去等同於減益傷害的生命和能量護盾。減益效果可以透過瘟疫擴散。",
		["Fires a projectile that deals chaos damage to enemies it hits and leeches some of that damage as energy shield."]="發射一個投射物，對擊中的敵人造成混沌傷害，並造成的部分偷取為能量護盾。",
		["Fires a projectile that turns towards enemies in front of it, damaging and piercing through those it hits, and leeching some of that damage as energy shield. As the projectile travels, it repeatedly applies a short but powerful chaos damage over time debuff to each enemy in an area around it."]="發射一個投射物向敵人前近並穿透他們，造成混沌傷害，且造成的部分傷害偷取為能量護盾。此投射物也會對它沿路上的敵人造成短時間但強力的混沌持續傷害減益效果。",
		["Fires a projectile that turns towards enemies in front of it. The projectile does not hit enemies, but as it travels it applies a short physical damage over time debuff to each enemy in an area around it, stacking up to 3 times. The debuff also increases the damage over time they take from all sources."]="發射一枚會自動轉向前方敵人的投射物。該投射物不會直接擊中敵人，但當它飛行時，會對其周圍區域內的每個敵人施加一個短暫的物理持續傷害減益效果，最多可疊加 3 次。該減益效果還會增加敵人承受的來自所有來源的持續傷害。",
		["Fires a projectile that will pierce through enemies to impact the ground at the targeted location, creating a Bone Archer corpse where it lands."]="發射一個可以穿透所有敵人的投射物，並撞到目標位置後製造一個骷髏之弓於標的地。",
		["Fires a projectile with a wand or bow that deals fire, cold and lightning damage. If the projectile hits an enemy, it will deal damage in an area around them."]="使用法杖或弓射出一個投射物，造成火焰、冰冷與閃電傷害。投射物擊中敵人時會對周圍的敵人造成傷害。",
		["Fires a returning projectile that can be caught. Caught projectiles spiral outwards when you use Whirling Blades and do not return. Requires a Dagger or Claw."]="發射一個會被接住的返回投射物。當你使用迴旋之刃時，接住的投射物會旋轉向外發射，且不會返回。限定匕首或爪。",
		["Fires a series of projectiles in a spiral that turn towards enemies in front of them, damaging and piercing through those they hit, and leeching some of that damage as energy shield. As the projectiles travel, they repeatedly apply a short but powerful chaos damage over time debuff to each enemy in an area around them."]="發射一個螺旋投射物向敵人前近並穿透他們，且造成的部分傷害偷取為能量護盾。此投射物也會對它沿路上的敵人造成短時間但強力的混沌持續傷害減益效果。",
		["Fires a single arrow up in the air, to rain down at a targeted location. The arrow deals area damage around where it lands, as well as releasing a wave of fire which will apply a burning debuff to enemies. The impact of the arrow will also inflict this debuff."]="對天空射出一支箭矢，降落於目標位置。箭矢對落地區域附近造成範圍傷害，並釋放出一道炎浪，對敵人造成燃燒減益效果。箭矢的衝擊也會施加這個減益效果。",
		["Fires a single eye projectile which cannot damage enemies. When the eye dissipates or collides with terrain, it releases a fast spiral of shards. The shards will deal cold damage to enemies they impact."]="發射單一眼睛投射物，不能對敵人造成傷害。當眼睛消逝或撞擊地面，它會釋放快速螺旋的碎片。碎片會對撞擊的敵人造成冰冷傷害。",
		["Fires a single eye projectile which constantly releases shard projectiles in a spiral. The shards will damage enemies they impact, dealing cold damage. The eye cannot damage enemies. When the eye dissipates or collides with terrain, it releases a faster spiral of extra shards."]="發射單一眼睛投射物，不斷以螺旋式發射碎片投射物。碎片會對它們撞擊的敵人造成傷害，造成冰冷傷害。眼睛不能傷害敵人。當眼睛消逝或與地形碰撞時，它會釋放更快速螺旋的額外碎片。",
		["Fires a single eye projectile which releases a number shard projectiles in a spiral before dissipating. The shards will damage enemies they impact, dealing cold damage. The eye cannot damage enemies."]="發射單一眼睛投射物，在消逝前釋放數個螺旋投射物。碎片會對撞擊的敵人造成冰冷傷害。眼睛不能對敵人造成傷害。",
		["Fires a single payload arrow into the air to land at a targeted location. It will then fire arrows out in all directions from that point."]="射出一支載有箭矢的箭，讓其飛入空中並落在目標位置。然後，它將從該點向所有方向發射箭矢。",
		["Fires a single projectile which moves in a spiral while damaging each enemy in an area around it repeatedly with bolts of lightning."]="以螺旋形式發射一個投射物，對區域內的每個敵人持續雷擊造成傷害。",
		["Fires a slow-moving projectile that damages each enemy in an area around it repeatedly with bolts of lightning."]="射出一個移動緩慢的投射物，對區域內的每個敵人持續雷擊造成傷害。",
		["Fires a slow-moving projectile that pierces through enemies, dealing cold damage."]="發射出一個緩慢移動，會穿透敵人的投射物，造成冰冷傷害。",
		["Fires a slow-moving serpentine arrow which deals chaos damage while piercing enemies, and leaves a trail of caustic ground. Enemies standing on the caustic ground take chaos damage over time."]="發射一支慢速蛇行的箭矢，造成混沌傷害並穿透敵人，留下腐蝕地面。站在腐蝕地面上的敵人受到混沌持續傷害。",
		["Fires an arc of knives down into the ground in front of the caster which deal physical damage.\nCannot be supported by Volley."]="向前依弧形射出虛空匕首，造成物理傷害。\n不能被齊射輔助。",
		["Fires an arc of knives in front of the caster which deals physical damage."]="向前依弧形射出虛空匕首，造成物理傷害。",
		["Fires an arc of knives outwards in front of the caster which deal physical damage."]="向前依弧形射出虛空匕首，造成物理傷害。",
		["Fires an arrow at the target destination. When the arrow lands, a clone is summoned. The clone is a minion that uses your bow and quiver to fire arrows into the air to land around a target."]="對目標地點射出一支箭，當箭到達時在目標地創造一個你的複製體。這個複製體使用跟你一樣的弓與箭袋來發射箭矢至空中，並在目標位置落下。",
		["Fires an arrow at the target destination. When the arrow lands, a clone is summoned. The clone is a minion that uses your bow and quiver to fire random elemental arrows which convert all physical damage to the chosen element and deal no damage of other damage types."]="對目標地點射出一支箭，當箭到達時會留下一個你的複製體。這個複製體使用跟你一樣的弓與箭袋來發射隨機元素箭矢，並將所有物理傷害轉為所選的元素傷害，且不會造成其他類型的傷害。",
		["Fires an arrow at the target destination. When the arrow lands, a clone is summoned. The clone is a minion that uses your bow and quiver."]="對目標地點射出一支箭，當箭到達時在目標地創造一個你的複製體。這個複製體使用跟你一樣的弓與箭袋。",
		["Fires an arrow at the target destination. When the arrow lands, you are teleported to it and a clone is summoned at your old location. The clone is a minion that uses your bow and quiver to fire arrows into the air to land around a target."]="對目標地點射出一支箭，當箭到達時將你傳送至目標地，並在原地留下一個你的複製體。這個複製體使用跟你一樣的弓與箭袋來發射箭矢至空中，並在目標位置落下。",
		["Fires an arrow at the target destination. When the arrow lands, you are teleported to it and a clone is summoned at your old location. The clone is a minion that uses your bow and quiver to fire random elemental arrows which convert all physical damage to the chosen element and deal no damage of other damage types."]="對目標地點射出一支箭，當箭到達時將你傳送至目標地，並在原地留下一個你的複製體。這個複製體使用跟你一樣的弓與箭袋來發射隨機元素箭矢，並將所有物理傷害轉為所選的元素傷害，且不會造成其他類型的傷害。",
		["Fires an arrow at the target destination. When the arrow lands, you are teleported to it and a clone is summoned at your old location. The clone is a minion that uses your bow and quiver."]="對目標地點射出一支箭，當箭到達時將你傳送至目標地，並在原地留下一個你的複製體。這個複製體使用跟你一樣的弓與箭袋。",
		["Fires an arrow into the air to land at a targeted location, dealing area damage. The arrow sticks in the ground where it lands, and periodically fires a beam of lightning to another arrow near it, dealing area damage between them."]="向空中發射一支箭矢，落在目標位置，造成範圍傷害。箭矢會插入落地的地面上，並持續地向它附近的另一支箭矢發射一道閃電，在它們之間造成範圍傷害。",
		["Fires an arrow into the air to land at a targeted location, dealing area damage. The arrow sticks in the ground where it lands, and periodically fires a beam of lightning to you, dealing area damage between the arrow and you."]="向空中發射一支箭矢，落在目標位置，造成範圍傷害。箭矢會插入落地的地面上，並持續地向你發射一道閃電，在你和箭矢之間造成範圍傷害。",
		["Fires an arrow into the air to land at a targeted location. On impact, deals area damage and creates a thunderstorm which blinds enemies within it. Entering the thunderstorm will cause it to gain stages, and leaving it will cause it to dissipate. Leaving the storm while it is at maximum stages will cause it to explode, dealing damage and triggering Thunderburst. You must use this skill yourself, it cannot be used by Totems, Traps, Mines, or other objects that use skills for you."]="向空中射出箭矢，在目標區域周圍落下，命中時造成範圍傷害，並在該區域生成雷暴，使其中的敵人致盲。進入雷暴會使其累積階段，再次離開則會使其逐漸消散。當你在雷暴達到最大階段時離開，它將會爆炸，造成傷害並觸發雷霆爆裂。此技能必須由你親自施放，無法由圖騰、陷阱、地雷或其他代替你施放技能的物體使用。",
		["Fires an arrow that converts some physical damage to cold on its target and converts all physical damage to cold in a cone behind that target."]="發射一支將部分物理傷害轉為冰冷傷害的箭矢，且在擊中敵人之後對其背後扇形範圍內的其他敵人造成等同全部物理傷害的冰冷傷害。",
		["Fires an arrow that converts some physical damage to cold on its target and converts all physical damage to cold in a cone behind that target. When you use this skill, it summons a squad of Mirage Sharpshooters for a duration. Cannot be used by Totems, Traps, or Mines."]="發射一支將部分物理傷害轉為冰冷傷害的箭矢，且在擊中敵人之後對其背後扇形範圍內的其他敵人造成等同全部物理傷害的冰冷傷害。當你使用次技能時，會召喚一群幻影神槍手一段時間。不能被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用。",
		["Fires an arrow that explodes, dealing fire damage to its target and other nearby enemies, with an increased chance of igniting them."]="射出一發帶有火焰能量的箭矢，接觸到敵人時會爆炸，並對其與周圍的敵人造成額外火焰傷害，同時有較高的機率造成點燃。",
		["Fires an arrow that remains in the ground behind its final target, tethering that enemy to it. Ensnared enemies have less movement speed while trying to break the snare. The snare will break if they leave the area of effect."]="朝最終目標後的地面發射一支箭矢，並栓住靠近的敵人。被誘捕的敵人在試圖逃脫時有移動速度會降低。若敵人離開範圍效果誘捕將失效。",
		["Fires an arrow that splits to hit different targets."]="對不同的目標射出會裂化的箭矢。",
		["Fires an arrow which acts as a short duration fuse. Applying additional arrows to an enemy extends the duration. When the target dies or the fuses expire, the arrows explode, dealing fire AoE damage to nearby enemies. The AoE radius is proportional to the number of arrows upon death."]="射出一發帶著引線充滿爆炸能量的箭矢。當被命中的目標死亡或是引線燒完，該箭矢將會爆炸並對周圍的敵人造成火焰傷害。再次被爆炸箭矢命中會延長爆炸的時間。爆炸的範圍大小將視目標被擊中的箭數所決定。",
		["Fires an arrow which deals chaos damage in an area on impact, and spreads caustic ground. Enemies standing on the caustic ground take chaos damage over time."]="射出一發帶有腐蝕效果的箭矢，對擊中的敵人造成額外混沌傷害，並且產生腐蝕地面。在腐蝕地面上的敵人將會持續的受到混沌傷害。",
		["Fires an arrow which decelerates to the target location, the arrow will then become unstable and explode dealing weapon damage in an area, converting half of the physical damage to cold damage."]="發射一個減速目標位置的箭矢，箭矢會變的不穩定並爆炸對範圍造成武器傷害，一半的物理傷害會轉化為冰冷傷害。",
		["Fires an arrow which will stick into an enemy or wall, and then explode, dealing area damage around it, either after a duration or when the maximum number of arrows stuck to that target is reached. If an enemy has multiple Explosive Arrows stuck in them, the first one to explode will consume the others, adding their damage to its explosion."]="發射一支會插在敵人身上或強上的箭矢，一段時間後爆炸對附近造成範圍傷害，或當敵人身上箭矢達最大數量也會爆炸。若敵人身上有多支爆炸箭矢，當第一支爆炸後其它箭矢也會爆炸，並增加爆炸傷害。",
		["Fires arrows up in the air, to rain down in an area. Each arrow deals area damage around where it lands, and they will all overlap on the targeted location."]="朝著天空發出大量的箭矢，並像降雨般落下。每支箭矢於落地點造成範圍傷害，它們會在指定的地點重疊。",
		["Fires charged arrows, which repeatedly travel for a short time before changing direction. When they hit enemies, they are struck by a bolt of lightning which damages a number of surrounding enemies."]="射出多支充滿閃電能量的箭矢，會在改變方向前不斷移動一小段時間。當它們擊中敵人時，使雷電擊中附近一群敵人。",
		["Fires doom arrows in a direction toward target"]="朝目標發射一支厄運箭矢",
		["Fires multiple arrows at different targets."]="對不同的目標射出多重箭矢。",
		["Fires multiple arrows into the air, to land in multiple sequences after a delay, each starting at the targeted location and spreading outwards in all directions. Each arrow deals damage in an area around it. Half of the arrows will land directly on targets if there are targets in their range."]="對空射出無數箭矢，並在一段時間後接連落下，最先降落於目標區域並擴散至外圍地區。每支箭矢都會對附近造成傷害。一半的箭矢會直接攻擊於範圍內的目標。",
		["Fires multiple arrows into the air, to land in sequence after a delay, starting at the targeted location and spreading outwards in all directions. Each arrow deals damage in an area around it. Half of the arrows will land directly on targets if there are targets in their range."]="對空射出無數箭矢，並在一段時間後接連落下，最先降落於目標區域並擴散至外圍地區。每支箭矢都會對附近造成傷害。一半的箭矢會直接攻擊於範圍內的目標。",
		["Fires multiple arrows into the air, to land in sequence after a delay, starting in front of you and proceeding in a line in the direction of the target. Each arrow deals damage in an area around it."]="對空射出無數箭矢，並在一段時間後接連落下，起始點在你的前方，並且沿著朝向目標的方向形成一條直線。每支箭矢對其附近區域造成傷害。",
		["Fires multiple arrows into the air, to slowly land in sequence after a delay, starting at the targeted location and spreading outwards in all directions. Each arrow deals damage in an area around it. Half of the arrows will land directly on targets if there are targets in their range."]="對空射出無數箭矢，並在一段延遲時間後接連落下，起始點在目標位置，向所有方向擴散。每支箭矢在其附近區域造成傷害。如果在它們的射程範圍內有目標，其中一半的箭矢將直接命中目標。",
		["Fires projectiles from the targeted location that move randomly and damage enemies they pierce through. They explode after a duration, dealing area damage."]="從目標位置發射投射物，隨機移動並對貫穿的敵人造成傷害。在持續一段時間後，投射物會爆炸，造成範圍傷害。",
		["Fires projectiles in all directions, converting all their physical damage to a random element, and grants a buff which makes you unaffected by curses for a duration. Removes curses on you when used."]="以新星方式發射投射物，將全部物理傷害轉化為隨機元素傷害，獲得增益效果在一段時間內免疫詛咒。使用時移除你身上的詛咒。",
		["Fires projectiles that move randomly and damage enemies they pierce through. They explode after a duration, dealing area damage."]="發射隨機移動的投射物，並對穿透的敵人造成傷害。它們會在一段時間後爆炸，造成範圍傷害。",
		["Fires projectiles which fly in an arc, dealing area damage on impact with either enemies or the ground near where you target. Targeting farther away causes the projectiles to spread out and land over a wider area."]="發射拋物線的投射物，在擊中敵人或目標附近的地面時造成範圍傷害。遠距離目標會使射擊物散開，落在更大的區域上。",
		["Fires your wand simultaneously at all nearby enemies, culling those close to death and granting you a power charge for each. Cannot be supported by Volley."]="揮動你的法杖同時攻擊附近的所有敵人。瀕死的敵人將會被撲殺，並產生同等數量的暴擊球。不能被齊射輔助。",
		["Fires your wand to fire a single projectile each at a number of nearby enemies, granting you a power charge if an enemy is killed by, or soon after, the hit."]="揮動你的法杖附近敵人發射一個投射物；若是擊中的目標被擊殺或是短時間內被擊殺，將會為產生一顆暴擊球。",
		["Flaming bolts rain down over the targeted area. They explode when landing, dealing damage to nearby enemies."]="呼喚無數火焰之球如雨一般灑落在目標區域。每顆火球落地時將會爆炸，並對附近的敵人造成傷害。",
		["Focus your power, granting yourself the Focused buff."]="專注於你的力量，給予你專注之意增益效果。",
		["Gain Unbound Fury by inflicting Elemental Ailments with Hits on enemies. Once you reach maximum Unbound Fury, consume it to become Unbound, vastly augmenting your Elemental prowess."]="透過擊中敵人造成元素異常狀態來獲得無縛之怒。無縛之怒到達上限後，將其消耗以進入無縛狀態，大幅增強你的元素能力。",
		["Gain a buff that makes you faster, harder to detect, and grants Phasing, letting you pass through enemies. Performing any skill replaces this buff with one that boosts melee physical damage of skills you use yourself (it will not apply to your melee skills used by totems). Consumes Frenzy Charges to increase duration."]="得到一個增益效果，使你更迅速，難以被敵人發現，並給予你迷蹤狀態，使你能夠穿過敵人。使用任何技能將會使迷蹤效果失效，若使用的技能為近戰傷害技能(不能由圖騰施放)，將會增強此傷害。消耗狂怒球可以增加持續時間。",
		["Gain a buff that makes you move faster, become harder to detect, and no longer have your movement impeded by enemies. Your next attack also deals extra damage. Performing any skill removes this buff but grants a new buff that increases the damage of your attacks for a short time. Consumes Frenzy Charges to increase duration."]="使你的身影難以被發現，且增加你的移動速度。移動時不再被敵人阻擋。使用任何技能將移除此增益效果，並給予另外一個增加攻擊傷害的短暫增益效果。可以使用狂怒球延長持續時間。",
		["Gain an Incubating buff, adding to its Plague Value as you inflict poisons. Use the skill again to begin Infecting, dealing chaos damage over time to nearby enemies until the Plague Value is depleted. Your damage modifiers don't apply to this skill's damage. Using the skill again alternates between Incubating and Infecting."]="獲得醞釀增益效果，當你造成中毒時附加瘟疫值。再次使用技能開始感染，對附近敵人造成混沌持續傷害直到瘟疫值耗盡。你的傷害詞綴不影響此技能的傷害。再次使用技能可切換醞釀和感染。",
		["Gathers kinetic energy into an anomaly at the targeted location, which will explode when enemies are near it, dealing your wand's damage in an area. The anomaly will dissipate after a duration."]="在目標位置聚集動能形成一個異常體，當敵人接近時，它將會爆炸並在範圍內造成你的法杖傷害。該異常體會在一段時間後消散。",
		["Generic monster mortar skill. Like Monster Projectile but has an impact effect."]="通用的怪物砲擊技能。與怪物投射物相似，但帶有衝擊效果。",
		["Generic monster mortar skill. Like Monster Projectile but has an impact effect. Casts mortar around caster instead of target location."]="一般的迫擊砲技能。有如怪物投射物，但擁有擊中效果。會於施法者附近施放。",
		["Grants Elusive and a buff that grants Phasing. While you have this buff, monsters that enter an area around you will be Withered. Using a skill or losing the Elusive buff ends this skill's effects. Shares a cooldown with other Blink skills. Cannot be used while already Elusive."]="套用靈巧和提供迷蹤的增益效果。當你有此增益效果，怪物進入你附近會受到凋零。使用技能或是失去靈巧效果將結束此技能效果。與其他閃現技能共享冷卻間。靈巧時不能使用。",
		["Grants Glorious Madness. Using this skill again will remove Glorious Madness and the Touched Debuffs it inflicts, but you will be unable to Embrace Madness again until the cooldown expires."]="獲得榮耀瘋顛。再次使用此技能會移除榮耀瘋癲並移除它鎖造成的觸之減益效果，且在冷卻時間結束前無法使用擁抱瘋魔。",
		["Grants a buff adding cold damage to spells and attacks. If you shatter an enemy, this skill will cause them to explode and deal AoE cold damage to enemies near them. This damage is not affected by modifiers to spell damage."]="於手中凝聚冰霜之力，為法術與攻擊附加冰冷傷害。若是你粉碎了一個敵人，它們將會爆炸並對附近的敵人造成冰冷傷害。此技能造成的範圍冰冷傷害無法被法術傷害詞綴影響。",
		["Grants a buff giving more poison damage and a chance to inflict poison. When you poison an enemy while you have this buff, you gain Virulence, and summon an Agony Crawler minion that uses projectile and area attacks. You will lose Virulence over time, at a rate which increases the more Virulence you have. The minion will die when you have no Virulence."]="獲得一個增益效果給予更多中毒傷害並且有機率造成中毒。當你有此增益效果使敵人中毒時，你會獲得毒性並且召喚一個使用投射物和範圍攻擊的苦痛毒蛛蠍。你將會隨著時間的流逝而失去毒性，頻繁的使用將會使你有更多的毒性。當你沒有毒性時，苦痛毒蛛蠍就會死亡。",
		["Grants a buff providing fire damage based on your physical damage. While you have this buff, if you kill an enemy, other enemies near them will be burned based on the overkill damage. The burn inflicted by this skill can only be affected by modifiers to damage over time (burning damage is damage over time)."]="獲得一個增益效果提供以你物理傷害為基礎的火焰傷害。若是你在有此增益效果時殺死了一個敵人，溢出的傷害將會以燃燒的形式擴散至附近的敵人。此技能造成的燃燒只能被持續傷害詞綴影響 (燃燒傷害是持續傷害)。",
		["Grants a buff which adds lightning damage to spells and attacks. If you kill a shocked enemy, this skill will create a storm, causing lightning bolts to strike enemies around you for a duration. The damage inflicted by this skill is not affected by modifiers to spell damage."]="於手中凝聚閃電之力，為法術與攻擊附加閃電傷害。若是你擊殺了一個受到感電狀態的敵人，此技能會製造 1 個風暴，閃電將會在一小段時間內持續攻擊你附近的敵人。此技能造成的閃電傷害無法被法術傷害詞綴影響。",
		["Grants a buff which causes you to deal more damage for each Herald skill affecting you. While you have this buff, this skill turns the space around you into a tear in reality, releasing pulses that damage enemies around you. Inflicting Ailments causes you to gain Otherworldly Pressure, which increases the frequency of the pulses. You will lose Otherworldly Pressure over time, at a rate which increases the more of it you have. The damage inflicted by this skill is not affected by modifiers to spell damage."]="獲得一個增益效果，使你每受到一個捷光環影響便造成更多傷害。當你擁有此增益效果時，你周圍的空間化為現實裂縫，釋放出對自身周圍敵人造成傷害的脈衝。當你施加異常狀態時，會獲得超凡威壓層數，超凡威壓會增加脈衝的頻率。你會隨時間損失超凡威壓層數，層數越高損失越快。此技能造成的傷害不受法術傷害詞綴影響。",
		["Grants a buff which lets you deal more physical damage. When you kill an enemy while you have this buff, this skill will summon a Sentinel of Purity, or refresh the duration and life of an existing one instead if you have the maximum number of them. The Sentinels of Purity have a single-target melee attack and an area melee attack."]="獲得一個增益效果，使你造成更多物理傷害。當你有此增益效果擊殺敵人時，此技能將會召喚一個純淨護衛，若純淨護衛的數量以達上限，將會刷新現有的持續時間和生命。純淨護衛有單體近戰攻擊和範圍攻擊。",
		["Grants a buff which significantly lowers your maximum Energy Shield to transform your equipped swords into swords formed from that energy. Casting the spell again removes the buff. This skill cannot be triggered or used with non-sword weapons."]="提供一個增益效果，大幅降低你的最大能量護盾，將你裝備的劍轉化為由該能量形成的劍。再次施放此法術會移除該增益效果。此技能無法被觸發，或以非劍類武器使用。",
		["Hits enemies, converting some of your physical damage to chaos damage and inflicting poison which will be affected by modifiers to skill duration. If dual wielding, deals the damage of both weapons in one strike. Requires a claw, dagger or sword."]="對敵人進行攻擊，轉化你部分的物理傷害為混沌傷害並造成中毒，該中毒受到技能持續時間影響。雙持時，會在一次打擊造成兩把武器的傷害。限定爪、匕首與劍。",
		["Hits enemies, converting some of your physical damage to chaos damage and inflicting poison which will be affected by modifiers to skill duration. If dual wielding, will strike with both weapons. Requires a claw, dagger or sword."]="對敵人進行攻擊，轉化你部分的物理傷害為混沌傷害並造成中毒，該中毒受到技能持續時間影響。雙持時，會使用兩把武器打擊。限定爪、匕首與劍。",
		["Hits enemies, converting some of your physical damage to cold damage. If a non-unique enemy is frozen and is on less than one third life, they will shatter when hit by Glacial Hammer. If striking three times in a row, the third strike will freeze enemies more easily. Requires a Mace, Sceptre or Staff."]="擊中敵人，轉換一部分的物理傷害為冰冷傷害。若受到攻擊的非傳奇敵人被冰凍且生命少於 1 / 3 ，則被冰霜之錘命中時會碎成冰屑。若連續打擊 3 次，第 3 下則更容易冰凍敵人。限定錘、權杖或長杖。",
		["Hits enemies, converting some of your physical damage to cold damage. If striking three times in a row, the third strike will be a critical strike. Requires a Mace, Sceptre or Staff."]="擊中敵人，轉換一部分的物理傷害為冰冷傷害。若連續打擊 3 次，第 3 下則更容易冰凍敵人。限定錘、權杖或長杖。",
		["Hits enemies, converting some of your physical damage to cold damage. It traps enemies with you in a circle of ice so that they can't escape. Requires a Mace, Sceptre or Staff."]="凝聚冰霜之力，轉換一部分的物理傷害為冰冷傷害以重擊目標，同時在目標周圍造成一個不可侵犯、讓敵人無處可逃的冰牆。限定錘與長杖。",
		["Ice crystals protrude from the ground at target location. Monsters in this area take damage and become frozen. The cooldown can be bypassed by expending a Power Charge."]="在指定地點凝聚冰之結晶並從地面竄出。在此區域的怪物將會受到傷害並被凍結。釋放一顆暴擊球能重置其技能冷卻。",
		["Icicles emerge from the ground in a series of small bursts, each damaging enemies caught in the area and knocking them back in the direction of the next burst."]="冰柱從地面接連浮現小爆炸，對範圍內敵人造成傷害，並在接下來的爆炸擊退敵人。",
		["Icicles emerge from the ground in a series of small bursts, each damaging enemies caught in the area."]="從地面上不斷的冒出冰結之刺，宛如川流一般向前攻擊並對敵人造成傷害。",
		["Icy bolts rain down over the targeted area. They explode when landing, dealing damage to nearby enemies and chilling them, as well as causing patches of chilled ground. Skill damage is based on Intelligence."]="冰箭如雨般灑落在目標區域。落地時將會爆炸，對周圍敵人造成傷害並冰緩它們，並造成冰結地面。技能傷害以智慧數值為基礎。",
		["Immediately encases you in ice, protecting you for a duration or until you take damage from a number of hits, and also grants a buff once the cast time has finished. You cannot move or perform non-instant actions while in the ice. When the ice breaks, the buff is also removed."]="立刻將你保護在冰塊中，保護你一段時間或你承受一定次數的擊中，並在施放時間結束時給予一個增益效果。你不能在冰塊期間移動或施展非立即的行動。當冰塊破除後，增益效果也會被移除。",
		["Infuse the player's current weapon with additional fire damage for a short time."]="將能量注入目前所使用的武器使其在攻擊時能造成額外火焰傷害一段時間。",
		["Infuse your weapon with holy energy and swing. Successfully hitting an enemy will summon forth a copy of your Main Hand weapon as a Holy Armament. These Holy Armaments are undamageable minions, and will attack the enemies you target with Holy Strike. Requires a Mace, Sceptre or Staff."]="以神聖能量灌注並揮舞你的武器。成功擊中敵人時會複製你的主手武器並向前召喚一把神聖軍備。這些神聖軍備為不可被傷害的召喚物，且會攻擊你以神聖打擊擊中的目標敵人。需求錘、權杖、或長杖。",
		["Infuses your melee weapon with electrical energies as you swing. In addition to converting some of your physical damage to lightning damage, the stored energy becomes an orb attached to the enemy you hit, or the ground if you don't hit an enemy. The orb will periodically fire projectiles at other nearby enemies for a duration, which will also damage the enemy the orb is attached to."]="凝聚閃電之力，轉換一部分的物理傷害為閃電傷害以重擊目標。凝聚之力會變成一顆球附著在你擊中的敵人身上，若你沒擊中敵人則會產生於地面上。這顆球會在一段時間內持續的發射投射物攻擊附近的敵人，也會對球體附著的敵人造成傷害。",
		["Infuses your melee weapon with electrical energies as you swing. In addition to converting some of your physical damage to lightning damage, the stored energy is forced into the enemy as you strike, electrically charging them for a duration, during which lightning will arc between them and other nearby enemies, dealing damage. This occurs even if the attack is dodged."]="凝聚閃電之力，轉換一部分的物理傷害為閃電傷害以重擊目標。閃電之力在擊中敵人後會在其體內充能，並釋放出電弧在敵方之間彈跳造成傷害。即使第一擊未命中，此效果也依然存在。",
		["Infuses your melee weapon with electrical energies as you swing. In addition to converting some of your physical damage to lightning damage, the stored energy is released from the weapon as a projectile as you strike, flying out to hit farther-away enemies and chain between them. The projectile cannot miss if the melee attack hit a target."]="在你揮舞近戰武器時凝聚閃電之力。除了轉換一部分物理傷害為閃電傷害，儲存的能量會在你揮舞時從武器釋放投射物，襲擊遠方的敵人並在它們之間連鎖。若近戰攻擊擊中目標，投射物不能被躲避。",
		["Infuses your melee weapon with electrical energies as you swing. In addition to converting some of your physical damage to lightning damage, the stored energy is released from the weapon as projectiles as you strike, flying out to hit farther-away enemies. The projectiles cannot miss if the melee attack hit a target."]="在你揮舞近戰武器時凝聚閃電之力。除了轉換一部分物理傷害為閃電傷害，儲存的能量會在你揮舞時從武器釋放投射物，襲擊遠方的敵人。若近戰攻擊擊中目標，投射物不能被躲避。",
		["Infuses your melee weapon with molten energies to attack with physical and fire damage. This attack causes balls of molten magma to launch forth causing area attack damage to enemies where they land."]="為你的近戰武器注入熔岩之力，使你的攻擊帶有物理和火焰傷害。此攻擊使熔岩球向你擊中敵人的前方發射，在落點對敵人造成範圍傷害。",
		["Infuses your melee weapon with molten energies to attack with physical and fire damage. This attack causes balls of molten magma to launch forth from the enemies you hit, divided amongst all enemies hit by the strike. These will deal area attack damage to enemies where they land."]="為你的近戰武器注入熔岩之力，使你的攻擊帶有物理和火焰傷害。此攻擊使熔岩球向你擊中敵人的前方發射，在被打擊擊中的所有敵人之間彈跳。熔岩球在他們落地時，對敵人造成範圍攻擊傷害。",
		["Infuses your staff with arcane energy, lowering your mana costs and increasing your chance to block. When you block, you release an arcane wave, damaging enemies in a ring-shaped area over a duration."]="以秘能灌注你的長杖，降低你的魔力消耗，並增加你的格擋機率。當你格擋時，你會釋放一道秘能衝擊波，在一段持續時間內對環形區域內的敵人造成傷害。",
		["Infuses your two-handed melee weapon with molten energies to attack with physical and fire damage. This attack causes balls of molten magma to launch forth from the enemies you hit, divided amongst all enemies hit by the strike. These will deal area attack damage to enemies where they land. Every fifth time you attack with this skill it fires more, high-damage projectiles."]="為你的雙手武器注入熔岩之力，使你的攻擊帶有物理和火焰傷害。此攻擊使熔岩球向你擊中敵人的前方發射，在被打擊擊中的所有敵人之間彈跳。熔岩球在他們落地時，對敵人造成範圍攻擊傷害。使用此技能每 5 次攻擊會發射更高傷害的投射物。",
		["It's harmless, honest!"]="它是無害的，誠心不騙！",
		["Jolt through an enemy, causing chaining Lightning Damage."]="震顫穿透敵人，造成可連鎖的閃電傷害。",
		["Jump a short distance through the air, damaging and knocking back enemies with your weapon where you land. Enemies you would land on are pushed out of the way. Requires an Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Sword or Staff."]="短跳至空中，並在落地時以你的武器重擊並擊退範圍內的敵人。被踩到的敵人將會被推出去。限定斧、錘、權杖、劍或是長杖。",
		["Jump into the air, damaging and knocking back enemies with your weapon where you land. Enemies you would land on are pushed out of the way. Requires an Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Sword or Staff."]="跳向空中，並在落地時以你的武器重擊並擊退範圍內的敵人。被踩到的敵人將會被推出去。限定斧、錘、權杖、劍或是長杖。",
		["Jump into the air, damaging enemies (and knocking back some) with your weapon where you land. Enemies you would land on are pushed out of the way. Requires an axe, mace, sword or staff."]="朝著目標區域躍起，並在落地時以你的武器重擊（並擊退一些）範圍內的敵人。被踩到的敵人將會被推出去。限定一把斧、錘、劍或是長杖。",
		["Jump through the air, damaging and knocking back enemies with your weapon where you land. Enemies you would land on are pushed out of the way. Requires an Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Sword or Staff."]="朝著目標區域躍起，並在落地時以你的武器重擊並擊退範圍內的敵人。被踩到的敵人將會被推出去。限定斧、錘、權杖、劍或是長杖。",
		["Kills a target"]="殺死一個目標",
		["Launch molten projectiles from the point of impact, causing AoE attack damage to enemies where they land."]="在擊中的區域彈射出熔岩球。這些熔岩球有些許的冷卻時間並會在著地時爆炸，對附近的敵人造成傷害。此技能有短暫冷卻時間。",
		["Launches a fiery projectile high into the air, to drop on a target and deal area damage where it lands."]="將一個火焰投射物射入空中，然後掉落在目標上，造成範圍傷害。",
		["Launches a series of fireballs in a spiral around the caster."]="以施法者為中心螺旋型散發大量的火球。",
		["Launches a shard of ice that splits on hitting terrain or enemies. After splitting, the projectiles are in second form, which moves much faster and pierces through enemies."]="發射在撞擊地面或敵人時會裂化的冰之碎片。在裂化後投射物轉化為第二型態，此階段碎片飛行速度更快且能穿透敵人。",
		["Launches a spinning blade that deals weapon damage to enemies. If firing multiple projectiles, they will be fired in a circle."]="發射一個旋轉的劍刃，對敵人造成武器傷害。若發射多個投射物，會以環型發射。",
		["Launches a torrent of fire from your hand. The longer you repeatedly cast the spell from the same location, the larger and more damaging the flames become."]="從手中散發出火焰之柱。當你站在同個地點施放的時間越久，火焰的範圍和傷害都會隨之增加。",
		["Launches an unpredictable, piercing twister projectile that moves randomly for a duration, repeatedly dealing damage to enemies it intersects."]="製造一個無法控制且穿透的龍捲風投射物，在持續時間內隨機移動，並持續的對敵人造成傷害。",
		["Launches shards of ice in rapid succession. After travelling a short distance they change to a second form, which moves much faster and pierces through enemies."]="快速連續地發射冰之碎片。碎片在飛行一小段距離後會轉化為第二型態，此階段碎片飛行速度更快且能穿透敵人。",
		["Launches unpredictable sparks in all directions that move randomly until they hit an enemy or expire."]="向四面八方施放出多顆變幻莫測的電球，這些電球將會隨機移動直到撞到敵人或是自然消失。",
		["Launches unpredictable sparks that move randomly until they hit an enemy or expire."]="施放出多顆變幻莫測的電球，這些電球將會隨機移動直到撞到敵人或是自然消失。",
		["Launches unpredictable sparks with that move randomly with large differences in speed and distance until they hit an enemy or expire."]="施放出多顆變幻莫測的電球，它們有著不同的速度和距離，這些電球將會隨機移動直到撞到敵人或是自然消失。",
		["Lay a remote mine that you can detonate to create a series of fire novas. Each sequential nova from the same mine will do higher damage than the previous."]="設置一個遙控地雷，引爆時施放數道火焰新星。同一個地雷所施放出的數道火焰新星，每道的傷害會比前一道高。",
		["Lays a remote mine that you can detonate to freeze all enemies in the area."]="放置一個遙控地雷，你可以引爆它以冰凍該區域內的所有敵人。",
		["Lightning crackles in a series of small bursts, each damaging enemies caught in the area."]="閃電分裂成一連串的爆裂電球，向前攻擊並對敵人造成傷害。",
		["Lightning is released from your hands four times in quick succession, damaging all enemies in an arc in front of you."]="匯聚雷霆之力並從手中快速的釋放四次閃電，對你面前弧狀區域內的所有敵人造成傷害。",
		["Lightning strikes a number of enemies around a targeted location. Cannot be supported by Spell Cascade."]="雷擊目標位置附近的多名敵人。不能被秘能爆發輔助。",
		["Lightning strikes all Shocked enemies around a targeted location, then removes Shock from those enemies. Shocks cannot expire on enemies in range while casting this spell. Cannot be supported by Spell Cascade or Unleash."]="雷擊感電目標位置附近的敵人，再從這些敵人移除感電。施放此法術時，範圍內敵人身上的感電不會失效。不能被秘能爆發或釋放輔助。",
		["Like monster mortar skill, but leaves a ground effect on impact."]="如同怪物迫擊砲技能，但是在地上留下衝擊效果。",
		["Lob a fiery orb that deals area damage as it hits the ground. The skill chains, bouncing forward to deal damage multiple times."]="拋投出撞擊地面時會爆炸的岩漿球。技能可以連鎖，向前彈造成多次傷害。",
		["Lobs an exploding projectile near the targeted location, and extra projectiles toward enemies around you. The projectiles deal chaos damage based on your energy shield. Casting this spell damages you."]="在目標位置附近發射一個爆炸投射物，並向你附近的敵人發射額外投射物。 投射物會根據你的能量護盾造成混沌傷害。 施放此法術會對你造成傷害。",
		["Lobs an exploding projectile near the targeted location, and extra projectiles toward enemies around you. The projectiles deal chaos damage based on your life and energy shield. Casting this spell damages you."]="在目標位置附近發射一個爆炸投射物，並向你附近的敵人發射額外投射物。 投射物會根據你的生命和能量護盾造成混沌傷害。 施放此法術會對你造成傷害。",
		["Makes you immune to physical damage, and harder for enemies to detect, for a duration."]="讓你免疫物理傷害，期間敵人很難發現你的蹤跡。",
		["Manifest a row of Ghostly Cannons, each of which then fires after a short delay dealing the damage of the weapon that triggered it. For each additional projectile this skill would fire, create an additional Ghostly Cannon instead."]="顯化一個陣列的幽魂大砲，每一座會在短暫延遲後發射，造成基於觸發大砲的武器的傷害。此技能每一原先會發射的投射物數量，會改為額外創造一座大砲。",
		["Manifests two Dancing Dervishes to fight by your side. While a Dancing Dervish is manifested, you have Onslaught and cannot use Weapons. Cannot be supported by supports that would create other minions."]="幻化兩把狂舞德爾維希與你並肩作戰。當狂舞德爾維希被幻化時，你獲得猛攻並無法使用武器。無法被會製造其他召喚物的輔助寶石所輔助。",
		["Moves damage from nearby enemies to the target enemy. They are healed for the amount of damage moved."]="將傷害從附近敵人轉移到目標敵人身上。被轉走傷害的敵人會恢復等同該傷害的生命。",
		["Must support both a channelling skill and a non-channelling spell skill to work. The channelling skill will trigger a spell periodically while channelling. Cannot support skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Vaal skills and skills with a reservation cannot be triggered."]="一定要同時輔助引導施放和非引導施放技能。引導施放技能在引導時會定期觸發法術技能。不能輔助圖騰、陷阱和地雷技能。瓦爾技能、引導時施放技能和保留技能無法被觸發。",
		["Must support both a melee attack skill and a spell skill to work. The attack skill will trigger a spell when it kills an enemy. Cannot support totems, traps, or mines. Vaal skills, channelling skills, and skills with a reservation cannot be triggered."]="一定要同時輔助攻擊和法術技能。當攻擊技能擊殺敵人時會觸發法術技能。不能輔助圖騰、陷阱和地雷技能。瓦爾技能、引導時施放技能和保留技能無法被觸發。",
		["Must support both a skill that creates minions which can be damaged, and\n an aura skill that creates permanent auras around you.\nCannot support triggered skills, banner skills or stance skills."]="必須同時輔助可以創造召喚物且召喚物可被傷害，\n和在你附近創造永久光環的技能。\n不能輔助觸發型技能、鬥旗技能或姿態技能。",
		["Must support both a skill that hits enemies, and a hex curse skill to work. The hex will be applied when enemies are hit by the other skill. Cannot support totems, traps, or mines. Minions cannot apply hexes this way."]="一定要同時輔助可擊中敵人的技能和咒術技能。技能擊中時會施放咒術。不能輔助圖騰、陷阱和地雷技能。",
		["Must support both an attack skill and a spell skill to work. The attack skill will trigger a spell when it critically strikes an enemy. Cannot support totems, traps, or mines. Vaal skills, channelling skills, and skills with a reservation cannot be triggered."]="一定要同時輔助攻擊技能和法術技能。當攻擊技能暴擊敵人時會觸發法術技能。不能輔助圖騰、陷阱和地雷技能。瓦爾技能、引導時施放技能和保留技能無法被觸發。",
		["On Critically Striking an Enemy, this Graft will apply a stack of Jolt to you. Jolt grants more maximum Attack Damage at the cost of taking increased Damage, and can stack up to 10 times."]="當你對敵人造成暴擊時，這個接肢會為你施加一層「震顫」。震顫會提升最大攻擊傷害，但同時承受的傷害也會增加，且最多可堆疊 10 層。",
		["Once activated, continuously spends mana to cause volleys of ethereal weapons rain from the sky around you, dealing damage to enemies they impact. Each Blade will target a separate enemy in the volley area if possible. Each enemy can only be hit once by each volley, even if multiple blades land near them. This skill cannot be triggered or used by Totems, Traps, or Mines."]="發動後會持續消耗魔力，從空中召下一連串虛空幻影武器落在你身邊，對衝擊到的敵人造成傷害。在可能的情況下，每把刀刃會鎖定齊射範圍中的不同敵人。就算有多把刀刃落在身上，每個敵人在每次齊射中只能被擊中一次。這個技能不會被圖騰、陷阱或地雷觸發或使用。",
		["Once per second, raise a nearby corpse as a shambling undead. This minion will follow you and attack your enemies with melee strikes, but quickly falls apart. These minions have significantly increased attack speed while on low life."]="每秒一次，將附近的一具屍體復甦為蹣跚亡靈。此召喚物會跟隨你並以近戰打擊攻擊你的敵人，但它們會迅速消散。這些召喚物在貧血時會大幅增加攻擊速度。",
		["Overcharges your brands near the targeted area, causing them to accelerate how quickly they activate and expire. Deals damage in an area around each overcharged brand when it expires."]="超載目標地區附近的烙印，使他們加速啟動和失效。當它失效時對範圍內每個超載的烙印造成傷害。",
		["Paint the Town!"]="彩繪城鎮！",
		["Perform a deadly counter-attack when you block. Uses both weapons while you're dual wielding."]="格擋時進行一次致命的反擊。雙持時會使用兩把武器進行反擊。",
		["Perform a spinning attack, damaging enemies around you and creating a bladestorm matching your stance. The bladestorm repeatedly damages enemies, based on your weapon damage and attack time, for a duration. Blood bladestorms are stationary and cause Bleeding, while Sand bladestorms move slowly forwards and Blind enemies. Requires a Sword or Axe. You are in Blood Stance by default."]="進行旋轉攻擊，根據你的姿態傷害你附近的敵人和製造一個劍刃風暴。劍刃風暴會根據你的武器傷害和攻擊時間，對敵人重複造成傷害持續一段時間。血腥旋天劍舞是靜止並且會造成流血，沙戮旋天劍舞則會向前緩慢移動並致盲敵人。限定劍和斧。預設為血腥姿態。",
		["Perform a spinning attack, damaging enemies around you and creating a random bladestorm. The bladestorm repeatedly damages enemies, based on your weapon damage and attack time, for a duration. Blood bladestorms are stationary and cause Bleeding, while Sand bladestorms move slowly forwards and Blind enemies. Requires a Sword or Axe."]="進行旋轉攻擊，攻擊你附近的敵人並製造一個隨機的劍刃風暴。劍刃風暴持續傷害敵人一段時間，根據你的武器傷害和攻擊時間。血腥旋天劍舞是靜止並且會造成流血，沙戮旋天劍舞則會向前緩慢移動並致盲敵人。限定劍和斧。",
		["Perform a strike with a melee weapon that gives the character a frenzy charge if it hits. Frenzy charges increase your attack speed."]="使用近戰武器進行一次攻擊，若是命中敵人則累積一顆狂怒球。帶著狂怒球的狀態下將會增加你的攻擊速度。",
		["Perform a swift counter-attack against enemies in a cone shape when you block with your shield."]="當盾牌格擋時對敵人進行一次迅速的反擊。此反擊會對錐狀區域造成傷害。",
		["Performs a melee attack, and causes lightning to strike a nearby enemy, dealing damage in an area. Each target can only be hit once by this skill. Hitting an enemy grants an aura for a duration. Requires a Sword, Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Staff or Unarmed."]="使用近戰攻擊，使閃電擊中附近 1 名敵人，造成範圍傷害。每個目標只能被此技能擊中一次。擊擊中敵人時，你會獲得一個光環效果，使你和友方獲得額外閃電傷害，此光環會持續一段時間。限定劍、斧、錘、權杖、長杖或空手。",
		["Performs a melee attack, and causes lightning to strike nearby enemies, dealing damage in an area. Each target can only be hit once by this skill. Requires a Sword, Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Staff or Unarmed."]="使用近戰攻擊，使閃電擊中附近敵人，造成範圍傷害。每個目標只能被此技能擊中一次。限定劍、斧、錘、權杖、長杖或空手。",
		["Performs a series of quick teleports towards a targeted location, stopping if you would overlap with monsters or terrain. If using the \"Attack in Place\" option, the direction is reversed. Shares a cooldown with other Blink skills. Cannot be supported."]="執行一系列快速的傳送，朝向指定位置，如果會與怪物或地形重疊則停止。如果使用「原地攻擊」選項，則方向相反。與其他閃現技能共用冷卻時間。不能被輔助。",
		["Performs a series of quick teleports towards a targeted location. If using the \"Attack in Place\" option, the direction is reversed. Shares a cooldown with other Blink skills."]="對目標位置進行一系列快速傳送。若使用「定點攻擊」選項，則方向會相反。與其它閃現技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Performs a warcry, Hindering nearby enemies and causing them to explode when killed. The Hinder effect is proportional to the number of surrounding enemies. Taunts all nearby enemies to attack the user. Shares a cooldown with other Warcry skills."]="施展戰吼，使周圍敵人受阻礙，並在遭殺害時爆裂。 阻礙效果隨著周圍敵人數量提升。 嘲諷周圍所有敵人，使他們攻擊施放者。 與其他戰吼技能共用技能冷卻。",
		["Performs a warcry, taunting all nearby enemies to attack the user and exerting subsequent strike attacks. The user and nearby allies gain a buff that  grants elemental resistances."]="使用戰吼嘲諷周圍所有敵人，強迫他們攻擊自己，並竭盡接下來的打擊攻擊。使用者和附近友方會獲得一個增加元素抗性的增益效果。",
		["Performs a warcry, taunting all nearby enemies to attack the user and granting a buff to the user and nearby allies. The user and allied players also gain endurance charges."]="使用戰吼嘲諷周圍所有敵人，強迫他們攻擊自己，並為使用者與鄰近友方賦予一個增益效果。使用者和附近友方還會獲得耐力球。",
		["Performs a warcry, taunting nearby enemies to attack the user and exerting subsequent attacks. Nearby allies gain a buff based on the damage of your weapon."]="這個戰吼嘲諷周圍所有敵人，強迫他們攻擊自己，並竭盡接下來的攻擊。附近友方會根據你的武器傷害獲得增益效果。",
		["Performs a warcry, taunting nearby enemies to attack the user and exerting subsequent attacks. The user and nearby allies gain a buff that boosts critical strike chance."]="使用戰吼嘲諷周圍所有敵人，強迫他們攻擊自己，並竭盡接下來的攻擊。使用者和附近友方會獲得一個增加暴擊率的增益效果。",
		["Performs a warcry, taunting nearby enemies to attack the user and exerting subsequent attacks. The user and nearby allies gain a buff that grants a portion of their physical damage as extra fire damage. In addition to being taunted, enemies are inflicted with a secondary debuff causing them to explode when they die, dealing fire damage in an area."]="使用戰吼嘲諷周圍所有敵人，強迫他們攻擊自己，並竭盡接下來的攻擊。使用者和附近友方會獲得一個將部分物理傷害轉化為額外火焰傷害的增益效果。除了嘲諷之外，附近的敵人還會被賦予死亡時爆炸，並對周圍區域造成火焰傷害的減益效果。",
		["Performs a warcry, taunting nearby enemies to attack the user and exerting subsequent attacks. The user and nearby allies gain a buff that grants movement speed."]="使用戰吼嘲諷周圍所有敵人，強迫他們攻擊自己，並竭盡接下來的攻擊。使用者和附近友方會獲得一個增加移動速度的增益效果。",
		["Performs a warcry, taunting nearby enemies to attack the user and exerting subsequent slam attacks. The user and nearby allies gain a buff that increases their armour and stun threshold."]="使用戰吼嘲諷周圍所有敵人，強迫他們攻擊自己，並竭盡接下來的重擊攻擊。使用者和附近友方會獲得一個增加護甲和暈眩門檻的增益效果。",
		["Performs a warcry, taunting nearby enemies to attack the user, and summoning Mirage Warriors from nearby corpses. The Mirage Warriors each use a linked attack skill once before dissipating."]="這個戰吼嘲諷周圍所有敵人，強迫他們攻擊自己，並從附近的屍體召喚幻影戰士。每個幻影戰士在消散前會使用一次連結的攻擊技能。",
		["Performs an attack that gives the character a frenzy charge if it hits. Frenzy charges increase your attack speed."]="進行一次攻擊，若是命中敵人則累積一顆狂怒球。帶著狂怒球的狀態下將會增加你的攻擊速度。",
		["Performs an attack with a ranged weapon that gives the character a frenzy charge if it hits. Frenzy charges increase your attack speed."]="使用遠程武器進行一次攻擊，若是命中敵人則累積一顆狂怒球。帶著狂怒球的狀態下將會增加你的攻擊速度。",
		["Performs two fast strikes with a melee weapon, and summons your double for a duration to continuously attack monsters in this fashion."]="使用近戰武器對著目標進行兩次快速的攻擊，並同時召喚你的影分身持續使用雙重打擊攻擊敵人一段時間。",
		["Performs two fast strikes with a melee weapon, each of which summons a double of you for a duration to continuously attack monsters in this fashion."]="使用近戰武器對著目標進行兩次快速的攻擊，每擊都會召喚你的影分身持續使用雙重打擊攻擊敵人一段時間。",
		["Performs two fast strikes with a melee weapon, gaining stages which cause this skill to attack faster. All stages are lost when you move."]="使用近戰武器對著目標進行兩次快速的攻擊，獲得疊層使此技能攻擊更快。當你移動時失去全部疊層。",
		["Performs two fast strikes with a melee weapon."]="使用近戰武器對著目標進行兩次快速的攻擊。",
		["Permanently Afflicts any of your damageable minions in a targeted area, causing them to take physical damage over time, at an accelerating rate. Each such minion causes you to regenerate life at a rate based on the current damage of it's Affliction debuff. Afflicted Minions explode if their life is lowered to a fifth of maximum."]="禁咒永久影響目標區域內，你任何可被傷害的召喚物，使他們承受物理持續傷害，且傷害速率倍增。每個此類召喚物，使你的生命回復根據當前禁咒效果傷害率。禁咒召喚物血量低於五分之一時會爆炸",
		["Place a Frost Shield that drains your energy shield for one second or until you run out, gaining stages while this drain occurs. The Frost Shield takes some damage from hits in place of you and allies while in its area. Enemies in the area are Chilled. You can only have one Frost Shield active at once."]="放置 1 個寒霜護盾，吸收你的能量護盾 1 秒或直到你的耗盡，當吸收發生時，獲得疊層。你和友方在寒霜護盾內時，它會吸收部分擊中傷害。在範圍內的敵人會被冰緩。你同時只能啟動 1 個寒霜護盾。",
		["Places a Sigil on the ground, which grants a buff to you and allies in the area around it for a duration. The Sigil gains stages as you spend mana in its area, making the buff more powerful. You can only have one Sigil of Power at a time."]="放置 1 個咒符於地面，給予在範圍內的你和友方曾益效果持續一段時間。當你在此區域消耗魔力時，此咒符會獲得疊層，使增益效果更為強大。你同時只能有 1 個咒符之力。",
		["Polymorphs a party member in town, or a player in your hideout, into an animal."]="在城鎮或藏身處將隊伍成員變形成動物。",
		["Project a beam of holy light from your shield to a targeted location, causing an implosion of holy energy. This energy then lingers for a short duration as an orb, periodically releasing larger explosions. Increases and reductions to attack speed affect the rate at which explosions occur."]="由你的盾牌向目標位置發射一道神聖光束，引發聖能內爆。此能量會以球體的型態停留短暫的時間，週期性的釋放更加劇烈的爆炸。對攻擊速度的增減會影響爆炸出現的頻率。",
		["Project a beam of holy light from your shield to a targeted location, causing an implosion of holy energy. This energy then lingers for a short duration, before blasting outwards in a larger and more damaging explosion."]="由你的盾牌向目標位置發射一道神聖光束，引發聖能內爆。此能量經過短暫的時間後，將會由內向外引爆，造成範圍更大且傷害更高的爆炸。",
		["Punctures enemies with your Bow, causing a bleeding debuff, which will be affected by modifiers to skill duration."]="用弓對目標進行放血攻擊，對其造成一個流血的減益效果，效果可被作用期間詞綴影響。",
		["Punctures enemies, causing a bleeding debuff, which will be affected by modifiers to skill duration. Puncture works with bows, daggers, claws or swords."]="對目標進行一個放血攻擊，對其造成一個流血的減益效果，效果可被作用期間詞綴影響。限定弓、匕首、爪與劍。",
		["Punctures enemies, causing a bleeding debuff, which will be affected by modifiers to skill duration. Puncture works with daggers, claws or swords."]="對目標進行一個放血攻擊，對其造成一個流血的減益效果，效果可被作用期間詞綴影響。限定匕首、爪與劍。",
		["Raise two spectral spiders from each nearby corpse that will attack your enemies with Viper Strike. Each raised spider grants you increased Attack Speed and increased Damage with Poison. Enemies will not engage the spiders directly, and they are immune to damage."]="周遭每具屍體召喚兩隻幽魂巨蛛，牠們向你的敵人使用毒蛇打擊。每隻喚醒的蜘蛛增加你的攻擊速度和中毒傷害。敵人不會直接激怒蜘蛛，且他們免疫傷害。",
		["Raises a spectral version of a defeated foe as a minion to fight for you in battle."]="唱名喚魂，從目標屍體喚醒其幽魂並使役它為你而戰。",
		["Raises a spectral version of a defeated foe as a temporary minion to fight for you in battle for a duration."]="唱名喚魂，從目標屍體喚醒其幽魂並使役它為你而戰一小段時間。",
		["Raises a zombie minion from a corpse, which will follow you and attack enemies with a melee strike and an area of effect slam."]="從一個屍體中復甦一隻殭屍，它會跟隨你並使用近戰打擊和範圍重擊攻擊敵人。",
		["Raises a zombie minion from a corpse, which will follow you and attack enemies with a melee strike."]="從一個屍體中復甦一隻殭屍，它會跟隨你並使用近戰打擊攻擊敵人。",
		["Raises necromantic energies into the sky above a targeted location, where they coalesce into a zombie minion. The minion then attacks by falling to the ground, causing an impact that deals damage in an area. The zombie cannot survive the impact."]="將死靈能量召喚至目標上空，之後轉化為殭屍。殭屍會砸落地面，以衝擊波造成範圍傷害。殭屍無法在衝擊中倖存。",
		["Recall your brands to you, detaching them from enemies and increasing attachment range until they next attach to an enemy. Spends a portion of each recalled brand's cost to cause it to activate."]="將你的烙印呼喚至你身邊，使它們從敵人身上掉落。烙印下次再附著於敵人時會增加附著距離。消耗部分被喚回烙印的魔力消耗來啟動它。",
		["Recalls all minions that are following you to your location, and grants them a temporary life regeneration effect."]="將所有由你控制的召喚物召回你的所在之處，並短暫的使它們獲得生命恢復效果。",
		["Recalls any Mercenary accompanying you to your location. Recalled Mercenaries are healed for a portion of their maximum health."]="呼叫同行的傭兵到你所在位置。呼叫來的傭兵會恢復一部分的最大生命。",
		["Release a beam which deals lightning damage to enemies in a long area in front of you, and has several smaller beams branch off from it at an angle, hitting more enemies to the sides."]="釋放 1 個光束，對你面前一長條的敵人造成閃電傷害，並有些許光束從它分歧出來，擊中旁邊更多敵人。",
		["Release a concentrated beam which deals lightning damage to enemies in a long area in front of you."]="釋放 1 個集中光束，對你前方大範圍造成閃電傷害。",
		["Release a fire nova when you kill an enemy."]="擊殺敵人時釋放火焰的新星。此技能有短暫冷卻時間。",
		["Release a lightning charged spinning copy of your weapon or its projectiles that rotates around a point, damaging enemies in an area."]="複製並釋放出一個你所使用的武器或其投射物，並帶有閃電在一個定點旋轉，對區域內的敵人造成傷害。此技能有短暫冷卻時間。",
		["Release an arc of force from your weapon or fists, damaging enemies in front of you."]="對你面前的敵人們造成傷害。此技能有短暫冷卻時間。",
		["Releases a circle of projectiles based on your weapon, leaving chilled ground in their wake."]="製造一個你的武器的投射物新星，並在其路徑上留下冰緩地面。",
		["Releases a nova of fire around you, damaging nearby enemies."]="釋放一個火焰的新星，對周圍敵人造成傷害。此技能有短暫冷卻時間。",
		["Releases a tendril of blood from your character, which will target an enemy in front of you, then chain to other enemies. The tendril deals physical damage and inflicts a physical damage over time debuff to enemies, which can stack up to 3 times."]="從你的角色釋放一條血之射線，將瞄準你面前的敵人，然後連鎖到其他敵人。這條血之射線造成物理傷害並給敵人造成一個物理持續傷害減益效果，可以堆疊最多3次。",
		["Releases several tendrils of blood from your character, targeting enemies in a narrow angle in front of you. The beams deal physical damage and inflict a physical damage over time debuff to enemies, which can stack up to 3 times. Effects which allow skills to chain can apply to these tendrils."]="從你角色釋放數道血之射線，朝你面前小範圍的敵人發射。光束對敵人造成物理傷害和物理持續傷害的減益效果，至多可堆疊 3 次。允許技能連鎖的效果可以套用至這些射線上。",
		["Relinquish your grip on reality."]="放棄對現實的控制。",
		["Repeatedly attacks a large area in different directions. Each Vaal Reave that hits an enemy grants stages, which you will begin to lose after a short period without hitting anything. Only works with Daggers, Claws, and One-Handed Swords."]="重複對不同方向進行範圍攻擊。每擊中一個敵人將會使瓦爾．衝擊波的範圍增大。若是一段時間內沒有使用瓦爾．衝擊波擊中敵人或是使用了其他技能，此範圍將會還原。限定匕首、爪、單手劍。",
		["Repeatedly fires a piercing projectile based on your weapon, converting some physical damage to fire. The projectiles form an arc in front of you."]="重複發射一個根據你的武器複製品的穿透投射物，將一些物理傷害轉化為火焰傷害。投射物在你面前成弧形。",
		["Repeatedly hit enemies in a circle in front of you while channelling, dealing damage to and around the enemy. The critical strike chance is continually boosted while channelling. You unleash an additional hit for each stage reached once the channelling ends. Requires a Dagger, Claw or One-Handed Sword."]="引導施放時重複地攻擊你前方的敵人，對敵人和附近造成傷害。在引導時，暴擊率不斷提高。一旦引導結束，你會釋放每個階段所達到的額外打擊。",
		["Repeatedly hit enemies in a circle in front of you while channelling, dealing damage to and around the enemy. The damage is continually boosted while channelling. You unleash an additional hit for each stage reached once the channelling ends. Requires a Dagger, Claw or One-Handed Sword."]="引導施放時對面前圓形範圍中敵人進行攻擊，每一擊皆對目標與附近造成傷害。持續引導時增加傷害。結束引導後釋放等同引導時所達層數的額外攻擊次數。限定使用匕首、爪或單手劍。",
		["Repeatedly swings a two handed melee weapon in a circle, knocking back monsters away from the character."]="將武器在身體周圍橫掃多次，並將部分怪物擊退。",
		["Repeatedly teleports to enemies and hits them, inflicting a wound but dealing no damage. After the repeating finishes, each enemy is hit by the total damage of their wounds, which are removed."]="重複傳送至敵人並擊中他們，造成傷痕但沒有傷害。重複結束後，根據傷痕的總傷害來造成擊中並且移除。",
		["Requires 1h Sword, Dagger, or Claw weapon"]="限定單手劍、匕首或爪。",
		["Reserves mana based on the supported spells to cause those spells to trigger when you fire projectiles from a wand attack."]="根據被輔助的法術保留魔力，使法術在你使用法杖攻擊發射投射物時觸發法術。",
		["Reserves mana based on the supported warcries to cause those warcries to be repeatedly triggered."]="根據輔助的戰吼保留魔力，使這些戰吼技能可以被重複觸發。",
		["Reserves mana to apply a buff and leave afterimages of your recent past. Cast the spell again to return to the oldest afterimage, teleporting to that location as well as resetting your Life, Mana and Energy Shield to the values they had then."]="保留法力以施放一個增益並留下你最近的殘影。再次施放法術時返回先前的殘影，傳送到該位置並將你的生命、魔力和能量護盾重置為當時的值。",
		["Reserves some of your life to cause bleeding you inflict to be stronger, and grant life regeneration based on the number bleeding enemies nearby."]="保留你部分的生命，使你造成的流血更猛烈，並根據附近流血的敵人獲得生命回復。",
		["Retaliate against a blocked hit by calling forth a huge armoured fist to slam into the ground in front of you as you do the same, dealing weapon damage in an area."]="格擋攻擊後，在前方召喚出一隻巨大的裝甲鐵拳猛擊地面來進行復仇反擊，同時你也會做出相同的動作，對區域內造成武器傷害。",
		["Retaliate against a blocked hit with a hail of blades that rains down in front of you, repeatedly dealing the damage of both your weapons combined. Requires Dual Wielding Melee Weapons."]="格擋攻擊後，在自身前方降下劍雨進行復仇反擊，重複造成合計兩把武器的傷害。限定雙持近戰武器。",
		["Retaliate against a blocked hit with a surge of divine power, causing multiple waves of lightning bursts to expand outward from a targeted location. This skill cannot be Triggered or used by Totems, Traps, or Mines."]="格擋攻擊後，用充滿神聖力量的衝擊波進行復仇反擊，從指定位置向外散射出多道閃電。此技能無法被觸發，也不能被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用。",
		["Retaliate against a blocked hit with a sweep of your Shield, unleashing a wave of ice in a cone in front of you."]="格擋攻擊後，以盾牌橫掃來進行復仇反擊，在你前方扇形範圍內釋放出一波冰浪。",
		["Retaliate against a blocked hit with a sweep of your Shield, unleashing a wave of light in a cone in front of you. Additional waves will also emanate from allies in a radius around the first target struck, towards that target."]="格擋攻擊後，以盾牌橫掃來進行復仇反擊，在你前方扇形範圍內釋放出一道聖光。若首個擊中的目標範圍內有友方，將會產生額外一道光波朝該目標發射。",
		["Retaliate against a blocked hit with an arcing slash that releases two waves of force. Enemies close in front of you can be hit by both waves. Requires a Sword or Axe and a Shield."]="格擋攻擊後，使出弧形斬擊進行復仇反擊，釋放出兩道衝擊波。前方近距離的敵人可以一次被兩道衝擊波擊中。限定劍或斧和一面盾牌。",
		["Retaliate against a savage hit with a warcry, taunting all nearby enemies to attack the user. The user and nearby allies gain a buff which grants rage and prevents rage from being lost. Minions cannot gain rage."]="格擋攻擊後，使出戰吼進行復仇反擊，嘲諷附近所有敵人來攻擊使用者。使用者和附近的友方獲得一個增益效果，可給予盛怒並防止盛怒流失。召喚物無法獲得盛怒。",
		["Sacrifices a portion of your Life and Energy Shield to engulf you in magical fire that rapidly burns nearby enemies for a duration. Your spell damage is increased while under this effect."]="獻祭你部分的生命和能量護盾，使你被魔法火焰吞噬並迅燃燒附近的敵人持續一段時間。你的法術傷害在此效果下會增加。",
		["Sets a marker at a location. After a short duration, a bolt strikes the marker, dealing physical damage around it and causing bolts to strike at any other markers you've cast. Bolt impacts will leave behind a pool of boiling blood, which deals physical damage over time to enemies within it for a secondary duration."]="在一個位置設置一個標記。經過短暫時間後，標記會遭一發閃電擊中，對其周圍造成物理傷害，並使閃電擊向你施放的任何其他標記。閃電衝擊會留下一攤沸騰之血，在第二段持續時間內對其中的敵人造成物理持續傷害。",
		["Sets a marker at a location. After a short duration, a pillar of saltwater shoots up from target location, dealing Area Cold damage and creating an area of Brine Ground for 4 seconds."]="在指定位置設置一個標記。經過短暫延遲後，一柱海水將從目標位置噴湧而出，造成冰冷範圍傷害，並創造一個持續 4 秒的鹹水地面區域。",
		["Sets a marker at a location. After a short duration, lightning strikes the marker, dealing damage around it and causing lightning strikes at any other markers you've cast."]="在一個位置設置一個標記。經過短暫的時間後，閃電會打擊該標記附近，並在你施放的任何其他標記處也引發雷擊。",
		["Sets a marker at a location. Lightning strikes random enemies around the marker repeatedly over the skill's duration, dealing damage in an area around the strike. Modifiers to the skill's duration will also affect the delay between these strikes. When the duration ends, a large bolt of lightning strikes the marker, dealing damage around it."]="在目標區域設置一個標記。在技能持續時間內，閃電將會持續隨機落雷標記附近的敵人，對其造成傷害。技能持續時間詞綴會影響每次落雷的間隔時間。當持續時間結束後，一道強力的閃電會攻擊那個標記，並對該標記周圍的敵人造成傷害。",
		["Sets an enemy on fire from a distance."]="使目標敵人著火。",
		["Shaper's Memory casts this spell for you to fire a damaging beam for a duration that deals damage over time to things in it."]="塑界者的記憶為你施放此法術，在持續時間內發射傷害性射線，對其中的對象造成持續傷害。",
		["Shaper's Memory casts this spell for you to fire piercing projectiles in front of you that deal cold damage."]="塑界者的記憶為你施放此法術，朝你的前方發射穿透性投射物，造成冰冷傷害。",
		["Shaper's Memory uses this attack for you to teleport to an enemy and attack with a powerful blow, dealing area damage based on your weapon."]="塑界者的記憶為你使用此攻擊，將你傳送至一個敵人的位置並以強力一擊進行攻擊，依據你使用的武器造成範圍傷害。",
		["Slam the ground, calling down a Holy Hammer from above. On hitting an enemy, another Hammer will cascade forward, repeating if further enemies are hit, up to a cap. A Power Charge can be expended to call down additional Hammers to either side of the initial slam. Requires a Mace, Sceptre or Staff."]="重擊地面並從上方召喚一把神聖之錘。擊中敵人時，另一個神聖之錘會向前方發射，在擊中遠處的敵人時重複觸發，直到達到上限。可以消耗一個暴擊球，在起始重擊的兩側召喚額外的神聖之錘。需求錘、權杖、或長杖。",
		["Slam the ground, consuming all Endurance Charges and unleashing a fiery fissure in front of you, dealing area damage and randomly releasing a number of smaller fissures branching off from it. Requires a Mace, Sceptre, Sword, Axe, Staff, or Unarmed."]="猛擊地面，消耗全部耐力球並在你前方釋放熾熱的裂縫，造成範圍傷害並從中產生數個更小的裂縫。限定錘、權杖、劍、斧、長杖或空手。",
		["Slam the ground, consuming all Power Charges and calling down a cascade of holy hammers from above in an outward spiral. Further hammers are called down for each Power Charge consumed. Requires a Mace, Sceptre or Staff."]="重擊地面，消耗所有暴擊球並自空中召喚數波神聖之錘，由內而外以螺旋軌跡接連砸下。每消耗一個暴擊球，便會更進一步的呼喚更多神聖之錘。需求錘、權杖、或長杖。",
		["Slam the ground, creating a winding fissure that deals area damage while travelling outwards. When it reaches the target location it erupts dealing damage in an area. After erupting, the fissure continues moving towards enemies to cause further eruptions. Requires an Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Staff or Unarmed."]="猛擊地面，製造一道曲折的裂縫，在向外蔓延時造成範圍傷害。當它到達目標位置時會爆發，造成範圍傷害。在爆發後，裂縫持續向敵人蔓延，造成進一步的爆發。限定斧、錘、權杖、長杖或空手。",
		["Slam the ground, creating a winding fissure that deals area damage while travelling outwards. When it reaches the target location it erupts, releasing a burst of molten projectiles. After erupting, the fissure continues moving towards enemies to cause further eruptions. Requires an Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Staff or Unarmed."]="猛擊地面，製造一道曲折的裂縫，在向外蔓延時造成範圍傷害。當它到達目標位置時會爆發，釋放出熔岩投射物。爆發後，裂縫會持續向敵人移動再次爆發。限定斧、錘、權杖、長杖或空手。",
		["Slam the ground, creating a winding fissure that deals area damage while travelling outwards. When it reaches the target location it erupts, releasing a burst of molten projectiles. Requires an Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Staff or Unarmed."]="猛擊地面，製造一道曲折的裂縫，在向外蔓延時造成範圍傷害。當它到達目標位置時會爆發，釋放出熔岩投射物。限定斧、錘、權杖、長杖或空手。",
		["Slam the ground, damaging enemies in an area around the impact in three stages of increasing size. Enemies take slightly less damage on the second and third stage, and can only be hit by one stage. Works with Swords, Maces, Sceptres, Axes, Staves and Unarmed."]="猛擊地面，在影響範圍內的敵人造成三個階段的傷害，範圍逐漸增大。敵人在第二和第三階段受到稍微較少的傷害，並且只能被一個階段擊中。限定劍、錘、權杖、斧、長杖和空手。",
		["Slam the ground, damaging enemies in an area. Slams with main hand weapon deal more damage. Slams with off hand weapon have larger area of effect. Requires dual-wielding Swords, Maces, Sceptres, or Axes to use."]="猛擊地面，對附近區域的敵人造成傷害。使用主手武器進行的打擊造成更多傷害。使用副手武器進行的打擊具有更大的範圍效果。限定雙持劍、錘、全杖或斧。",
		["Slam the ground, sending out a rectangular fissure that deals area damage to enemies and thrusts a large spike from the ground where it ends. Warcries or other Slam Attacks performed by you or allied players near the spike will cause it to shatter, damaging surrounding enemies. Works with Maces, Sceptres, Axes, Staves and Unarmed."]="重擊地面，發出長方形的裂縫對範圍內敵人造成傷害，並在結束時從地面刺出大型尖刺。你或友方玩家在尖刺附近使用戰吼或其他重擊技能會使尖刺粉碎，對附近敵人造成傷害。限定錘、權杖、斧、長杖和空手。",
		["Slam the ground, sending out rectangular fissures that deal area damage to enemies and thrust a spike from the ground when they end. The spikes shatter after a duration, damaging surrounding enemies. Works with Maces, Sceptres, Axes, Staves and Unarmed."]="重擊地面，發出長方形的裂縫對範圍內敵人造成傷害，並在結束時從地面刺出尖刺。在一段時間後尖刺會碎裂，對附近敵人造成傷害。限定錘、權杖、斧、長杖和空手。",
		["Slam the ground, sending out rectangular fissures that deal area damage to enemies and thrust a spike from the ground when they end. Warcries or other Slam Attacks performed by you or allied players near any spike will cause them to shatter, damaging surrounding enemies. Works with Maces, Sceptres, Axes, Staves and Unarmed."]="重擊地面，發出長方形的裂縫對範圍內敵人造成傷害，並在結束時從地面刺出尖刺。你或友方玩家在尖刺附近使用戰吼或其他重擊技能會使尖刺粉碎，對附近敵人造成傷害。限定錘、權杖、斧、長杖和空手。",
		["Slam the ground, unleashing a fiery fissure in front of you, dealing area damage and randomly releasing a number of smaller fissures branching off from it. Consume an Endurance Charge every third time you slam the ground with this skill. Requires a Mace, Sceptre, Sword, Axe, Staff, or Unarmed."]="猛擊地面並在你前方釋放熾熱的裂縫，造成範圍傷害並從中產生數個更小的裂縫。每 3 次你使用此技能重擊地面會消耗 1 顆耐力球。限定錘、權杖、劍、斧、長杖或空手。",
		["Slams the ground at a targeted location. If an enemy is near where you target, you'll teleport to it from a short distance away, slam, and create an area of consecrated ground. Can't be supported by Multistrike, and requires a Sword, Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Staff or Unarmed."]="重擊目標位置地面。如果目標位置附近有敵人，你會在重擊前傳送一小段距離至該位置，並額外製造奉獻地面。不能被多重打擊輔助。限定劍、斧、錘、長杖或空手。",
		["Slams the ground at a targeted location. If an enemy is near where you target, you'll teleport to it from a short distance away, slam, and create an area of consecrated ground. The cooldown can be bypassed by expending an Endurance Charge. Can't be supported by Multistrike, and requires a Sword, Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Staff or Unarmed."]="重擊目標位置地面。如果目標位置附近有敵人，你會在重擊前傳送一小段距離至該位置，並額外製造奉獻地面。可以消耗耐力球無視冷卻時間。不能被多重打擊輔助。限定劍、斧、錘、長杖或空手。",
		["Slams the ground in front of you, creating a wave that travels forward and damages enemies with an increased chance to stun. The wave deals more damage to closer enemies. Requires an Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Staff or Unarmed."]="重擊地面並製造出一道向前釋放的衝擊波，被此衝擊波擊中的敵人將會受到傷害並有較高機率被擊暈。衝擊波對近距離的敵人造成更多傷害。限定斧、錘、權杖、長杖或空手。",
		["Slams the ground in front of you, creating a wave that travels forward and damages enemies. Requires an Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Staff or Unarmed."]="在你面前猛烈地砸地，創造一道向前移動並傷害敵人的衝擊波。限定斧、錘、權杖、長杖或空手。",
		["Slams the ground in front of you, creating a wave that travels in all directions that damages enemies with an increased chance to stun. The wave deals more damage to closer enemies. Requires an Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Staff or Unarmed."]="重擊地面並製造出向周圍釋放具有傷害的衝擊波。衝擊波對近距離的敵人造成更多傷害。限定斧、錘、權杖、長杖或空手。",
		["Slams the ground in front of you, creating a wide wave that travels forward and damages enemies with an increased chance to stun. Requires a Two Handed Axe, Two Handed Mace, or Staff."]="重擊地面並製造出一道向前釋放的衝擊波，被此衝擊波擊中的敵人將會受到傷害並有較高機率被擊暈。衝擊波對近距離的敵人造成更多傷害。限定雙手斧、雙手錘或長杖。",
		["Slams the ground with a Mace, Sceptre, Axe or Staff, creating a wave of broken ground that damages enemies in an area in front of you. Enemies hit by the wave will release a circular shockwave, dealing damage to other enemies around them."]="使用你的錘、斧或長杖重擊地面，在你前方製造出一道破碎地面對敵人造成傷害。被破碎地面擊中的敵人周圍將會產生能對其他敵人造成傷害的衝擊波。",
		["Slams the ground, creating a slow wave of churning terrain that damages enemies in a sequence of areas in front of you. A number of enemies hit by the wave will release a shockwave, damaging other enemies around them. Using the skill again will stop the previous wave. Requires a Mace, Sceptre, Axe, Staff or Unarmed."]="重擊地面造成緩慢的顛簸地形，對你在面前區域內的敵人造成傷害。數個被震波擊中的敵人會釋放衝擊波，對他們附近的敵人造成傷害。在次使用技能會停止前次的震波。限定錘、權杖、斧、長杖或空手。",
		["Slams the ground, creating a slow wave of churning terrain that damages enemies in a sequence of areas in front of you. A number of enemies hit by the wave will release a shockwave, damaging other enemies around them. Using the skill again will stop the previous wave. When the wave reaches a target or terrain, it can restart aiming towards an enemy, if one is in range. Requires a Mace, Sceptre, Axe, Staff or Unarmed."]="重擊地面，產生一道移動的震盪波，對你前方的敵人依序造成傷害。震盪波擊中敵人後釋放出震波，對周圍其他敵人造成傷害。再次使用此技能將使前一震盪波停止行進。震盪波遭遇目標或地形時，如果範圍中有敵人，則會重新導向到其身上。需要裝備錘、權杖、斧、長杖，或是空手。",
		["Slams the ground, creating a wave of churning terrain that damages enemies in a sequence of areas in front of you. A number of enemies hit by the wave will release a shockwave, damaging other enemies around them. Requires a Mace, Sceptre, Axe, Staff or Unarmed."]="重擊地面造成一波翻騰的地形，對你前方的一連串區域造成傷害。被波浪擊中的敵人中的一些將釋放一個震波，對其附近的其他敵人造成傷害。限定錘、權杖、斧、長杖或空手。",
		["Slashes twice, releasing waves of force that damage enemies they hit. Enemies in the middle of the slashes can be hit by both. Requires a One Handed Axe or One Handed Sword."]="揮斬兩次，釋放出擊中的敵人的衝擊波。在斬擊中間的敵人可能會被兩者都擊中。限定單手斧或單手劍。",
		["Slashes twice, releasing waves of force that damage enemies they hit. Enemies in the middle of the slashes can be hit by both. The slashes will have a chance to inflict bleeding in Blood Stance, or have a wider angle in Sand Stance. Can be used with Axes and Swords. You are in Blood Stance by default."]="揮斬兩次，釋放出擊中的敵人的衝擊波。在斬擊中間的敵人可能會被兩者都擊中。在血腥姿態中，斬擊有機會造成流血；在沙戮姿態中，斬擊的角度將更寬。限定斧和劍。預設血腥姿態。",
		["Slashes twice, releasing wide waves of force that damage enemies they hit. Enemies in the middle of the slashes can be hit by both. Requires a Two Handed Axe or Two Handed Sword."]="揮斬兩次，釋放出擊中的敵人的寬泛衝擊波。在斬擊中間的敵人可能會被兩者都擊中。限定雙手斧或雙手劍。",
		["Smash the ground to bring forth multiple spears to damage enemies. When in Blood Stance, multiple spikes burst from the ground in sequence, able to hit enemies multiple times. In Sand Stance, the spikes are thrust outwards. Requires a Sword or Axe. You are in Blood Stance by default."]="使用你的武器打擊地面，使矛從地面刺出。在血腥姿態時，這些矛會在你指定的位置貫穿多次，在沙戮姿態時，從指定位置向四方進行貫穿。限定劍和斧。預設血腥姿態。",
		["Smash the ground to bring forth multiple spikes from the ground in sequence, able to hit enemies multiple times.\nRequires a Sword or Axe."]="使用你的武器打擊地面，使矛從地面連續刺出，可以擊中敵人多次。\n限定劍和斧。",
		["Smashes the ground, dealing damage in an area and cracking the earth. The crack will erupt in a powerful aftershock after a duration. Cracks created before the first one has erupted will not generate their own aftershocks. Requires an Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Staff or Unarmed."]="猛擊地面，對附近區域造成傷害並裂開地面。在一段時間後，裂縫將爆發為強力的餘震。在第一個裂縫爆發之前製造的裂縫將不會產生自己的餘震。限定斧、錘、權杖、長杖或空手。",
		["Smashes the ground, dealing damage in an area and cracking the earth. The crack will erupt in a powerful aftershock after a short duration. After using this skill, your steps will deal damage around you, cracking the earth if the previous cracks have erupted. This effect ends after a secondary duration, or after a maximum number of aftershocks. Requires an Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Staff or Unarmed."]="重擊地面，對周圍造成大量傷害，並在多處地面上留下裂痕。在一小段時間後裂痕會爆發成餘震。你的腳步會使先前已爆發裂痕的地面碎裂，對你附近造成傷害持續一段時間。此效果在第二階段持續時間後結束，或在最大次餘震後結束。限定斧、錘、權杖、長杖或空手。",
		["Spawns Bone Archer corpses around the targeted location."]="在目標位置生成骷髏之弓的屍體。",
		["Spawns corpses around you while you move, based on monsters in the current area. If you are using the Raise Spectre skill there is a chance to spawn spectral corpses matching your most recently raised Spectres. Spectral corpses cannot be interacted with except by Minion skills."]="當你移動時，會在周圍基於當前區域內的怪物生成屍體。如果你正在使用喚醒幽魂技能，有機率生成與你最近召喚的幽魂同樣的幽魂亡體。除了召喚物技能外，不能以其他方式與幽魂亡體互動。",
		["Spawns daemons in specific locations to restrict player movement skills"]="在指定地點生成惡魔來阻擋玩家的位移技能",
		["Spends a portion of your mana to grant a buff that takes some of the damage from hits for you until depleted. The buff grants added lightning damage based on the amount of mana spent by this skill. Shares a cooldown with other Guard skills."]="花費你一部分的魔力來獲得可幫你承受傷害的增益效果，直到該增益效果耗盡。根據此技能消耗的魔力，增益效果給予附加閃電傷害。與其它守護技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Spin and attack in place, damaging nearby enemies and pulling others towards you. While using this skill, you cannot be stunned or knocked back. Cannot be supported by Ruthless."]="以自體為中心在原地進行旋轉攻擊，周圍的敵人將會被拉向你並受到傷害。當引導施放此技能時不會被暈眩或擊退。不能被殘暴輔助。",
		["Spin with a sword or axe to deal damage in an area around you. If you have at least 10 rage, create a ragestorm attached to you that repeatedly deals attack damage to enemies inside based on your attack speed. The ragestorm consumes rage at an accelerating rate, and ends if you run out."]="用劍或斧頭旋轉以在你附近的區域造成傷害。若你至少有 10 層盛怒，製造一個繞著你的盛怒風暴，根據你的攻擊速度，持續對範圍內的敵人造成攻擊傷害。盛怒風暴以加速的速率消耗盛怒，並在你盛怒用盡時結束。",
		["Spin with a sword or axe to deal damage in an area around you. Sacrifices some rage to send a ragestorm forward. While enemies are inside it, the ragestorm will slow its movement and repeatedly deal attack damage based on your attack speed."]="用劍或斧頭旋轉以在你附近的區域造成傷害。犧牲一些盛怒來向前發送盛怒風暴。當敵人在範圍內時，盛怒風暴會減慢它的移動速度，並根據你的攻擊速度持續造成攻擊傷害。",
		["Stars fall, raining destruction down over an area. Falling stars deal Attack Damage.\nCannot be Supported by Trigger Support Gems."]="星空殞落，對一片區域降下毀滅。殞落的群星會造成攻擊傷害。\n無法被觸發輔助寶石輔助。",
		["Strike your enemies with a melee weapon, building up static energy on you. This energy damages enemies around you when it expires, dealing damage that cannot be evaded or dodged."]="使用近戰武器對敵人進行攻擊，並對己身充能。當能量釋放時會對你周圍的敵人造成傷害。",
		["Strike your foes down with a powerful blow."]="對你的敵人無情痛擊。",
		["Strikes enemies in front of you with a surge of flame. Burning enemies are dealt more damage. If you hit an ignited enemy, will create burning ground under them. Your damage modifiers don't apply to this burning ground."]="釋放怒焰之力對前方敵人進行攻擊。燃燒中的敵人將會受到更多傷害。若你擊中點燃的敵人，會在他們下方製造燃燒地面。你的傷害詞綴不會影響此燃燒地面。",
		["Strikes enemies in front of you with a surge of flame. If this ignites an enemy a large area of burning ground will be created under them. Your damage modifiers don't apply to this burning ground."]="釋放怒焰之力對前方敵人進行攻擊。若此點燃敵人，會在它們下方製造大範圍的燃燒地面。你的傷害詞綴不會影響此燃燒地面。",
		["Summon Skeleton Archer minions at the targeted location. They fire arrows and die after a duration."]="在指定位置召喚骷髏弓箭手。它們會發射箭矢並在一段時間後死亡。",
		["Summon Skeleton Mage minions of random elemental types at the targeted location. They cast projectile spells based on their element, and die after a duration."]="在指定位置召喚隨機元素類型的骷髏法師。它們會根據自己的元素施放投射物法術，並在一段時間後死亡。",
		["Summon Skeleton Warrior minions at the targeted location. They use a melee attack and die after a duration. If made aggressive, Skeleton Warriors will also dash towards nearby enemies."]="在指定位置召喚骷髏戰士。他們會使用近戰攻擊並在持續時間結束後死亡。若他們有侵略性，骷髏戰士會衝刺到附近的敵人。",
		["Summon a Chilling Skitterbot and a Shocking Skitterbot, which will trigger your traps and detonate your mines. Mines detonated by Skitterbots will re-arm and can then be detonated again. The Skitterbots grant you more trap and mine damage, and cannot be targeted or damaged."]="召喚一個冰緩探測機獸和一個感電探測機獸，該探測機會觸發你的陷阱和引爆你的地雷。被探測機引爆的地雷會重新佈署並可再次被引爆。探測機給予你更多陷阱和地雷傷害，且不會被瞄準或受傷。",
		["Summon a Holy Relic that stays near you. When you hit an enemy with an attack, the Holy Relic triggers a nova spell with a short cooldown, that deals physical damage to enemies and grants life regeneration to allies in an area around it. This life regeneration is higher when applied to minions."]="召喚一個聖物待在你附近。當你的攻擊擊中敵人，聖物會釋放一個有短冷卻時間的星形法術，對周圍區域內的敵人造成物理傷害，並使友方獲得生命回復。此生命回復對於召喚物有卓越的效果。",
		["Summon a Holy Relic that stays near you. When you hit an enemy with an attack, the Holy Relic triggers a spell with a short cooldown, that deals physical damage to enemies in an area around a nearby enemy."]="召喚一個聖物待在你附近。當你的攻擊擊中敵人，聖物會釋放一個有短冷卻時間的星形法術，對附近一名敵人周圍區域內的敵人造成物理傷害。",
		["Summon a Void Spawn minion, which casts a lightning projectile spell with a chance to shock enemies."]="召喚一個虛空幼蟲召喚物，能施放有機會讓敵人感電的閃電投射物法術。",
		["Summon two Bone Feeders which follow you around. Bone Feeders consume corpses they walk over, creating a temporary Aura after consuming 10 corpses. One Bone Feeder creates a Curse Aura of either Temporal Chains, Enfeeble or Punishment that ignores Curse Limits. The other Bone Feeder creates an Aura that causes Enemy Damage with Hits to be Unlucky."]="召喚兩隻會跟隨你的骸骨吞噬者。骸骨吞噬者會吞噬牠們經過的屍體；每吞噬 10 具屍體，便會產生一個暫時性光環。其中一隻骸骨吞噬者會產生一個詛咒光環，隨機施加時空鎖鏈、衰弱或懲戒其中一種詛咒，且無視詛咒上限。另一隻骸骨吞噬者則會產生一個光環，使敵人的擊中傷害變的不幸。",
		["Summon two Triggerbots which follow you around and run towards enemies."]="召喚 2 隻觸發機械跟隨你，並向敵人衝去。",
		["Summons Arbalist minions which use projectile attacks."]="召喚使用投射物攻擊的弩兵召喚物。",
		["Summons Living Lightning Minions, which target nearby enemies with a number of Melee Chaining Attacks before dissipating. Enemies will not directly engage these Minions, and can pass through them."]="召喚活體閃電召喚物，牠們會以多次近戰連鎖攻擊鎖定附近的敵人，然後消散。敵人不會直接攻擊這些召喚物，且可以穿過牠們。",
		["Summons a Bestial Rhoa. In addition to its melee attack, the Bestial Rhoa uses a charge and has an aura that intimidates enemies. Enemies will not engage this minion directly, and they are immune to damage."]="召喚一隻兇猛的恐喙鳥。除了使用近戰攻擊，還會衝撞並使用光環威嚇附近敵人。敵人不會直接攻擊這個召喚物，並且它們對傷害免疫。",
		["Summons a Bestial Snake. The Bestial Snake fires powerful chaos projectile attacks. Enemies will not engage this minion directly, and they are immune to damage."]="召喚一隻兇猛蟒蛇。發射強大的混沌投射物攻擊。敵人不會直接攻擊這個召喚物，並且它們對傷害免疫。",
		["Summons a Bestial Ursa. In addition to its melee attack, the Bestial Ursa uses a powerful Ground Slam and Rallying Cry. Enemies will not engage this minion directly, and they are immune to damage."]="召喚一隻兇猛之爪。除了使用近戰攻擊，還會強大的裂地之擊和激勵戰吼。敵人不會直接攻擊這個召喚物，並且它們對傷害免疫。",
		["Summons a Carrion Golem that grants added physical damage for your non-golem minions. The Carrion Golem attacks with a series of slashes that increase in speed and damage, as well as a cascade of bone spikes, and deals more damage for each of your non-golem minions near it."]="召喚一個食腐魔像，給予你的非魔像召喚物附加物理傷害。食腐魔像會施展連續攻擊且越來越快越來越痛，同時會有骨刺爆發，每個附近的非魔像召喚物使他造成更多傷害。",
		["Summons a Carrion Golem. The Carrion Golem attacks with a series of slashes that increase in speed and damage, as well as a cascade of bone spikes."]="召喚一個食腐魔像。腐魔像會施展連續攻擊且越來越快越來越痛，同時會有骨刺爆發。",
		["Summons a Carrion Golem. The Carrion Golem attacks with a series of slashes that increase in speed and damage, can consume corpses to heal itself and gain the ability to unleash a devastating cascade of bone spikes, and deals more damage for each of your non-golem minions near it."]="召喚一個食腐魔像。腐魔像會施展連續攻擊且越來越快越來越痛，可以消耗屍體治癒自己，並釋放毀滅性的骨刺爆發，並根據它附近每個非魔像召喚物造成更多傷害。",
		["Summons a Chaos Golem that grants you damage over time and chaos resistance. The Chaos Golem can cast a damage over time Chaos aura and a cascade of Chaos spikes in addition to its melee attack."]="召喚混沌魔像，啟動時會使你獲得持續傷害和混沌抗性。混沌魔像會施放一個造成持續傷害的混沌光環並在近戰攻擊附加額外的混沌之刺。",
		["Summons a Chaos Golem. The Chaos Golem can cast a damage over time Chaos aura and a cascade of Chaos spikes in addition to its melee attack."]="召喚混沌魔像。混沌魔像會施放一個造成持續傷害的混沌光環並在近戰攻擊附加額外的混沌之刺。",
		["Summons a Chaos Golem. The Chaos Golem can cast a powerful damage over time Chaos aura that Withers enemies in addition to its melee attack."]="召喚混沌魔像。混沌魔像施放強大的持續傷害的混沌光環，並在近戰攻擊附加凋零。",
		["Summons a Demon Beast. This is a non-combat entity."]="召喚來自超越的個體。",
		["Summons a Demon Harpy. This is a non-combat entity."]="召喚來自超越的個體。",
		["Summons a Demon Imp. This is a non-combat entity."]="召喚來自超越的個體。",
		["Summons a Flame Golem that grants you increased Damage and Area of Effect. The Flame Golem can cast a fire spray, a wave of fire damage, and an explosive arcing projectile."]="召喚烈焰魔像，啟動時會使你增加傷害和效果範圍。烈焰魔像會使出火焰放射，持續造成火焰傷害，及射出會爆炸的弧狀移動投射物。",
		["Summons a Flame Golem. The Flame Golem can cast a fire spray, a wave of fire damage, and an explosive arcing projectile."]="召喚烈焰魔像。烈焰魔像會使用火焰放射，持續造成火焰傷害，及射出會爆炸的弧狀移動投射物。",
		["Summons a Flame Golem. When summoned, the Flame Golem attacks by falling from the sky, dealing fire damage in an area and leaving burning ground around the impact. After landing, it can cast a fire spray and a wave of fire damage."]="召喚烈焰魔像。召喚時，烈焰魔像從天空墜落進行攻擊，在區域內造成火焰傷害，並在影響範圍附近留下燃燒地面。落地後，它還可以施放火焰噴射和一波火焰傷害。",
		["Summons a Lightning Golem that grants you increased attack and cast speed, and mana regeneration. The Lightning Golem fires a projectile spell, creates orbs of Lightning that zap nearby enemies, and casts a temporary aura that grants added Lightning Damage to spells and attacks used by the Golem and its nearby allies."]="召喚一個閃電魔像，給予你額外的攻擊和施放速度，以及魔力回復。閃電魔像會對敵人發射投射物法術、製造會殘喘附近敵人的電球、並施放一個暫時的光環讓魔像和附近友方的法術和攻擊附加閃電傷害。",
		["Summons a Lightning Golem. The Lightning Golem fires a projectile spell, creates orbs of Lightning that zap nearby enemies, and casts a temporary aura that grants added Lightning Damage to spells and attacks used by the Golem and its nearby allies."]="召喚一個閃電魔像。魔像會對敵人發射投射物法術、製造會殘喘附近敵人的電球、並施放一個暫時的光環讓魔像和附近的友方附加閃電傷害。",
		["Summons a Pale Angel. This is a non-combat entity."]="召喚來自超越的個體。",
		["Summons a Pale Cherubim. This is a non-combat entity."]="召喚來自超越的個體。",
		["Summons a Pale Servitor. This is a non-combat entity."]="召喚來自超越的個體。",
		["Summons a Phantasm minion, which uses a piercing projectile spell that deals physical damage."]="召喚一個幻影，使用穿透的投射物法術造成物理傷害。",
		["Summons a Reaper which uses a variety of slashing area attacks. The presence of any Reapers weakens your other non-Reaper minions, and Reapers will consume them to temporarily empower and heal themselves."]="召喚一個會使用許多揮擊範圍攻擊的奪魂鐮。奪魂鐮存在時會弱化你其它非奪魂鐮召喚物，奪魂鐮會吞噬它們來短暫強化和治癒奪魂鐮。",
		["Summons a Relic of a random element that stays near you. Depending on the element chosen, the relic minion will have an Anger, Hatred, or Wrath aura. These relics explode when they die, dealing elemental damage to enemies around them. If you already have a relic of the chosen element, its duration will be refreshed instead of summoning a new one."]="在你身邊照換一個隨機元素的聖物。根據元素種類，聖物召喚物會有憤怒、憎恨或雷霆光環。聖物死亡時會爆炸，對附近敵人造成元素傷害。若你已經有所選元素的聖物，會刷新它的持續時間，而不是召喚新的。",
		["Summons a Sentinel of Radiance which follows you and attacks enemies in melee, while burning enemies around it and taking a portion of damage from hits for you. You can only have one Sentinel of Radiance."]="召喚光輝護衛跟隨你並用近戰攻擊敵人，且會燃燒它附近的敵人並替你承受部分擊中傷害。你只能有一個光輝護衛。",
		["Summons a Spectral Tiger Companion that attacks nearby enemies and dies after a duration. Each Spectral Tiger grants you a buff that increases Critical Strike Chance, and increases Attack and Cast Speed. If you have the maximum number of them, refreshes the duration and life of an existing one instead."]="召喚一隻幽魂虎夥伴攻擊周遭敵人，並在一段時間後死亡。每一隻幽魂虎都為你帶來增加暴擊機率、以及增加攻擊和施放速度的增益。如果你已擁有最大數量的幽魂虎，則改為增加一隻的持續時間並重置其生命。",
		["Summons a Stone Golem that grants you life regeneration and defences. In addition to its melee attack, the Stone Golem uses a rolling charge and a powerful slam that can taunt enemies."]="召喚一個為你提供額外生命回復和防禦的巨石魔像。除了一般的近戰攻擊外，巨石魔像會使用滾動衝撞，還有沉重的衝擊波來嘲諷附近的敵人。",
		["Summons a Stone Golem that takes a portion of the melee damage you recieve from enemy hits from its life before yours. In addition to its melee attack, the Stone Golem uses a rolling charge and a powerful slam that can taunt enemies."]="召喚一個巨石魔像，它將承受你從敵人攻擊中受到的部分近戰傷害，以減少你的損傷。除了它的近戰攻擊外，巨石魔像還使用滾動衝刺和強力猛擊，可以嘲諷敵人。",
		["Summons a Stone Golem. In addition to its melee attack, the Stone Golem uses a rolling charge and a powerful slam that can taunt enemies."]="召喚一個巨石魔像。除了一般的近戰攻擊外，巨石魔像會使用滾動衝撞，還有沉重的衝擊波來嘲諷附近的敵人。",
		["Summons a Taunting Contraption that taunts nearby enemies to attack it."]="召喚一個嘲諷機械，嘲諷附近敵人攻擊它。",
		["Summons a ballista totem that attacks with forking arrows.\nRequires a Bow."]="召喚一座砲塔，使用穿透箭矢攻擊。限定弓。",
		["Summons a ballista totem that attacks with piercing arrows. Requires a Bow."]="召喚一座砲塔，使用穿透箭矢攻擊。限定弓。",
		["Summons a ballista totem that consumes your Steel Shards to fire multiple arrows with extreme force, breaking them apart into shrapnel. Enemies can be hit by multiple arrows from the same attack. Requires a Bow. Steel Shards are gained with the Call of Steel Skill."]="召喚一個砲塔，消耗你的鋼鐵碎片來發射強力的多重箭矢，並將箭矢粉碎至碎片。敵人可以被同個多重箭矢擊中多次。限定弓。鋼鐵碎片透過鋼之呼喚技能獲得。",
		["Summons a ballista totem that fires multiple arrows with extreme force, breaking them apart into shrapnel. Enemies can be hit by multiple arrows from the same attack. Requires a Bow."]="召喚一個砲塔，發射強力的多重箭矢並將箭矢粉碎至碎片。敵人可被同次攻擊擊中多次。限定弓。",
		["Summons a ballista totem that propels a number of fiery arrows into the air, each targeting a specific enemy. Arrows deal area damage to enemies around it on landing. Requires a Bow."]="召喚一個砲塔圖騰，瘋狂的對空中發射箭矢。箭矢對直線地面造成影響，每個都對靠近它的敵人造成傷害。限定弓。",
		["Summons a ballista totem that propels a sequence of fiery arrows into the air. The arrows impact the ground in a line, each dealing area damage to enemies around it. Requires a Bow."]="召喚一個砲塔圖騰，瘋狂的對空中發射箭矢。箭矢對直線地面造成影響，每個都對靠近它的敵人造成傷害。限定弓。",
		["Summons a ballista totem that propels a sequence of fiery arrows into the air. The arrows impact the ground in two perpendicular lines, each dealing area damage to enemies around it. Requires a Bow."]="召喚一個砲塔圖騰，瘋狂的對空中發射箭矢。箭矢對直線地面造成影響，每個都對靠近它的敵人造成傷害。限定弓。",
		["Summons a horde of Hiveborn Breach monsters to do your bidding. These summoned monsters have all their physical damage converted to cold."]="召喚一支聽從你的指揮的巢裔裂痕怪物軍隊。這些被召喚的怪物會將物理傷害轉換為冰冷傷害。",
		["Summons a powerful Reaper which passively follows you without attacking enemies. The Reaper's presence weakens your other minions, and it will consume them to temporarily empower and heal itself. Using this skill while the Reaper is already summoned causes it to dash to the targeted location and perform a powerful attack. Cannot be triggered, supported by Spell Echo or Unleash, or used by Totems, Traps, or Mines."]="召喚一個強大的奪魂鐮跟隨你，但不會攻擊敵人。奪魂鐮存在時會弱化你其它的召喚物，並會吞噬它們來短暫強化和治癒奪魂鐮。當已召喚奪魂鐮時使用此技能，會使它衝向指定位置，並使用強力攻擊。不能被觸發，被施放迴響或釋放輔助，或被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用。",
		["Summons a powerful Reaper which uses a variety of slashing area attacks. The Reaper's presence weakens your other minions, and it will consume them to temporarily empower and heal itself. Using this skill while the Reaper is already summoned causes it to dash to the targeted location and perform a powerful attack."]="召喚一個會使用許多揮擊範圍攻擊的強大奪魂鐮。奪魂鐮存在時會弱化你其它的召喚物，並會吞噬它們來短暫強化和治癒奪魂鐮。已召喚奪魂鐮時再次使用技能，會使奪魂鐮衝向指定位置使用強大的攻擊。",
		["Summons a ring of ballista totems around a targeted location. These ballistae fire once at the targeted location and then expire. Requires a Bow."]="在目標區域周圍召喚一道砲塔圖騰環。這些砲塔對目標區域開火一次後消失。需要裝備弓。",
		["Summons a short-lived flaming skull that rushes at nearby enemies and attacks them rapidly, converting all its physical damage to fire. Enemies will not directly engage these spirits, and can pass through them."]="召喚只能存在極短時間的憤怒狂靈，這些火焰骷髏將會衝至敵人身邊並快速的進行攻擊，全部物理傷害轉化至火焰。敵方生物將不會主動攻擊這些狂靈，並可以穿越它們。",
		["Summons a spectral wolf companion that attacks nearby enemies and dies after a duration. Each spectral wolf grants you a buff that adds damage to your attacks. If you have the maximum number of them, refreshes the duration and life of an existing one instead."]="召喚一匹幽狼攻擊週遭的敵人，並在一段時間內死亡。每隻幽狼使你攻擊附加傷害。若達最大數量，刷新現有的持續時間和生命。",
		["Summons a totem that can consume nearby corpses. If you are hurt, it will destroy a corpse to leech life to you."]="召喚一個圖騰，它會吞噬附近的屍體並為你回復生命。",
		["Summons a totem that casts a beam of fire at you and each other totem you control, dealing burning damage to enemies caught in the beam. Enemies near either end of a beam also suffer burning damage."]="召喚一個圖騰，它會與你和你所操控的所有圖騰之間產生火焰連結，經過火焰連結或是靠近火焰連結尾端的敵人將會受到燃燒傷害。",
		["Summons a totem that casts a beam of fire at you and each other totem you control, dealing burning damage to enemies caught in the beam. Enemies near either end of a beam also suffer burning damage. Reaching maximum active totem count will cause all totems from this skill to detonate, applying the same burning damage for a duration."]="召喚一個會圖騰，它會對你和你所操控的所有圖騰之間施放一道光束，對被光束觸碰到的敵人造成燃燒傷害。靠近光束兩側尾端的敵人將會受到燃燒傷害。在達到最大啟用圖騰數量時會引爆所有來自此技能的圖騰，施加同樣的燃燒傷害，持續一段時間。",
		["Summons a totem that channels to fire a stream of flame at nearby enemies, and creates an area of consecrated ground around the totem."]="召喚一個圖騰，它會持續的對附近的敵人噴射火焰，並在圖騰附近製造奉獻地面區域。",
		["Summons a totem that fires a stream of flame at nearby enemies."]="召喚一個圖騰，它會持續的對附近的敵人噴射火焰。",
		["Summons a totem that has an aura which regenerates life for you and your nearby allies."]="召喚一個圖騰，它會施放一個光環並使你與受光環影響友方獲得額外的生命回復。",
		["Summons a totem that has an aura which regenerates life for you and your nearby allies. When things affected by the aura are hit, the totem's life is removed instead for some of the damage."]="召喚一個圖騰，它會施放一個光環並使你與受光環影響友方獲得額外的生命回復。當在此光環影響下被擊中時，部分傷害會從圖騰的生命扣除。",
		["Summons a totem that shakes the earth around it, knocking back and damaging nearby enemies"]="召喚一個圖騰，它會持續的震動附近的地面，擊退附近的敵人並造成傷害。",
		["Summons a totem that shakes the earth around you, damaging enemies."]="召喚一根圖騰，它會持續震動你附近的地面，對敵人造成傷害。",
		["Summons a totem that taunts nearby monsters to attack it."]="召喚一個圖騰，它會持續的嘲諷周圍的敵人對其進行攻擊。",
		["Summons an Ancestor Totem which attacks enemies with a powerful cascading slam while you're near it. If the enemies are far away, it will leap toward them as it slams. Being near it grants you more melee damage. Requires a Melee Weapon or Unarmed."]="召喚一個當你在附近時會使用強力連震攻擊的先祖圖騰。若敵人距離很遠，攻擊將會帶有躍擊使它靠近敵人。靠近時給予你更多近戰傷害。",
		["Summons an Ancestor Totem which attacks enemies with a powerful slam while you're near it. Being near it grants you more melee damage. Requires a Melee Weapon or Unarmed."]="召喚一個當你在附近時會使用強力攻擊的先祖圖騰。靠近時給予你更多近戰傷害。限定近戰武器或空手。",
		["Summons an Ancestor Totem which attacks enemies with melee strikes while you're near it. Being near it grants you more attack speed. Requires a Melee Weapon or Unarmed."]="召喚一個先祖圖騰，當你在附近時這個圖騰將使用近戰攻擊來攻擊周圍的敵人。接近圖騰時給予你更多攻擊速度。限定近戰武器或空手。",
		["Summons an Ice Golem that grants you increased Critical Strike Chance and Accuracy. The Ice Golem can use an icy barrage spell and a chilling spinning attack in addition to its melee attack."]="召喚寒冰魔像，啟動時會使你增加暴擊率和命中。寒冰魔像會施放寒冰彈幕並在近戰攻擊時附加額外的冰旋斬。",
		["Summons an Ice Golem. The Ice Golem can use an icy barrage spell and a chilling spinning attack in addition to its melee attack."]="召喚寒冰魔像。寒冰魔像會施放寒冰彈幕並在近戰攻擊時附加額外的冰旋斬。",
		["Summons an Ice Golem. The Ice Golem can use an icy barrage spell and a chilling spinning attack in addition to its melee attack. If reduced to low life it will trigger a spell that destroys itself to deal area damage and fire icy projectiles in a circle."]="召喚寒冰魔像。寒冰魔像會施放寒冰彈幕並在近戰攻擊時附加額外的冰旋斬。若魔像生命到達貧血時，會觸發自毀法術，造成範圍傷害並發射環形冰冷投射物。",
		["Summons an army of skeletal soldiers, archers and mages, led by a powerful general."]="召喚一支由強大的骷髏將軍所統率，由骷髏戰士、骷髏弓箭手與骷髏法師所組成的骷髏大軍。",
		["Summons an effigy of Doedre, which will project auras of all the curse skill gems socketed in Doedre's Skin. These curses have less effectiveness."]="召喚一個德瑞的肖像施放光環，包含所有放置於德瑞之膚的詛咒技能寶石。此詛咒會減少效果。",
		["Summons an icy shield that protects against physical and fire damage. It drains your mana while active and at a faster rate while you are moving. When you have no mana left, the skill turns off. While active, it leaves a trail of ground ice which lasts for a short duration."]="召喚刺骨的冰霜之盾，在作用的期間將會減免受到的物理及火焰傷害，同時走過的路面會短暫的結冰。喚出的冰霜之盾會持續消耗你的魔力直到不足以負荷，且移動的狀態下會消耗更多的魔力。",
		["Summons an illusion of K'Tash, the Hate Shepherd. This is a non-combat entity."]="召喚仇恨牧人．克塔什的幻象。此為非戰鬥實體。",
		["Summons an image of Beidat, Archangel of Death. This is a non-combat entity."]="召喚來自超越的個體。",
		["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion has two buff spells it will cast on you: Arcane Surge, granting increased Cast Speed and Mana Regeneration, and a buff that grants Chance to Shock and Lightning Penetration."]="召喚一個不朽的神諭召喚物。該召喚物會對你施放兩種增益法術：能增加你的施放速度和魔力回復的秘能波動，以及一種賦予感電機率和閃電穿透的增益效果。",
		["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion will cast a random buff on you that grants one or all of the following: 1 additional Projectile, +1 Chain, Pierce 1 additional Target, or Projectiles Fork."]="召喚一個超凡神諭。此神諭隨機對你施放以下一個或全部增益效果：1 個額外投射物、+1 連鎖、穿透 1 個額外目標和投射物分裂。",
		["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion will cast a random buff on you that grants one or all of the following: Fire 2 additional Projectiles, Chain 2 additional times, Projectiles Pierce 2 additional targets, or Projectiles Fork then Fork an additional time."]="召喚一個超凡神諭。此神諭隨機對你施放以下一個或全部增益效果：2 個額外投射物、+2 連鎖、穿透 2 個額外目標和投射物額外分裂 1 次。",
		["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion will occasionally apply a Chill or Shock to an enemy that chains to other nearby enemies."]="召喚一個超凡神諭。此神諭定期對一個敵人造成冰緩或感電並連鎖至附近敵人。",
		["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion will occasionally apply a Chill or Shock with increased effect to an enemy that chains to other nearby enemies."]="召喚一個超凡神諭。此神諭定期對一個敵人造成加強的冰緩或感電並連鎖至附近敵人。",
		["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion will occasionally cast Arcane Surge on you, granting increased Cast Speed and Mana Regeneration."]="召喚一個不朽的神諭召喚物。該召喚物會時不時對你施放秘能波動，增加你的施放速度和魔力回復。",
		["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion will occasionally create an aura on you that increases the Action Speed of you and all allies near you."]="召喚一個超凡神諭。此神諭定期對你產生一個光環，增加你和友方的行動速度。",
		["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion will occasionally create an aura on you that increases the Action Speed of you, and all allies and enemies near you."]="召喚一個超凡神諭。此神諭定期對你產生一個光環，增加你、友方和敵人的行動速度。",
		["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. When you are near a rare or unique enemy, the minion will occasionally grant you a buff giving significantly increased Damage, Attack Speed, and Movement Speed, and reducing the Damage you take."]="召喚一個超凡神諭。當你附近有稀有或傳奇敵人時，此神諭會給予你顯著增加傷害、攻擊速度、移動速度和減少承受傷害。",
		["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. When you are near a rare or unique enemy, the minion will occasionally grant you a buff giving significantly increased Damage, Attack Speed, and Movement Speed, reducing the Damage you take, and causing Bleeding Enemies that you Kill to Explode, dealing 10% of their maximum Life as Physical Damage."]="召喚一個超凡神諭。當你附近有稀有或傳奇敵人時，此神諭會給予你顯著增加傷害、攻擊速度、移動速度和減少承受傷害，並使你擊殺的流血敵人爆炸，造成 10% 他們最大生命的物理傷害。",
		["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. While you are channelling, the minion will occasionally cast a buff on you that reduces the Damage you take, and makes you avoid all Stuns and Elemental Ailments."]="召喚一個超凡神諭。當你在引導施放時，此神諭定期對你施放一個增益效果，減少你承受傷害並免易暈眩和元素異常狀態。",
		["Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. While you are channelling, the minion will occasionally cast a buff on you that reduces the Damage you take, makes you avoid all Stuns and Elemental Ailments, and prevents Curses affecting you."]="召喚一個超凡神諭。當你在引導施放時，此神諭定期對你施放一個增益效果，減少你承受傷害並免易暈眩和元素異常狀態，並防止詛咒影響你。",
		["Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Arohongui tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which makes travel skills recover cooldowns faster. Shares a Cooldown with other Spirit Chieftain Skills."]="召喚艾蘿紅薇部落的永恆酋長跟你戰鬥一段時間。此召喚物會給予增益，使快行技能恢復更快速。與其它靈魂酋長技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Hinekora tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which regenerates mana. Shares a Cooldown with other Spirit Chieftain Skills."]="召喚悉妮蔻拉部落的永恆酋長跟你戰鬥一段時間。此召喚物會給予增益，回復魔力。與其它靈魂酋長技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Kitava tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which makes a percentage of your leech recover instantly. Shares a Cooldown with other Spirit Chieftain Skills."]="召喚奇塔弗部落的永恆酋長跟你戰鬥一段時間。此召喚物會給予增益，使你的部分偷取為立即。與其它靈魂酋長技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Ngamahu tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which allows totems to take some damage from hits for you. Shares a Cooldown with other Spirit Chieftain Skills."]="召喚拿瑪乎部落的永恆酋長跟你戰鬥一段時間。此召喚物會給予增益，使圖騰替你承受部分擊中傷害。與其它靈魂酋長技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Ramako tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which prevents additional damage from suppressed spells. Shares a Cooldown with other Spirit Chieftain Skills."]="召喚雷默科部落的永恆酋長跟你戰鬥一段時間。此召喚物會給予增益，防止壓抑法術的額外傷害。與其它靈魂酋長技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Rongokurai tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which lets a percentage of your armour protect against all damage types. Shares a Cooldown with other Spirit Chieftain Skills."]="召喚隆格庫萊部落的永恆酋長跟你戰鬥一段時間。此召喚物會給予增益，使你的部分護甲可以保護全部傷害類型。與其它靈魂酋長技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Tasalio tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which prevents your action speed being lowered. Shares a Cooldown with other Spirit Chieftain Skills."]="召喚塔薩里奧部落的永恆酋長跟你戰鬥一段時間。此召喚物會給予增益，防止你的行動速度被減緩。與其它靈魂酋長技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Tawhoa tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which refills flasks. Shares a Cooldown with other Spirit Chieftain Skills."]="召喚塔赫亞部落的永恆酋長跟你戰鬥一段時間。此召喚物會給予增益，補充藥劑。與其它靈魂酋長技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Tukohama tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which regenerates rage. Shares a Cooldown with other Spirit Chieftain Skills."]="召喚圖克哈瑪部落的永恆酋長跟你戰鬥一段時間。此召喚物會給予增益，回復盛怒。與其它靈魂酋長技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Valako tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which recovers life, mana and energy shield when you block. Shares a Cooldown with other Spirit Chieftain Skills."]="召喚瓦拉庫部落的永恆酋長跟你戰鬥一段時間。此召喚物會給予增益，當你格擋時恢復生命、魔力和能量護盾。與其它靈魂酋長技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Summons fiery elemental shields providing additional armour for a short duration. If cumulative physical damage prevented by your blocking or armour reaches a threshold, the shields explode outwards, dealing fire damage to surrounding enemies."]="召喚熾熱的火焰之盾，在一定時間內提供額外的護甲。當格擋或是護甲所累積受到的物理傷害達到限界值時，火焰之盾將會爆開，並對周圍的敵人造成傷害。",
		["Summons forth a field of grasping hands, each of which clutches an orb of lightning. When an enemy is near a hand, the orb it clutches will detonate to deal lightning spell damage."]="召喚出一片抓握之手，每隻手都緊握著一顆雷光球。當敵人接近某隻手時，其所握持的雷光球將會引爆，造成閃電法術傷害。",
		["Summons slow moving skeletal minions that decay over time. Does not require a corpse to be consumed."]="召喚移動緩慢且會隨著時間衰弱的骷髏。不需屍體來召喚。",
		["Summons three icy skull minions that explode at the end of their duration."]="召喚三個寒冰的顱骨，在持續時間結束時爆炸。此技能有短暫冷卻時間。",
		["Summons three invulnerable spectral skulls that rush at nearby enemies and attack them rapidly. Enemies will not engage these spirits, and can pass through them."]="召喚三隻會迅速移動並攻擊附近敵人的靈魂。這些靈魂無法受到傷害、不會成為目標、沒有碰撞效果。",
		["Supports Attack Skills, causing them to trigger Windburst on hit after you've travelled a certain distance. Cannot support triggered skills or skills used by things other than you. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助攻擊技能，使被輔助的技能在你移動一段距離後，擊中時會觸發風破。不能輔助觸發技能或不是由你使用的技能。無法修改召喚物的技能。",
		["Supports Herald skills causing them to have higher critical strike chance but no buff effect."]="輔助捷光環技能，使他們擁有更高的暴擊率但沒有增益效果。",
		["Supports Projectile Spells you cast yourself. Cannot support orb skills, triggered skills, brand skills, Vaal skills, channelling skills, skills with a reservation, or skills used by things other than you."]="輔助由你自身施放的投射物法術。無法輔助球體、觸發、烙印、瓦爾、引導、有保留需求、或由你以外的事物所使用的技能。",
		["Supports Skills which cause Damaging Hits, causing them to trigger Summon Living Lightning when dealing lightning damage. Cannot support skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Cannot modify the skills of Minions."]="輔助造成傷害擊中的技能，當其造成閃電傷害時會觸發召喚活躍閃電。無法輔助由圖騰、陷阱或地雷施放的技能。無法修改召喚物使用的技能。",
		["Supports Slam skills. Cannot support triggered skills or skills used by things other than you."]="輔助重擊技能。無法輔助觸發技能或不是由你自身使用的技能。",
		["Supports Vaal skills."]="輔助瓦爾技能。",
		["Supports Vaal spell skills, making them repeat when cast at the cost of your life and energy shield. Cannot support totem skills, channelling skills, triggered skills, instant skills, retaliation skills, blink skills, or skills with a reservation."]="輔助瓦爾法術技能，以消耗自身生命和能量護盾為代價使技能重複。無法輔助圖騰、引導、觸發、立即、復仇、閃現、或有保留需求的技能。",
		["Supports Wand Attacks, granting them a chance to trigger Kinetic Flux on critical strike. Cannot support triggered skills or skills used by things other than you. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助法杖攻擊，使他們暴擊時有機率觸發力量紊亂。無法輔助觸發技能或是由你以外的來源使用的技能。無法影響召喚物技能。",
		["Supports Wand Attacks, granting them a chance to trigger Kinetic Flux on kill. Cannot support triggered skills or skills used by things other than you. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助法杖攻擊技能，擊殺時有機率觸發力量流束。無法輔助被觸發的技能或由其他物體施放的技能。無法改變召喚物的技能。",
		["Supports Warcries that are not triggered. Supported Warcries create Consecrated Ground, but have lowered area of effect and cooldown recovery."]="輔助非觸發的戰吼。被輔助的戰吼會創造奉獻地面，但降低範圍效果和冷卻回復速度。",
		["Supports any bow or wand attack skill, causing it to summon a ballista totem that uses the skill for you."]="輔助使用弓和法杖的攻擊。不再使用技能而是召喚一個圖騰使用技能。",
		["Supports any channelling skill, protecting you from damage while you channel it. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助引導施放技能，你引導施放時保護你不讓你受傷。無法影響召喚物技能。",
		["Supports any non-blessing skill with a reservation."]="輔助任何有保留的非祝福技能。",
		["Supports any non-blessing skill. Minions cannot gain the Lifetap buff."]="輔助任何非祝福技能。召喚物不能獲得活栓增益效果。",
		["Supports any skill gem.\nCannot support skills that don't come from gems."]="輔助任何技能寶石。\n無法輔助不是源於寶石的技能。",
		["Supports any skill gem. Once this gem reaches level 2 or above, will apply a cost & reservation multiplier to supported gems. Cannot support skills that don't come from gems."]="輔助任何技能寶石。當此寶石到達 2 等以上，會讓被輔助的寶石套用消耗和保留加成。不能輔助來自非寶石的技能。",
		["Supports any skill gem. Once this gem reaches level 2 or above, will raise the level of supported gems. Cannot support skills that don't come from gems."]="輔助任何技能寶石。當此寶石到達 2 等以上，會讓輔助的寶石有額外的等級。不能輔助來自非寶石的技能。",
		["Supports any skill gem. Once this gem reaches level 2 or above, will raise the quality of supported gems. Cannot support skills that don't come from gems."]="輔助任何技能寶石。當此寶石到達 2 等以上，會讓輔助的寶石有額外的品質。不能輔助來自非寶石的技能。",
		["Supports any skill that can chill enemies or create chilling areas."]="輔助任何可冰緩敵人或製造冰緩區域的技能。",
		["Supports any skill that can kill enemies."]="輔助任何可以擊殺敵人的技能。",
		["Supports any skill that deals damage or has a duration."]="輔助任何造成傷害或期間的技能。",
		["Supports any skill that deals damage."]="輔助任何可造成傷害的技能。",
		["Supports any skill that has a duration, or can hit enemies to inflict ailments on them."]="輔助任何有期間的技能，或可以擊中敵人造成異常狀態。",
		["Supports any skill that has a duration."]="輔助任何有期間的技能。",
		["Supports any skill that hits enemies or inflicts ailments"]="輔助任何可擊中敵人或造成異常狀態的技能。",
		["Supports any skill that hits enemies, causing those hits to leech energy shield based on damage dealt."]="輔助任何可擊中敵人的技能，根據所造成傷害使擊中偷取能量護盾。",
		["Supports any skill that hits enemies, causing those hits to leech life based on damage dealt."]="輔助任何可擊中敵人的技能，根據擊中傷害偷取生命。",
		["Supports any skill that hits enemies, making it easier to stun enemies with those skills."]="輔助任何可擊中敵人的技能，讓技能更容易暈眩敵人。",
		["Supports any skill that hits enemies, making those hits penetrate enemy cold resistance."]="輔助任何可擊中敵人的技能，擊中穿透敵人冰冷抗性。",
		["Supports any skill that hits enemies, making those hits penetrate enemy elemental resistances."]="輔助任何可擊中敵人的技能，擊中穿透敵人元素抗性。",
		["Supports any skill that hits enemies, making those hits penetrate enemy fire resistance."]="輔助任何可擊中敵人的技能，擊中穿透敵人火焰抗性。",
		["Supports any skill that hits enemies, making those hits penetrate enemy lightning resistance."]="輔助任何可擊中敵人的技能，擊中穿透敵人閃電抗性。",
		["Supports any skill that hits enemies, or can deal burning damage directly."]="輔助任何可擊中敵人的技能，造成更多燃燒傷害。",
		["Supports any skill that hits enemies, or could otherwise apply elemental ailments."]="輔助任何可擊中敵人的技能，或造成元素異常狀態。",
		["Supports any skill that hits enemies."]="輔助任何可擊中敵人的技能。",
		["Supports any skill that hits enemies. If enemies are left below 10% of maximum life after being hit by these skills, they will be killed."]="輔助任何可擊中敵人的技能，擊中後血量等於或低於 10 % 時將會直接死亡。",
		["Supports any skill that hits enemies. If normal or magic enemies are left below a percentage of maximum life after being hit by these skills, they will be killed."]="輔助任何會擊中敵人的技能。若普通或魔法怪物在被已輔助技能擊中後低於一定百分比的最大血量，則擊殺他們。",
		["Supports any skill that hits enemies. Minions cannot gain Cruelty."]="輔助任何擊中敵人的技能。召喚物不會獲得殘酷。",
		["Supports any skill that hits or burns enemies, or inflicts elemental ailments."]="輔助任何可擊中或燃燒敵人，或造成元素異常狀態的技能。",
		["Supports any skill with a duration."]="輔助任何有期間的技能。",
		["Supports any skill with an area of effect, regardless of whether that skill deals damage."]="輔助任何範圍效果的技能，不管技能是否造成傷害。",
		["Supports any skill with an area of effect."]="輔助任何範圍效果的技能。",
		["Supports any skill you use to hit enemies yourself. Cannot support skills used by totems, traps, or mines."]="輔助任何你自己使用擊中敵人的技能。不能輔助圖騰、陷阱和地雷技能。",
		["Supports any skill. Minions, Totems, Traps and Mines cannot gain Inspiration Charges."]="輔助任何技能。召喚物、圖騰、陷阱和地雷無法獲得啟發球。",
		["Supports attack skills that aren't triggered."]="輔助不會被觸發的攻擊技能。",
		["Supports attack skills that can be used with Wands. Cannot support Vaal skills, minion skills, movement skills, or skills used by totems, traps, or mines."]="輔助法杖的攻擊技能。不能輔助瓦爾、召喚物、圖騰、陷阱或地雷技能。",
		["Supports attack skills that can be used with bows. Supported skills can only be used with bows. Cannot support Vaal skills, minion skills, movement skills, or skills used by totems, traps, or mines."]="輔助能使用弓的攻擊技能。不是使用弓沒有效果。不能輔助瓦爾、召喚物、圖騰、陷阱或地雷技能。",
		["Supports attack skills that fire projectiles, making the increase to physical melee damage from strength also increase their physical projectile damage."]="輔助發射投射物的攻擊技能，力量可以增加近戰物理傷害和物理投射物傷害。",
		["Supports attack skills that hit enemies, causing those hits to leech mana based on damage dealt."]="輔助任何可擊中敵人的攻擊技能，根據擊中傷害偷取魔力。",
		["Supports attack skills that use bows or wands and fire projectiles ahead. Instead of using that skill, you will throw mines that will use the skill for you when you detonate them, targeting your location. Mines cannot use channelling skills."]="輔助使用弓或向前發射投射物的攻擊技能。不是使用該技能，改為投擲地雷當你引爆時使用技能，瞄準你的位置。地雷不能使用引導施放技能。",
		["Supports attack skills, or other skills that can maim enemies."]="輔助攻擊技能，或其它可以癱瘓敵人的技能。",
		["Supports attack skills, or spell skills that deal damage."]="輔助造成傷害的攻擊和法術技能。",
		["Supports attack skills, providing a bonus to all damage dealt by those skills while your life is full."]="輔助攻擊技能，當你滿血時造成更多傷害。",
		["Supports attack skills."]="輔助攻擊技能。",
		["Supports attack skills. Cannot support skills that create minions."]="輔助攻擊技能。不能輔助製造召喚物的技能。",
		["Supports attack skills. Cannot support skills which create minions."]="輔助攻擊技能。不能輔助製造召喚物的技能。",
		["Supports attack skills. Cannot support triggered skills, skills which create minions, or skills used by totems, traps or mines."]="輔助攻擊技能。不能輔助觸發型技能、製造召喚物的技能或被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用的技能。",
		["Supports attacks, causing them to trigger the Prismatic Burst spell. Cannot support triggered attacks or attacks used by things other than you. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助攻擊技能，使它們觸發三相爆發法術。不能輔助觸發型攻擊或不是你使用的攻擊。無法影響召喚物技能。",
		["Supports aura skills that affect you and allies, increasing the aura's effect on allies, but preventing it from affecting you at all. Cannot support curse auras, or other auras that only affect enemies. Cannot support skills used by totems. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助影響你和友方的光環技能，增加光環對友方的效果，但光環不再對你產生效果。不能輔助詛咒光環或其他可對敵人造成效果的光環。不能輔助被圖騰使用的技能。無法影響召喚物技能。",
		["Supports aura skills that create permanent auras around you, changing their reservation to a cost and making them temporary. Cannot support banner or stance skills."]="輔助在你附近製造永久光環的光環技能，使它們的保留改變為消耗並且為暫時的。不能輔助鬥旗和姿態技能。",
		["Supports aura skills that reserve life or mana to create auras around you."]="輔助保留生命或魔力再你附近製造光環的光環技能。",
		["Supports banner skills. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助鬥旗技能。無法影響召喚物技能。",
		["Supports bow attack skills that fire arrows forwards as projectiles. These skills will instead fire a payload arrow into the air to land at a targeted location. The supported skills' arrows will then fire out in a circle from where it lands. Cannot support skills that already fire arrows into the air, channelled skills, or skills that create Minions."]="輔助往前發射箭矢投射物的弓攻擊技能。此技能將會改為發射裝載彈藥的箭矢至空中並落地於指定位置。被輔助的技能的投射物將會從箭矢落地點以新星形式發射。不能輔助朝空中發射箭矢的技能或製造召換物的技能。",
		["Supports bow attack skills, causing them to trigger when you've spent enough mana in total on other bow attacks. Cannot modify the skills of minions. Cannot support totems, traps, mines, Vaal skills, or channelling skills"]="輔助弓攻擊技能，當你在其它弓攻擊消耗足夠的魔力時，觸發這些技能。無法影響召喚物技能。不能輔助圖騰、陷阱、地雷、瓦爾技能或引導施放技能。",
		["Supports bow attack skills. Cannot support channelled skills, instant skills, Vaal skills, or skills used by totems, traps, or mines."]="輔助弓攻擊技能。不能輔助引導施放技能、立即技能、瓦爾技能或圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用的技能。",
		["Supports brand skills that can be recalled."]="輔助可以被召回的烙印技能。",
		["Supports channelling spells you cast yourself, significantly empowering their damage the longer they are channelled for, while also raising their cost. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助你自己施展的引導技能，引導時間越久，會大幅強化其傷害，同時增加其消耗。無法修改召喚物的技能。",
		["Supports hex curse skills, causing them to trigger Doom Blast when the hex ends. Cannot support curse skills which are triggered or applied as an aura."]="輔助咒術技能，當咒術結束時使這些技能觸發厄運枯萎。不能輔助被觸發或以光環施放的咒術。",
		["Supports hex curse skills, turning them into auras that will apply their effect to all enemies in an area around you."]="輔助咒術技能。使它們變成光環並作用於你附近的敵人。",
		["Supports hex curse skills."]="輔助咒術詛咒技能。",
		["Supports hex curse skills. Hexes from auras or cursed ground cannot transfer."]="輔助咒術詛咒技能。來自光環或詛咒地面的咒術不能被轉移。",
		["Supports link skills."]="輔助連結技能。",
		["Supports mark curse skills."]="輔助印記詛咒技能。",
		["Supports melee attack skills that are not triggered."]="輔助未被觸發的近戰攻擊技能。",
		["Supports melee attack skills which can be exerted. Cannot modify the skills of minions. Vaal skills and channelling skills cannot be exerted."]="支援可施展的近戰攻擊技能。無法改變召喚物技能。無法施展瓦爾技能和引導技能。",
		["Supports melee attack skills without a cooldown. Those skills will be used by Mirage Warriors summoned by General's Cry. Supported skills cannot be supported by Multistrike."]="輔助沒有冷卻時間的近戰攻擊技能。這些技能會被將軍戰吼召喚的幻影戰士使用。被輔助的技能不能被多重打擊輔助。",
		["Supports melee attack skills you use yourself. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助由你自身使用的近戰攻擊技能。無法影響召喚物的技能。",
		["Supports melee attack skills, causing them to deal more damage against bleeding enemies, but preventing those skills from inflicting bleeding on enemies in any way."]="輔助近戰攻擊技能，對流血的敵人造成更多傷害，但技能不再對敵人造成流血。",
		["Supports melee attack skills, making them repeat three times when used, targeting a random enemy each time. Cannot support Vaal skills, channelling skills, travel skills, retaliation skills or triggered skills."]="輔助近戰攻擊技能，使用時技能重複三次，每次隨機瞄準敵人。不能輔助瓦爾、引導施放、快行、復仇和觸發技能。",
		["Supports melee attack skills, making them repeat twice when used, targeting a random enemy each time. Cannot support Vaal skills, channelling skills, travel skills, retaliation skills or triggered skills."]="輔助近戰攻擊技能，使用時技能重複兩次，每次隨機瞄準敵人。不能輔助瓦爾、引導施放、快行、復仇和觸發技能。",
		["Supports melee attack skills."]="輔助近戰攻擊技能。",
		["Supports melee attack skills. Cannot support skills which create minions."]="輔助近戰攻擊技能。不能輔助創造召喚物的技能。",
		["Supports melee attack skills. Cannot support triggered attacks, attacks used by things other than you, or skills which create minions."]="輔助近戰攻擊技能。不能輔助觸發型攻擊、用其他東西攻擊而不是你或創造召喚物的技能。",
		["Supports melee attack skills. Minions cannot gain rage."]="輔助近戰攻擊技能。召喚物無法獲得盛怒。",
		["Supports melee attack skills. Those skills will be used by Mirage Warriors summoned by General's Cry. Supported skills cannot be supported by Multistrike."]="輔助近戰攻擊技能。這些技能會被將軍戰吼召喚的幻影戰士使用。被輔助的技能不能被多重打擊輔助。",
		["Supports melee attacks you use yourself. Does not modify skills used by minions."]="輔助由你自身使用的近戰攻擊。無法影響召喚物的技能。",
		["Supports melee attacks. Does not modify skills used by minions."]="輔助近戰打擊技能。無法修改召喚物使用的技能。",
		["Supports melee strike or slam skills. Every third time you use a supported attack, that use of the skill will be more powerful."]="輔助近戰打擊或重擊技能。每使用三次被輔助的技能會造成更大的傷害。",
		["Supports melee strike skills that do not inherently apply Trauma. Cannot support triggered skills, Vaal skills, or skills used by things other than you. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助不帶有創傷的近戰打擊技能。不能輔助觸發型、瓦爾技能或不是你使用的技能。無法影響召喚物技能。",
		["Supports melee strike skills, causing their melee strike to deal splash damage around each target hit."]="輔助近戰打擊技能，每擊中目標使近戰攻擊擴散傷害至目標附近。",
		["Supports melee strike skills, causing them to also strike at extra targets simultaneously. The extra targets must be a minimum distance from the user. If supporting a minion attack skill, the minion's skills will not also strike extra targets. Cannot support Vaal skills or triggered skills."]="輔助近戰打擊技能，使近戰攻擊同時多的目標。額外的目標必須要在使用者的最小範圍內。如果輔助召喚物攻擊技能，召喚物的攻擊技能不會攻擊多數目標。不能輔助瓦爾或觸發技能。",
		["Supports non-aura hex curse skills."]="輔助非光環咒術詛咒技能。",
		["Supports non-blessing spells."]="輔助非祝福的法術。",
		["Supports non-instant spell skills."]="輔助非立刻施放的法術技能。",
		["Supports offering skills you use yourself."]="輔助由你自身使用的奉獻技能。",
		["Supports projectile attack skills that use bows or wands. Cannot support triggered skills, channelled skills, or skills that create Minions."]="輔助使用弓或法杖的投射物攻擊技能。不能輔助觸發型技能或製造召換物的技能。",
		["Supports projectile attack skills."]="輔助投射物攻擊技能。",
		["Supports projectile skills, and any other skills that chain."]="輔助投射物技能和其他可連鎖技能。",
		["Supports projectile skills, making their projectiles fork into two projectiles the first time they hit an enemy and don't pierce it."]="輔助投射物技能，使投射物在擊中目標時分裂成兩個。",
		["Supports projectile skills, making their projectiles fork into two projectiles the first two times they hit an enemy and don't pierce it."]="輔助投射物技能，在投射物前兩次擊中敵人時，使投射物分裂成兩個，且不會穿透。",
		["Supports projectile skills."]="輔助投射物技能。",
		["Supports projectile spells you cast yourself. Cannot support triggered skills, Vaal skills, instant skills, channelling skills, skills with a reservation or which create minions, or skills used by totems, traps, or mines."]="輔助你自己施放的投射型法術。不能輔助觸發型、瓦爾、立即施放、引導施放、保留的技能，或被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用的技能。",
		["Supports ranged attack skills that fire projectiles upwards. Cannot support triggered attacks, attacks used by things other than you, or skills which create minions."]="輔助向上發射投射物的遠程攻擊技能。無法輔助觸發攻擊、由你以外來源的攻擊、和會創造召喚物的技能。",
		["Supports retaliation skills."]="支援復仇技能",
		["Supports skills that can hit enemies, or create minions. When those skills or minions kill enemies, or hit rare or unique enemies they will have a chance to summon a Phantasm minion, which uses a piercing projectile spell that deals physical damage."]="輔助能擊中敵人或創造召喚物的技能。當技能或召喚物擊殺敵人，或擊中稀有、傳奇敵人時，它們有機會召喚幻影，幻影會使用穿透的投射物法術造成物理傷害。",
		["Supports skills that create minions which can be damaged. Cannot support triggered skills."]="輔助會創造可被傷害的召喚物的技能。無法輔助觸發技能。",
		["Supports skills that create minions."]="輔助製造召喚物的技能。",
		["Supports skills that create sentinel minions, causing those minions to be created with a beneficial templar aura."]="輔助創造護衛召喚物的技能，使這些召喚物被創造時會帶有正面效果的聖堂光環。",
		["Supports skills that fire projectiles from the user. Does not affect projectiles fired from other locations as secondary effects. Does not support skills that fire projectiles in a spiral."]="輔助從玩家發射投射物的技能。不會影響從其他位置發射的投射物，作為次要影響。不輔助以螺旋形式發射的投射物。",
		["Supports skills that have a cooldown. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助擁有冷卻時間的技能。",
		["Supports skills that hit enemies, causing them to gain bonuses while you have resonance of all three elements, and to grant resonance of elements other than the highest one in a hit. There is a maximum of 50 Resonance for each Element. Cannot support triggered skills, instant skills, orb skills, brands, skills with a reservation, or skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助可擊中敵人的技能，當你有全部三元素的共鳴給予他們加成，並在擊中時給予非最高共鳴的元素共鳴。每個元素最多有 50 共鳴。不能輔助觸發型技能、立即施放技能、球體技能、烙印、有保留的技能或被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用的技能。無法調整召喚物的技能。",
		["Supports skills that hit enemies, causing them to gain bonuses while you have unholy resonance of lightning, physical and chaos, and to grant unholy resonance of damage types other than the highest one in a hit. There is a maximum of 50 unholy resonance for each damage type. Cannot support triggered skills, instant skills, orb skills, brands, skills with a reservation, or skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助會擊中敵人的技能，使他們在你擁有閃電、物理、或混沌不潔共鳴時獲得額外效果，並在單次擊中時獲得非最高傷害類型的不潔共鳴。每一種傷害種類的不潔共鳴最高層數為50。無法輔助觸發、立即、球體、烙印、有保留需求的技能，或由圖騰、陷阱、地雷使用的技能。無法影響召喚物技能。",
		["Supports skills that hit enemies. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助可以擊中敵人的技能。無法影響召喚物技能。",
		["Supports skills that summon ballista totems. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助召喚砲塔圖騰的技能。不能調整召喚物的技能。",
		["Supports skills which create Minions."]="輔助製造召喚物的技能。",
		["Supports skills which create brands."]="輔助製造烙印的技能。",
		["Supports skills which summon totems."]="輔助召喚圖騰的技能。",
		["Supports skills which summon totems. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助召喚圖騰的技能。無法影響召喚物技能。",
		["Supports skills which throw Traps or Mines."]="輔助投擲陷阱和地雷技能。",
		["Supports skills which throw mines."]="輔助投擲地雷技能。",
		["Supports skills which throw traps."]="輔助投擲陷阱技能。",
		["Supports skills with cooldowns.\nCannot support triggered skills."]="輔助有冷卻時間的技能。\n不能輔助觸發型技能。",
		["Supports slam skills you use yourself, causing them to create fissures when impacting the ground."]="輔助由你自身使用的重擊技能，使他們在與地面碰撞時創造額外裂隙。",
		["Supports slam skills, causing them to summon an ancestor totem that uses the skill for you while you're near it. Being near it grants you increased area of effect for melee skills."]="輔助重擊技能，使他們召喚一個先祖圖騰，在你靠近它時為你使用該技能。靠近它可以增加近戰技能的效果範圍。",
		["Supports slam skills, providing a powerful boost when they're used, with a delay before they can be boosted again. Cannot support Vaal skills or triggered skills. Cannot modify the skills of minions. Only skills you use yourself can receive the boost."]="輔助重擊技能，當使用時給予強大的加成，可再次加成前會有冷卻時間。不能輔助瓦爾技能或觸發型技能。不能調整召喚物的技能。只有你自己使用的技能可以獲得加成。",
		["Supports spell skills that apply an effect to an area around a targeted location. Cannot support Vaal skills or skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助能對目標附近區域的法術技能。不能輔助瓦爾、召喚物、圖騰、陷阱或地雷技能。無法調整召喚物的技能。",
		["Supports spell skills that are instant and have no reservation. Cannot support Vaal skills or skills used by totems, traps or mines. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助沒有保留的立即法術技能。不能輔助瓦爾技能，或由圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用的技能。無法影響召喚物技能。",
		["Supports spell skills that are not triggered. Instead of casting that spell, you will summon a totem that casts the spell for you."]="輔助非觸發型的法術技能。不再使用技能而是召喚一個圖騰使用技能。",
		["Supports spell skills that deal damage with hits and have no reservation. Cannot support arcane skills, Brand skills, Orb skills, Vaal skills, or skills used by totems, traps or mines. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助可造成擊中傷害和沒有保留的法術技能。不能輔助秘能技能、烙印技能、球體技能、瓦爾技能，或被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用的技能。無法調整召喚物的技能。",
		["Supports spell skills that have no reservation. Cannot support skills used by totems, traps or mines. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助沒有保留的法術技能。不能輔助被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用的技能。無法影響召喚物技能。",
		["Supports spell skills that hit enemies and have no reservation. Cannot support brand skills, orb skills, channelling skills, arcane skills, Vaal skills or skills used by traps or mines. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助會擊中敵人且不會保留的法術技能。無法輔助烙印、寶珠、引導、秘能、瓦爾，或被陷阱與地雷使用的技能。無法修改召喚物的技能。",
		["Supports spell skills that hit enemies. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助會擊中敵人的法術。無法影響召喚物技能。",
		["Supports spell skills that you cast yourself. Cannot support triggered skills, Vaal skills, instant skills, channelling skills, skills with a reservation or which create minions, or skills used by totems, traps, or mines."]="輔助你對自己施放的法術技能。無法輔助觸發型技能、瓦爾技能、立即施放技能、引導施放技能、有保留的技能或被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用的技能。",
		["Supports spell skills, causing them to be triggered by Intuitive Link. Cannot support skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Vaal skills, channelling skills, and skills with a reservation cannot be triggered."]="輔助法術技能，使它們被連結：直覺觸發。不能輔助圖騰、陷阱和地雷技能。瓦爾技能、引導時施放技能和保留技能無法被觸發。",
		["Supports spell skills, causing them to be triggered. Cannot support skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Vaal skills, channelling skills, and skills with a reservation cannot be triggered."]="輔助法術技能，使它們被觸發。不能輔助圖騰、陷阱和地雷技能。瓦爾技能、引導時施放技能和保留技能無法被觸發。",
		["Supports spell skills, making the increase to physical melee damage from strength also increase their spell damage."]="輔助法術技能，力量可以增加近戰物理傷害和法術傷害。",
		["Supports spell skills, making their effect reoccur when cast. Cannot support skills with cooldowns, triggered skills, Brand skills, Vaal skills, channelling skills, skills with a reservation, or skills used by totems, traps, or mines. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助法術技能，當施放時使它們的效果再次觸發。無法輔助有冷卻時間的技能、觸發型技能、瓦爾技能、鬥旗技能、引導施放技能、有保留的技能或被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用的技能。不能調整召喚物的技能。",
		["Supports spell skills, making them repeat when cast. Cannot support Vaal skills, totem skills, brand skills, channelling skills, triggered skills, instant skills, retaliation skills, blink skills, or skills with a reservation."]="輔助法術技能，使他們在施放時重複。無法輔助瓦爾、圖騰、烙印、引導、觸發、立即、復仇、閃現、或有保留需求的技能。",
		["Supports spell skills, making them repeat when cast. Cannot support Vaal skills, totem skills, channelling skills, triggered skills, instant skills, blink skills, or skills with a reservation."]="輔助法術技能，使它們施放時重複。不能輔助瓦爾技能、圖騰技能、引導施放技能、觸發技能、立即技能、閃現技能或保留技能。",
		["Supports spell skills, making them repeat when cast. Cannot support Vaal skills, totem skills, channelling skills, triggered skills, instant skills, retaliation skills, blink skills, or skills with a reservation."]="輔助法術技能，使它們施放時重複施放第二次。不能輔助瓦爾技能、圖騰技能、引導施放技能、觸發技能、立即技能、復仇技能、閃現技能或保留技能。",
		["Supports spells skills that gain Intensity."]="輔助會賦予強化的法術技能。",
		["Supports spells that hit enemies. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助可擊中敵人的法術。無法影響召喚物技能。",
		["Supports spells, or attacks that use bows or wands. Instead of using that skill, you will throw a mine that will use the skill for you when you detonate it. Mines cannot use channelling skills."]="輔助法術或使用弓和法杖的攻擊。不再使用技能而是投擲地雷，當你引爆時施放技能。地雷不能使用引導時施放技能。",
		["Supports spells, or attacks that use bows or wands. Instead of using that skill, you will throw a trap that will use the skill for you when an enemy walks near it. Traps cannot use channelling skills."]="輔助法術或使用弓和法杖的攻擊。不再使用技能而是投擲陷阱，當敵人靠近時陷阱會觸發技能。陷阱不能使用引導時施放技能。",
		["Supports strike skills."]="輔助打擊技能。",
		["Supports traps skills, making them throw extra traps in a line."]="輔助陷阱技能，一次投擲額外的陷阱。",
		["Supports traps skills, making them throw extra traps randomly around the targeted location."]="輔助陷阱技能，在範圍內隨機投擲額外的陷阱。",
		["Supports warcry skills you use yourself."]="輔助由你自身使用的戰吼技能。",
		["Supports warcry skills."]="輔助戰吼技能。",
		["Supports warcry skills. Cannot modify the skills of minions."]="輔助戰吼技能。無法影響召喚物技能。",
		["Supports warcry skills. Cannot support retaliation skills or modify the skills of minions."]="輔助戰吼技能。不能輔助復仇記能，或調整召喚物技能。",
		["Swing an Axe or Sword, consuming Steel Shards to gain a Steel Ward that protects you for a duration, and fire projectiles which shatter on impact or soon after being launched, dealing area damage in front of where they shatter. Steel Shards are gained with the Call of Steel Skill."]="揮舞斧或劍，消耗鋼鐵碎片以獲得鐵牢，保護你一段時間，並發射撞擊時會粉碎的投射物，或是發射時就粉碎。對它們碎裂位置前方造成範圍傷害。鋼鐵碎片可以透過鋼之呼喚取得。",
		["Swing an Axe or Sword, firing projectiles which shatter on impact or soon after being launched, dealing area damage in front of where they shatter."]="揮舞斧或劍，發射撞擊時會粉碎的投射物，或是發射時就粉碎，對它們碎裂位置前方造成範圍傷害。",
		["Swing your wand to cause a number of projectiles to rain down within a large area in front of you, directly targeting the locations of enemies in the area. The locations where each projectile will land are shown with markers before they fall. Each projectile explodes when hitting the ground, dealing area damage and triggering Kinetic Anomaly. Cannot be used by Totems, Traps, or Mines."]="揮舞你的法杖，使複數投射物在你前方的大片區域灑落， 並且鎖定區域內的敵人位置。 投射物掉落的位置會在落下前預先標記。 每一個掉落的投射物都會在落地時爆炸，造成範圍傷害並觸發力量反常。此技能無法被觸發，或被陷阱、地雷、或圖騰施放。",
		["Swing your wand to cause a number of projectiles to rain down within a large area in front of you, directly targeting the locations of enemies in the area. The locations where each projectile will land are shown with markers before they fall. Each projectile explodes when hitting the ground, dealing area damage."]="揮舞你的法杖，使複數投射物在你前方的大片區域灑落， 並且鎖定區域內的敵人位置。 投射物掉落的位置會在落下前預先標記。 每一個掉落的投射物都會在落地時爆炸，造成範圍傷害。",
		["Swings a two handed mace or a staff in a circle, calling down holy hammers to land randomly on a number of enemies struck. Hits from these holy hammers cannot be evaded."]="使用雙手錘或長杖在範圍內橫掃，呼喚一定數量的神聖之錘隨機落於被擊中的敵人。神聖之錘無法被閃避。",
		["Swings a two handed mace or a staff in a circle, calling down waves of holy hammers for a duration. Cannot be supported by Multistrike."]="使用雙手錘或長杖在範圍內橫掃，在持續時間內呼喚數波神聖之錘落下。無法被多重打擊輔助。",
		["Swipe your shield, dealing area damage in three waves in front of you. Enemies can be hit by two of the waves where they overlap."]="揮舞你的盾牌，在你面前形成三道衝擊波造成範圍傷害。敵人可以被兩個重疊的衝擊波擊中。",
		["THE LIGHT OF DIVINITY"]="神聖之光。",
		["Take less Physical and Elemental Damage for a short time. Consumes up to 5 Endurance Charges to lengthen the buff and further lessen Physical Damage taken. Shares a cooldown with other Guard skills."]="一小段時間內承受較少物理和元素傷害，若消耗耐力球可以使物理減免更為有效。至多可以消耗 5 顆耐力球。與其它守護技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Targets a corpse, and deals spell damage to enemies around the corpse, as well as causing the corpse to explode, dealing fire damage. The explosion is not affected by modifiers to spell damage and cannot be reflected."]="指定屍體並對附近敵人造成法術傷害，同時引爆屍體造成火焰傷害。屍體爆炸不受法術傷害屬性影響，也無法被反射。",
		["Targets a corpse, and deals spell damage to enemies around the corpse, as well as causing the corpse to explode, dealing fire damage. The explosion is not affected by modifiers to spell damage and cannot be reflected. This will continue to target other corpses in the area, with a shorter delay between each one, until it runs out of corpses or has destroyed 8 corpses. Cannot be supported by Spell Cascade."]="指定屍體並對附近敵人造成法術傷害，同時引爆屍體造成火焰傷害。屍體爆炸不受法術傷害屬性影響，也無法被反射。此會在短時間內持續指定區域內其他屍體，直到消耗完畢屍體或摧毀 8 個屍體。不能被秘能爆發輔助。",
		["Targets a corpse, and deals spell damage to enemies around the corpse, as well as causing the corpse to explode, dealing fire damage. The explosion is not affected by modifiers to spell damage and cannot be reflected. This will continue to target other corpses in the area, with an increasing delay between each one, until it runs out of corpses or has destroyed 22 corpses."]="指定屍體並對附近敵人造成法術傷害，同時引爆屍體造成火焰傷害。屍體爆炸不受法術傷害屬性影響，也無法被反射。此效果會持續瞄準其他附近屍體，並且每次間隔時間會增加，直到附近沒有屍體可以消耗或是總共摧毀22個屍體。",
		["Targets a corpse, causing it to explode, dealing fire damage. The explosion is not affected by modifiers to spell damage and cannot be reflected. Cannot target corpses that have been created by skills."]="指定屍體使之爆炸造成火焰傷害。此爆炸不獸法術傷害詞綴影響且不能被反射。不能指定被技能製造的屍體。",
		["Targets an allied player to apply a buff which links you to them for a duration. While linked, their hits can trigger your supported spells. If the target dies while linked, you will also die. This skill cannot be triggered, or used by Totems, Traps, or Mines."]="以一名友方玩家為目標施放一個增益效果，在一段時間內將你和他們連結起來。連結時，他們的命中可以觸發你輔助的法術。如果目標在連結時死亡，你也會死亡。該技能不能被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用。",
		["Targets an allied player to apply a buff which links you to them for a duration. While linked, they copy your block chance and recover life when they block. If the target dies while linked, you will also die. This skill cannot be triggered, or used by Totems, Traps, or Mines."]="以一名友方玩家為目標施放一個增益效果，在一段時間內將你和他們連結起來。連結時，他們會複製你的格擋率，並在他們格擋時回復生命。如果目標在連結時死亡，你也會死亡。該技能不能被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用。",
		["Targets an allied player to apply a buff which links you to them for a duration. While linked, they deal additional fire damage based on your life. If the target dies while linked, you will also die. This skill cannot be triggered, or used by Totems, Traps, or Mines."]="以一名友方玩家為目標施放一個增益效果，在一段時間內將你和他們連結起來。連結時，他們會根據你的生命造成額外火焰傷害。如果目標在連結時死亡，你也會死亡。該技能不能被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用。",
		["Targets an allied player to apply a buff which links you to them for a duration. While linked, they get recovery from your life leech instead of you. If the target dies while linked, you will also die. This skill cannot be triggered, or used by Totems, Traps, or Mines."]="以一名友方玩家為目標施放一個增益效果，在一段時間內將你和他們連結起來。連結時，你的生命偷取回復改套用至他們。如果目標在連結時死亡，你也會死亡。該技能不能被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用。",
		["Targets an allied player to apply a buff which links you to them for a duration. While linked, they use your main hand critical strike chance. If the target dies while linked, you will also die. This skill cannot be triggered, or used by Totems, Traps, or Mines."]="以一名友方玩家為目標施放一個增益效果，在一段時間內將你和他們連結起來。連結時，他們使用你的主手暴擊率。如果目標在連結時死亡，你也會死亡。該技能不能被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用。",
		["Targets an allied player to apply a buff which links you to them for a duration. While linked, your Energy Shield will intercept some of the damage they would take. If the target dies while linked, you will also die. This skill cannot be triggered, or used by Totems, Traps, or Mines."]="以一名友方玩家為目標施放一個增益效果，在一段時間內將你和他們連結起來。連結時，你的能量護盾會承受他們受到的部分傷害。如果目標在連結時死亡，你也會死亡。該技能不能被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用。",
		["Targets an area and builds up a large explosion. The build-up speed is based on cast speed. The explosion occurs after it reaches 10 stacks."]="指定一塊區域並引導（持續施放）來施放大型的爆炸。引導的時間會受到施放速度影響。當疊加到 10 層時將會爆炸。",
		["Targets an area and builds up stages in that area based on cast speed. It explodes every 3 stages, until it reaches a maximum of 15. As it gains more stages, the area gets smaller but the damage gets higher."]="指定一塊區域，並在該區域根據施放速度累積層數。每堆疊 3 層會產生爆炸，直到 15 層。當層數越多時範圍越小，但傷害會越大。",
		["Teleport to a location, damaging enemies and leaving Chilled ground in an area at both ends of the teleport. Shares a cooldown with other Blink skills."]="傳送至指定的位置，對你初始位置附近造成冰冷傷害並留下冰緩地面。與其它閃現技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Teleport to a location, damaging enemies and leaving a trail of burning ground, then repeat the teleport in the other direction. Cannot be triggered, or used by a totem, trap or mine. Cannot be supported by Unleash."]="傳送到指定地點，對敵人造成傷害並在路線上造成燃燒地面，然後重複傳送至其他方位。不能被觸發，或被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用。不能被釋放輔助。",
		["Teleport to a location, damaging enemies and leaving a trail of burning ground. Shares a cooldown with other Blink skills."]="傳送到指定地點，對敵人造成傷害並在路線上造成燃燒地面。與其他閃現技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Teleport to a location, damaging enemies and leaving an intense trail of burning ground. Shares a cooldown with other Blink skills."]="傳送到指定地點，對敵人造成傷害並在路線上造成瘋狂的燃燒地面。與其他閃現技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Teleport to a location, damaging enemies in an area at both ends of the teleport. Deals higher damage to chilled enemies, then removes chill from them. Cannot be supported by Unleash."]="傳送至指定的位置，對你初始和最終位置的敵人造成傷害。對冰緩的敵人造成更多傷害，然後移除它們的冰緩。不能被釋放輔助。",
		["Teleport to a target destination. Chilled ground is spread in an area around both where the caster was and where they teleported to."]="傳送至指定目的地。起點跟終點產生一圈冰緩地面。",
		["Teleports the character to a nearby monster and attacks with a melee weapon. If no specific monster is targeted, one is picked at random. Grants a buff that increases movement speed for a duration. The cooldown can be bypassed by expending a Frenzy Charge."]="傳送至目標怪物身邊並用近戰武器對其造成傷害。若是未指定目標，則系統會為其隨機指定一隻怪物。釋放一顆狂怒球能重置其技能冷卻。",
		["Teleports the character to a nearby monster and attacks with a melee weapon. If no specific monster is targeted, one is picked at random. Grants a buff that increases movement speed for a duration. The cooldown can be bypassed by expending a Power Charge."]="傳送至目標怪物身邊並用近戰武器對其造成傷害。若是未指定目標，則系統會為其隨機指定一隻怪物。釋放一顆狂暴擊能重置其技能冷卻。",
		["Teleports you back to the entrance of this Mirage."]="將你傳送至這個蜃景的入口",
		["Teleports you to a nearby enemy, applying a buff to you for a short duration and blinding the enemy for a secondary duration. Performing a melee attack with a One-Handed Weapon removes the buff to exert that attack."]="將你傳送至附近的怪物並附加一個增益果，使你更難被偵測。使用近戰攻擊會移除增益效果來竭盡攻擊。與其他閃現技能共用冷卻時間。",
		["The character slams the ground in front of them with a Staff, Mace or Sceptre, creating a wave that travels forward and damages enemies with an increased chance to stun."]="以長杖或錘重擊地面並製造出一道向前釋放的衝擊波，被此衝擊波擊中的敵人將會受到傷害並有較高機率被擊暈。限定長杖與錘。",
		["The character slams the ground with a Staff, Mace or Sceptre, creating a wave that travels in all directions and damages enemies with an increased chance to stun."]="以長杖或錘重擊地面並製造出一道向周圍釋放具有傷害的衝擊波。",
		["The character swings both their weapons in an arc, damaging monsters in an area in front of them. Requires dual wielding both an Axe and a Sword."]="角色以弧狀揮動兩把武器，對前方範圍怪物造成傷害。限定雙持斧和劍。",
		["The character swings their weapon (or both weapons if dual wielding) in an arc, damaging monsters in an area in front of them. Killing Blows on Rare or Unique enemies grant a buff that improves Cleave for a duration. Killing Blows on Rare Enemies also steal their modifiers for a secondary duration. Only works with Axes and Swords."]="在身體前方以弧狀揮動武器（雙持時則揮動兩把武器），對前方區域的怪物造成傷害。對西有或傳奇敵人的致命一擊會給予一個增益效果，在一段時間內優化劈砍。對稀有敵人的致命一擊會偷取他們的詞綴。限定斧與劍。",
		["The character swings their weapon (or both weapons if dual wielding) in an arc, damaging monsters in an area in front of them. Only works with Axes and Swords."]="角色以弧狀揮動武器（雙持時則揮動兩把武器），並同時對多名敵人造成傷害。限定斧與劍。",
		["The character uses their fist to slam the ground in front of them, with less attack speed, but more damage. This attack deals Lightning Damage to enemies in a large area, with a chance to Shock them. Cannot be used while wielding a Weapon. Cannot be Evaded."]="角色使用拳頭重擊前方地面，較慢的攻擊速度，但有更多的傷害。對大範圍敵人造成閃電傷害並有機率造成感電。裝備武器時無法使用。無法閃避。",
		["The slain enemy's corpse explodes, dealing a percentage of their Maximum Life as Fire Damage to nearby enemies."]="擊殺敵人時，其屍體會爆炸，對附近敵人造成相當於其最大生命一定百分比的火焰傷害。",
		["This Graft will periodically target Rare or Unique Enemies in range, calling forth massive hands which slam down dealing high damage and stunning."]="當你在裝備此接肢時，此接肢會定期鎖定範圍內的稀有或傳奇敵人，召喚巨手猛擊地面，造成高額傷害並使其暈眩。",
		["This attack causes three otherworldly tentacles to strike the ground around you, each dealing your attack damage in an area."]="此攻擊會有三個超自然的巨大觸手對你附近的地面攻擊，每個都會對範圍造成你的攻擊傷害。",
		["This attack fires icy projectiles in a circle around enemies you hit, dealing attack damage with all physical damage converted to cold."]="此攻擊會圍繞你擊中的敵人發射冰冷投射物，造成攻擊傷害的物理傷害全部轉化為冰冷傷害。",
		["This attack is performed repeatedly by a ghostly imitation of your weapon."]="召喚一個你所使用的武器的複製體來攻擊敵人。此技能有短暫冷卻時間。",
		["This attack is used by your Statues to deal damage in an area around them while stepping forward. This skill cannot repeat and can only be used by Statues from Frozen Legion."]="你的雕像往前移動時，使用此攻擊對周圍區域造成傷害。此技能無法重複使用，且只能由戰亂．凍結的雕像使用。",
		["This skill is temporarily disabled and cannot be used."]="此技能已被暫時進用且無法使用。",
		["This skill is triggered by supported skills to summon Sacred Wisps which use the triggering skill when you do."]="此技能由受到輔助的技能觸發，藉此召喚同步使用觸發技能的聖潔妖精。",
		["This skill is triggered when you use a Slam or Strike skill, and summons a Mirage Chieftain who will use that Slam or Strike skill once before dissipating."]="當你使用重擊或打擊技能時觸發此技能，並召喚幻影酋長，在它消逝前會使用一次該重擊或打擊技能。",
		["This spell causes one of your existing Sentinels of Dominance to Ascend, becoming more powerful, gaining new attacks, and overriding its duration, while maintaining its monster modifiers and other bonuses, including from support gems. If you cannot have more Ascended Sentinels of Dominance, an existing one will be refreshed instead."]="此法術會昇華你現有的統御護衛，變得更加強大、獲得新攻擊和刷新它的持續時間，同時保留它的怪物詞綴和其它加成，包含輔助寶石。若你不能獲得更多昇華的統御護衛，則會刷新一個現有護衛的持續時間。",
		["This spell consumes multiple cooldown uses to summon icy Statues in a ring. Each Statue uses your Frozen Sweep attack once before vanishing. Requires an Axe, Mace, Sceptre, or Staff. This skill cannot be triggered, supported by Spell Echo or Unleash, or used by Totems, Traps, or Mines."]="此法術消耗多個冷卻使用次數以環形方式召喚冰凍雕像。每個雕像在消失前都會使用一次橫掃．凍結。限定斧、錘、權杖或長杖。此技能不能被觸發、被施放迴響或釋放輔助、被圖騰、陷阱或地雷使用。",
		["This spell creates a swarm of ethereal blades which briefly orbit in an area around you, dealing damage every 0.6 seconds to all enemies in their radius."]="這個法術創造出一群虛空的刀刃，它們短暫地繞著你附近形成一個區域，每 0.6 秒對附近的所有敵人造成傷害。",
		["This spell creates ethereal blades which orbit in an area around you, dealing damage every 0.6 seconds to all enemies in their radius. As more blades are added, the damage becomes greater and more frequent."]="在你的四周召喚出虛空的刀刃，以你為中心不斷飛舞旋轉，每 0.6 秒對附近的全部敵人造成傷害。越多刀刃將增加傷害並減少每次傷害的間隔。",
		["This spell deals chaos damage in an area around you. Casting this spell will cause you to gain Ruin. If this spell inflicts your seventh Ruin, it will sacrifice a large portion of your life to deal extra chaos damage based on the amount sacrificed, and remove all Ruin from you."]="這個法術會對你周遭範圍造成混沌傷害。施放這個法術會讓你獲得毀滅。如果這個法術對你造成第七層毀滅，就會獻祭你的大量生命，根據獻祭的生命來造成額外混沌傷害，並移除你身上的所有毀滅。",
		["This spell removes some life from one of your Skeleton minions near you or the targeted location to deal chaos damage in an area around it. This effect will chain to your other nearby skeletons. If you have no skeletons near you or the targeted location, it will sacrifice your own life to deal damage instead."]="此法術會犧牲你附近或目標區域骷髏的生命，使骷髏附近造成混沌傷害。此效果會連鎖至你附近的骷髏。若你附近或目標附近沒有骷髏，則會犧牲你的生命來造成傷害。",
		["Throw a coin into the air, letting fate decide the outcome."]="投值硬幣，讓運氣決定你的命運。",
		["Throws a bottle that explodes to deal unarmed attack damage in an area and has a chance to poison. Can consume charges from a Life flask to add further damage. Requires an empty main hand, and no off-hand weapon."]="投擲一個炸藥瓶，在一個區域內造成空手攻擊傷害並有機率中毒。可以消耗生命藥劑中的充能以增加更多傷害。限定空手，且沒有副手武器。",
		["Throws a bottle that explodes to deal unarmed attack damage in an area. Can consume charges from your Ruby, Sapphire, and Topaz flasks to add further damage. Requires an empty main hand, and no off-hand weapon."]="投擲一個爆炸瓶，對範圍內造成空手攻擊傷害。可以消耗你的紅玉、藍玉和黃玉藥劑的充能來增加額外的傷害。限定空手，且沒有副手武器。",
		["Throws a mine that deals damage in an area when detonated, then launches fiery projectiles that rain down around it, each exploding to deal damage in a smaller area. Placed mines apply a fire exposure aura to nearby enemies."]="投擲一顆地雷，當它被引爆時會造成範圍傷害，然後發射火熱的彈射物，落在附近區域，每個投射物會爆炸並造成更小範圍的傷害。已放置的地雷會向周遭敵人施加火焰曝曬。",
		["Throws a mine that deals damage in an area when detonated."]="投擲一個地雷，引爆後對範圍造成傷害。",
		["Throws a mine that fires projectiles around it when detonated. These projectiles quickly dissipate as they travel, before disappearing."]="投擲一個地雷，引爆後朝周圍發射投射物。這些投射物隨著飛行快速消逝。",
		["Throws a mine that fires projectiles at enemies when detonated. These projectiles quickly dissipate as they travel, before disappearing."]="投擲一個地雷，引爆後朝敵人發射投射物。這些投射物隨著飛行快速消逝。",
		["Throws a mine that will teleport you to it when detonated. It covers both your escape and arrival with a cloud of smoke that blinds enemies, and gives you a temporary buff to movement speed. Shares a cooldown with other Blink skills."]="設置一個地雷，當你啟動時會將你傳送至該地雷所在處。當傳送時，在原本位置與地雷所在位置的區塊都會被充滿煙霧，致盲身在煙霧中的敵人，並提升你的移動速度。與其他閃現技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Throws a single bottle that releases a burst when it hits the ground, dealing unarmed attack damage in an area with a chance to poison. The skill chains, bouncing randomly to deal damage multiple times. Can consume charges from a Life flask to add further damage. Requires an empty main hand, and no off-hand weapon."]="投擲1個落地時會爆炸的瓶子，在特定區域內造成空手攻擊傷害，並有機率施加中毒。此技能會隨機彈跳造成多次傷害。消耗生命藥劑的飲用次數可以增加更多傷害。限定空手，且不能持有副手武器。",
		["Throws a spectral copy of your melee weapon. It flies out and then returns to you, in a spinning attack that damages enemies in its path."]="投擲你近戰武器的靈體版本。此靈體將會向外飛出並如同迴力鏢一般回到你的身邊，對所有碰觸到的敵人造成傷害。",
		["Throws a spectral copy of your melee weapon. It spins around while flying in a large spiral, damaging enemies in its path, and bouncing if it collides with walls."]="投擲你的近戰武器的靈體複製體。它以大螺旋型式飛行時會旋轉，對其路徑上的敵人造成傷害，並在與牆壁碰撞時彈射。",
		["Throws a spectral copy of your melee weapon. It spirals out in a spinning attack that strikes enemies in its path."]="使用念能力複製一把手中的近戰武器，並將此靈體投擲出去。此靈體將會以你為圓心螺旋狀的飛行出去，對所有碰觸到的敵人造成傷害。",
		["Throws a spectral copy of your shield as a piercing projectile which deals off-hand damage augmented by the defences of the shield. When it reaches the targeted location it will hover in place, repeatedly firing a number of smaller shards as projectiles in all directions. The rate at which it releases shards will increase until all shards have been fired. Modifiers that cause additional projectiles to be fired will add more shards, not more copies of the shield."]="投擲出你盾牌的靈體複製品，使其成為穿透性投射物，造成副手傷害並受盾牌防禦增幅。其抵達目標位置時會滯空，不斷朝所有方向發射多個小型碎片投射物。其釋出碎片的速度會增加，直到所有碎片都射出。額外射出投射物的詞綴會附加更多碎片，但不會產生更多盾牌複製品。",
		["Throws a spectral copy of your shield as a projectile which cannot pierce, and deals off-hand damage augmented by the defences of the shield. When it collides with something it will shatter, launching a number of smaller shards as projectiles in all directions. Modifiers that cause additional projectiles to be fired will add more shards, not more copies of the shield."]="使用念能力複製你的盾牌並當做投射物，但無法穿透，造成副手增強盾牌防禦傷害。當它碰觸到東西時會粉碎，並對各個方向發射小碎片投射物。有額外投射物的詞綴會增加碎片數量，而不是盾牌。",
		["Throws a spectral copy of your shield as a projectile which cannot pierce, and deals off-hand damage augmented by the evasion of the shield. When it collides with something it will shatter, launching a number of smaller shards as projectiles in all directions. Modifiers that cause additional projectiles to be fired will add more shards, not more copies of the shield."]="使用念能力複製你的盾牌並當做投射物，但無法穿透，造成副手增強盾牌閃避傷害。當它碰觸到東西時會粉碎，並對各個方向發射小碎片投射物。",
		["Throws a stick of Dynamite to the target location which explodes after a short delay. Deals damage to enemies within the radius based on their Rarity. Can be used to destroy Fractured Walls."]="投擲一搓炸藥至目標位置，並在一小段時間後引爆。根據範圍內敵人的稀有度造成傷害。可以用來摧毀壁痕之牆。",
		["Throws a trap that applies debuff beams to a number of nearby enemies for a duration. The beams chill enemies and deal cold damage over time."]="投擲一個陷阱對會附近的敵人發射減益狀態射線持續一段時間。射線會使敵人冰緩並造成冰冷持續傷害。",
		["Throws a trap that applies debuff beams to a number of nearby enemies for a duration. The beams chill enemies and deal cold damage over time. A beam is also applied to you, granting life and mana regeneration based on the number of debuff beams affecting enemies."]="投擲一個陷阱對會附近的敵人發射減益狀態射線持續一段時間。射線會使敵人冰緩並造成冰冷持續傷害。射線同時也會影響你，根據射線影響的敵人提供你生命和魔力回復。",
		["Throws a trap that creates a large explosion when triggered, dealing spell damage in an area around it."]="投擲一個觸發時會造成大爆炸的陷阱，造成範圍法術傷害。",
		["Throws a trap that creates a series of icy runic explosions in a circle around itself when triggered, dealing cold damage to all enemies caught in the blasts."]="投擲一個陷阱，當觸發時在自身附近形成一連串冰冷的符文爆炸，對所有被爆炸困住的敵人造成冰冷傷害。",
		["Throws a trap that creates a series of icy runic explosions when triggered, dealing cold damage to all enemies caught in the blasts."]="投擲一個觸發時會製造一連串冰冷印記爆破的陷阱，對所有在爆破範圍內的敵人造成冰冷傷害。",
		["Throws a trap that creates an explosion when triggered, dealing spell damage in an area around it. A number of smaller explosions occur within a secondary area around the trap in quick succession after the first."]="投擲一個觸發時會造成爆炸的陷阱，造成範圍法術傷害。緊跟在第一次爆炸後，數個小爆炸在陷阱周圍的次要區域內接連發生。",
		["Throws a trap that damages and immobilises a single enemy for a duration based on how much damage was dealt. After the immobilise expires, a debuff remains on the enemy for a duration, lowering their movement speed by an amount which lessens over time. The affected enemy will take increased damage from traps and mines until the debuff expires. Modifiers to spell damage do not affect this skill's damage."]="投擲一個陷阱，觸發該陷阱的敵人將會受到傷害且根據傷害被固定在原地一段時間。在無法移動解除後，減益效果會在敵人身上一段時間，減緩他們的移動速度，並隨著時間減少效果。受影響的敵人會增加來自陷阱和地雷的傷害直到減益效果消逝。法術傷害詞綴無法影響此技能傷害。",
		["Throws a trap that damages and impales a single enemy, and immobilises them for a duration based on how much damage was dealt. Modifiers to spell damage do not affect this skill's damage."]="投擲一個陷阱，觸發該陷阱的敵人將會受到傷害並穿刺，且根據傷害被固定在原地一段時間。法術傷害詞綴無法影響此技能傷害。",
		["Throws a trap that explodes when triggered, dealing fire damage to surrounding enemies and leaving an area of burning ground that damages enemies who walk through it."]="投擲一個陷阱，該陷阱被觸發時會爆炸並對附近的敵人造成火焰傷害，且該區域的地面會持續燃燒，踩在上面的敵人會持續受到傷害。",
		["Throws a trap that explodes when triggered, dealing fire damage to surrounding enemies."]="投擲一個陷阱，該陷阱被觸發時會爆炸並對附近的敵人造成火焰傷害。",
		["Throws a trap that launches a ring of projectiles through the enemy that set it off, dealing lightning damage to them and subsequent targets and leaving a trail of shocked ground."]="投擲一個陷阱，該陷阱被觸發時將會向全方位散射出閃電投射物，投射物將會對觸發及接觸到的敵人造成閃電傷害，且同時在地面留下感電地面。",
		["Throws a trap that launches a ring of projectiles through the enemy that set it off, dealing lightning damage to them and subsequent targets."]="投擲一個陷阱，該陷阱被觸發時將會向全方位散射出閃電投射物，投射物將會對觸發及接觸到的敵人造成閃電傷害。",
		["Throws a trap that launches projectiles through the enemy that set it off, dealing lightning damage to them and subsequent targets."]="投擲一個陷阱，當敵人觸發時，陷阱會發射穿過敵人的投射物，對它們和後續的目標造成閃電傷害。",
		["Throws a trap that releases a number of flames in different directions around it when triggered. The flames last for a duration repeatedly dealing damage."]="投擲一個陷阱，觸發後會向不同方位釋放火焰。火焰會持續一段時間，並持續造成傷害。",
		["Throws a trap that releases a number of flames in different directions around it when triggered. The flames last for a duration, rotating around the trap and repeatedly dealing damage. Burning enemies are dealt more damage."]="投擲一個陷阱，觸發後會向不同方位釋放火焰。火焰會持續一段時間，在陷阱附近旋轉並持續造成傷害。對燃燒的敵人會造成更多傷害。",
		["Throws a trap that, when triggered by an enemy, converts that enemy to your side for a short duration. Does not affect unique monsters or players."]="投擲一個陷阱，觸發該陷阱的敵人將會短暫的轉化為你的手下為你而戰。",
		["Throws a trap which, once triggered, fires a spectral copy of your melee weapon. It spins around while flying in a large spiral, damaging enemies in its path, and bouncing if it collides with walls. If dual wielding, each Trap thrown will randomly use either the main hand or off hand weapon."]="投擲一個陷阱，一旦觸發，就會發射你近戰武器的幽魂複製體。它會在大範圍內迴旋飛行，對路徑上的敵人造成傷害，撞到牆壁後還會彈開。若雙持，每個投出的陷阱會隨機使用主手或副手武器。",
		["Throws a trap which, once triggered, fires many spectral copies of your melee weapon. They fly out in all directions and then return to where the trap triggered, in a spinning attack that damages enemies in their path. If dual wielding, each Trap thrown will randomly use either the main hand or off hand weapon."]="投擲一個陷阱，在觸發時會射出多個你近戰武器的幽魂複製體。它們會四散射出，接著返回到陷阱觸發的位置，路徑上會以迴旋攻擊對敵人造成傷害。若雙持，每個投出的陷阱會隨機以主手或副手武器攻擊。",
		["Throws a trap which, once triggered, releases a number of waves. Each wave deals damage in a series of small bursts in a line, ending with a larger burst."]="投擲一個陷阱，一旦被觸發會釋放多個衝擊波。每個衝擊波對線上造成一連串小爆炸，最終造成大爆炸。",
		["Throws a trap which, once triggered, repeatedly releases a number of waves for a duration. Each wave deals damage in a series of small bursts in a line, ending with a larger burst."]="投擲一個陷阱，一旦被觸發會重複釋放幾次衝擊波持續一段時間。每個衝擊波對線上造成一連串小爆炸，最終造成大爆炸。",
		["Throws a trap which, once triggered, swings two copies of your equipped Dagger, Claw or One Handed Sword around it in circles, each repeatedly damaging enemies it spins through."]="投擲一個陷阱，一旦觸發，陷阱會在附近旋轉兩把你裝備的匕首、爪或單手劍的複製體，每次旋轉都會對穿過的敵人造成重複傷害。",
		["Throws a trap which, once triggered, swings two copies of your equipped Dagger, Claw, One Handed Sword or One Handed Axe around it in a circle, each damaging enemies it spins through."]="投擲一個陷阱，一旦觸發，就會將你裝備的匕首、爪、單手劍或單手斧的兩個複製體圍繞它旋轉成一個圓圈，每個複製體都會對旋轉穿過的敵人造成傷害。",
		["Throws a trap which, once triggered, swings two copies of your equipped Two Handed Sword around it in circles for a duration, each repeatedly damaging enemies it spins through"]="投擲一個陷阱，一旦觸發，陷阱會在附近旋轉兩把你裝備的雙手劍的複製體，每次旋轉都會對穿過的敵人造成重複傷害。",
		["Throws a trap which, once triggered, will repeatedly strike multiple areas around it for a duration, dealing lightning damage."]="投擲一個陷阱，一旦被觸發將會在範圍內落下多道雷電持續一段時間，造成閃電傷害。",
		["Throws an intangible spectral copy of your melee weapon. It flies out and then becomes tangible as it returns to you, in a spinning attack that only hits and damages enemies while returning."]="投擲你近戰武器的無形靈體版本。此靈體將會向外飛並變成有形的返回到你的身邊，只在返回時以旋轉攻擊擊中和傷害敵人。",
		["Throws chains ahead of you, attaching them to targets hit. Enemies chained to you will grant rage when hit. When chains are broken, they snap and deal attack damage in an area around the target they were attached to. Requires a One Handed Mace, Sceptre, Sword or Axe."]="朝你前方投擲鎖鏈，使其附著在擊中的目標身上。擊中被鍊住的敵人會賦予盛怒。當鎖鏈破碎時，它們會斷開並對其附著目標周圍的一片區域造成攻擊傷害。需要單手錘、權杖、劍或斧。",
		["Throws multiple traps that explode when triggered, dealing fire damage to surrounding enemies and leaving areas of burning ground that damages enemies who walk through them."]="投擲多個陷阱，陷阱被觸發時會爆炸並對周圍的敵人造成火焰傷害，且該區域的地面會持續燃燒，踩在上面的敵人會持續受到傷害。",
		["Throws out a trap which creates a rift, attracting a malefic hand from another realm. When the trap is triggered, the hand tears the bottom of the breach out, shattering reality to deal spell damage in an area."]="扔出一個陷阱，該陷阱會製造一個裂隙，吸引來自另一個位面的惡意之手。當陷阱被觸發時，這隻手會撕裂裂痕粉碎現實，在一個範圍內造成法術傷害。",
		["Throws several spectral copies of your melee weapon. They fly out and then return to you, in a spinning attack that damages enemies in their path."]="使用念能力複製一把手中的近戰武器，並將此靈體投擲出去。他們飛出去然後回到你身邊，進行旋轉攻擊，對路徑上的敵人造成傷害。",
		["Thrust an Axe or Sword forward to form a cluster of shards in front of you. The cluster will fire a number of projectiles in sequence, aiming at enemies in front of or close to it."]="向前突刺斧或劍，在你前面形成一團碎片。這團碎片將依次發射多個投射物，瞄準前方或附近的敵人。",
		["Thrust an Axe or Sword forward, consuming your Steel Shards to form a cluster of shards in front of you. The cluster will fire a number of projectiles in sequence, aiming at enemies in front of or close to it. Steel Shards are gained with the Call of Steel Skill."]="向前突刺斧或劍，消耗你的鋼鐵碎片來使碎片在你前方成形。碎片會瞄準前方或靠近它的敵人，連續發射投射物。鋼鐵碎片透過鋼之呼喚技能取得。",
		["Transforms you into a mimic of a stash chest while in a town or hideout"]="在城鎮或藏身處時將你變身成一個藏寶箱的模仿者。",
		["UNUSED Hits enemies, converting some of your physical damage to fire damage. If an enemy dies soon after being hit, they will explode, dealing fire damage to nearby enemies. The damage from this explosion cannot be reflected. Requires a Sword, Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Staff or Unarmed."]="凝聚煉獄之力，轉換一部分的物理傷害為火焰傷害以重擊目標。受到煉獄之擊的敵人在短時間內死亡時會爆炸，並對周圍的敵人造成火焰傷害。爆炸的傷害無法被反射。限定劍、斧、錘、長杖或是空手。",
		["UNUSED Summon replications of your character that follow you. When you use a supported skill, the replications also use their copy of the skill. Additional Projectiles are distributed evenly among replications."]="短期內立即減少即將承受的傷害。與其它守護技能共享冷卻時間。",
		["Unleash a beam of fire that burns enemies it touches. Remaining in the beam raises the burning, adding a portion of the beam's damage in stages. Enemies who leave the beam continue to burn for a duration. Increasing cast speed also increases the rate at which the beam turns."]="釋放一道灼熱的火焰光束，燃燒它觸及的敵人。留在光束中會提高燃燒效果，分階段增加光束傷害的一部分。離開光束的敵人在一段時間內仍然會持續燃燒。增加施放速度同時增加光束旋轉速度。",
		["Unleash a beam of fire that burns enemies it touches. Remaining in the beam raises the burning, adding a portion of the beam's damage in stages. Inflicts Fire Exposure at maximum stages. Enemies who leave the beam continue to burn for a duration. Increasing cast speed also increases the rate at which the beam turns."]="釋放一道灼熱的火焰光束，燃燒它觸及的敵人。留在光束中會提高燃燒效果，分階段增加光束傷害的一部分。在最大階段施加火焰曝曬。離開光束的敵人在一段時間內仍然會持續燃燒。增加施放速度同時增加光束旋轉速度。",
		["Unleash a stream of projectiles while you channel this spell, which pierce through enemies, dealing lightning damage. When you stop channelling, the projectiles explode, dealing significant damage in an area around them. Additional projectiles are added in sequence."]="引導施放一連串未爆的投射物，造成閃電傷害並穿透敵人。當停止引導施放時投射物會爆裂，對附近造成大量範圍傷害。額外投射物依序射出。",
		["Unleash orbs of energy while you channel that repeatedly jump away from the targeted location until their duration expires, dealing damage in a small area after each jump. When you stop channelling, all remaining orbs explode, dealing higher damage in a larger area."]="當你引導施放時釋放能量球，能量球會遠離目標區域重複彈跳，直到它們的持續時間結束，並在每次跳躍後對小範圍造成傷害。當你停止引導時，所有存留的球會引爆，對大範圍造成較高傷害。",
		["Unleash orbs of energy while you channel that repeatedly jump towards the targeted location until their duration expires, dealing damage in a small area after each jump. When you stop channelling, all remaining orbs explode, dealing higher damage in a larger area."]="當你引導施放時釋放能量球，能量球會向目標區域重複彈跳，直到它們的持續時間結束，並在每次跳躍後對小範圍造成傷害。當你停止引導時，所有存留的球會引爆，對大範圍造成較高傷害。",
		["Unleashes a ball of fire towards a target which explodes, damaging nearby foes."]="釋放一顆球型火焰向前飛射，接觸到怪物時會爆炸並對周圍敵人造成傷害",
		["Unleashes a vile contagion on enemies, dealing chaos damage over time. If an enemy dies while affected by Contagion, the debuff spreads to other enemies, but each time it spreads, it only deals three quarters as much damage as before."]="對敵人釋放一種邪惡的瘟疫，對其造成持續的混沌傷害。如果一個敵人在受到傳染的影響下死亡，該減益效果將傳播到其他敵人，但每次傳播時，傷害僅為之前的四分之三。",
		["Unleashes a vile contagion on enemies, dealing chaos damage over time. If an enemy dies while affected by Contagion, the debuff spreads to other enemies."]="對敵人釋放一種邪惡的瘟疫，對其造成持續的混沌傷害。如果一個敵人在受到傳染的影響下死亡，該減益效果將傳播到其他敵人。",
		["Unleashes a vile contagion on enemies, dealing chaos damage over time. If an enemy is hit while affected by Contagion, the debuff spreads to other enemies."]="對敵人釋放一種邪惡的瘟疫，對其造成持續的混沌傷害。如果一個敵人在受到傳染的影響下被擊中，該減益效果將傳播到其他敵人。",
		["Unleashes an icy projectile that pulses with cold as it travels."]="釋放出帶有冰冷脈衝的冰凍投射物。有短暫的冷卻時間。",
		["Violently destroys your body and recreates it at the location of a targeted enemy or corpse, dealing spell damage in an area at both locations. If there is no specific target, it will prioritise corpses over enemies. If targeting a corpse, the corpse will also explode, dealing damage around it that is not affected by modifiers to spell damage, and cannot be reflected. This spell cannot be repeated."]="你的身體和目標屍體爆炸造成附近範圍法術傷害，你的身體會在屍體位置重建。若沒有指定目標，將會優先選取敵人的屍體。若指定屍體，該屍體會爆炸並對附近造成傷害，此爆炸不受法術傷害詞綴影響且不能被反射。此法術無法被重複。",
		["Violently destroys your body and recreates it at the location of a targeted enemy or damageable minion, dealing spell damage in an area at both locations. If there is no specific target, it will prioritise minions over enemies. If targeting a minion, the minion will also be destroyed in an explosion which deals damage around it that is not affected by modifiers to spell damage, and cannot be reflected. This spell cannot be repeated."]="你的身體和目標屍體爆炸造成附近範圍法術傷害，你的身體會在屍體或可傷害的召喚物位置重建。若沒有指定目標，將會優先選取可傷害的召喚物，而不是屍體。若指定召喚物，召喚物會被爆炸摧毀，對附近造成傷害，此爆炸不受法術傷害詞綴影響且不能被反射。此法術無法被重複。",
		["Waits for a duration before teleporting to a targeted destination, with the duration based on the distance and your movement speed. When the teleport occurs, lightning damage is dealt to the area around both where the player was and where they teleported to. Casting again will queue up multiple teleportations to occur in sequence."]="在指定位置施放一個法陣，在數秒之後將你傳送過去。當傳送時，在原本位置與傳送法陣位置的敵人都會受到閃電傷害。再次施放會列隊連續使用多次傳送。",
		["Wave your wand to create a hovering kinetic projectile. After a short duration, the projectile is fired at an enemy, dealing area damage on impact and chaining to further targets. Using this attack again will reset the duration for all hovering projectiles. Multiple projectiles fired in sequence will attempt to target different enemies. Cannot be directly used by traps or mines."]="揮動你的法杖來創造一個懸浮投射物。經過短暫的持續時間後，該投射物會射向一個敵人，命中時造成範圍傷害並連鎖至更多目標。再次使用此攻擊將會重置所有懸浮投射物的持續時間。連續發射的多個投射物會將會瞄準不同的敵人。此技能不能直接被陷阱或地雷使用。",
		["Wave your wand to create multiple hovering kinetic projectiles. After a short duration, the projectiles explode, dealing area damage. Using this attack again will reset the duration for all hovering projectiles. Cannot be directly used by traps or mines."]="揮動你的法杖來創造多個懸浮投射物。經過短暫的持續時間後，投射物會引爆並造成範圍傷害。再次使用此攻擊將會重置所有懸浮投射物的持續時間。此技能不能直接被陷阱或地雷使用。",
		["Whack another exile with your severed arm."]="用你的斷臂向另一名流亡者揮擊。",
		["When commanded, this Graft will call down a ring of lightning bolts, dealing lightning damage and leaving behind Radiant ground."]="當被號令時，這個接肢會召喚一圈閃電落下，造成閃電傷害並留下輝耀地面。",
		["When commanded, this Graft will call forth a devastating tornado which rapidly deals cold damage to Enemies within it. When you Critically Strike with an Attack while the Tornado is active, it will fire off a nova of icicle projectiles."]="當被號令時，這個接肢會召喚出一股毀滅性的龍捲風，對其中的敵人快速地造成冰霜傷害。當你在龍捲風存在時以攻擊，你以攻擊造成暴擊，它就會釋放一圈碎霜彈幕。",
		["When commanded, this Graft will cause a cataclysmic eruption that leaves multiple geysers of flame in its wake. These geysers will regularly fire off fiery mortars, firing more in a burst whenever you use a warcry. Triggering warcries will not cause these bursts of mortars."]="當被號令時，此接肢會引發災變般的爆發，在其後方留下多個炎泉。炎泉會定期發射火焰迫擊砲，當你使用戰吼時會瞬間發射更多。被觸發的戰吼不會引發火焰迫擊砲。",
		["When commanded, this Graft will summon forth a field of grasping hands, each of which clutches an enervating orb of Lightning. When an Enemy is near a hand, the orb it clutches will detonate to deal Lightning Damage and Sap on Hit."]="當被號令時，這個接肢會召喚出一片抓握之手，每隻手都緊握著一顆削弱性的雷光球。當敵人接近某隻手時，其所握持的雷光球將會引爆，造成閃電傷害並在命中時施加殘喘。",
		["When hit, release a nova of fiery vengeance, dealing spell fire damage and blinding enemies struck."]="被擊中時，釋放復仇之焰新星，造成火焰法術傷害並致盲被擊中的敵人。",
		["When hit, release a nova of venomous bile that deals spell chaos damage. This nova poisons and hinders on hit."]="被擊中時，釋放劇毒新星，造成混沌法術傷害。新星擊中時將會對敵人造成中毒及阻礙。",
		["When used at range, throws out a chain, pulling you to the enemy hit dealing damage in an area behind them. When close to the enemy, just causes the area damage directly. Requires a One Handed Mace, Sceptre, Sword or Axe."]="若遠距離使用，投出鎖鏈擊中敵人時將你拉至敵人身邊，對其背後的區域造成傷害。當靠近敵人時，直接造成範圍傷害。限定單手錘、權杖、劍和斧。",
		["When you Attack with this Graft equipped, it will call forth pillars of ashen flame. These pillars deal Fire damage in an area, and cover Enemies they hit in Ash."]="當你在裝備此接肢時進行攻擊，它會召喚出灰燼之炎構成的火柱。這些火柱會在區域內造成火焰傷害，並使被擊中的敵人餘燼纏身。",
		["When you apply exposure to an enemy, this Graft will apply a buff which takes elemental damage from hits for you while active."]="當你對敵人施加曝曬時，此接肢將會在啟動時向你施加一個為你承受擊中元素傷害的增益。",
		["When you are missing Life, this Graft will apply a Buff that takes some Damage from Hits for you before being depleted. When you are struck while the Buff is active, this skill will fire a nova of fiery projectiles which explode on impact."]="當你失去生命時，這個接肢會施加一個增益效果，替你承受部分來自擊中的傷害，直到被消耗殆盡。當你在該增益效果存在時受到攻擊，這個技能會新星狀的釋放一圈在撞擊時會爆炸的火焰投射物。",
		["When you attack with The Saviour and deal a critical strike, this skill can summon a Mirage Saviour. Summoned Mirage Saviours will fight for you using whichever of your attack skills you dealt the critical strike with that caused them to be summoned. Mirage Saviours will not be resummoned using the same skills if you already have the maximum number of them."]="當你使用救世主攻擊並造成暴擊，此技能可以召喚 1 個幻影救世主。召喚的幻影救世主會使用你造成暴擊的攻擊技能。幻影救世主達上限時不會再召喚使用相同技能的幻影救世主。",
		["When you use a Warcry, this Graft will cause spires of bone to erupt from the earth around you. When you use an Exerted Attack, these spires will explode to deal damage in an area around them, inflicting Bleeding and Impaling Enemies."]="當你使用戰吼時，此接肢會令你周圍的地面爆發出骨之尖刺。當你使用竭盡攻擊時，這些尖刺會爆炸，對其周圍區域造成傷害，並使敵人流血與穿刺。",
		["When you use an Offering skill, this Graft will summon an army of Hiveborn Breach Monsters to do your bidding. These summoned monsters have their Physical Damage converted to Cold, and have a chance to apply Brittle on Hit."]="當你使用奉獻技能時，此接肢會召喚一支聽從你的指揮的巢裔裂痕怪物軍隊。這些被召喚的怪物會將物理傷害轉換為冰冷傷害，並在擊中時有機率施加易碎。",
		["While Enemies are nearby, this Graft will periodically bring Lightning-Imbued Clones of you into being. These Clones will move towards the nearest Enemy, detonating and leaving behind shocked ground."]="當附近有敵人時，此接肢會定期召喚帶有閃電能量的自身分身。這些分身會朝最近的敵人移動，爆炸並留下感電地面。",
		["While active, grants the Avian's Might and Avian's Flight buffs in sequence. Avian's Might grants you and your minions a chance to deal Double Damage with hits for a duration. Avian's Flight grants you and your minions increased Movement Speed for a secondary duration."]="啟動時，依序獲得飛羽意志和飛羽飄翔增益效果。飛羽意志期間內提供你和你的召喚物有機率擊重造成兩倍傷害。飛羽飄翔期間內提供你增加移動速度。",
		["While active, grants the Cat's Stealth and Cat's Agility buffs in sequence. Cat's Stealth increases your critical strike chance, makes you harder to see, and gives you a chance to avoid damage for a short duration. Cat's Agility increases your attack and cast speed for a longer secondary duration."]="啟動時，依序獲得傲貓隱身和傲貓姣捷增益效果。傲貓隱身增加你的暴擊率，使你難以被敵人看見，並且給予你一小段時間有機率避免受傷。傲貓姣捷在較長的時間內增加你的攻擊和施放速度。",
		["While active, inflicts Chill on enemies within it's radius, while also increasing the strength of Chill you inflict and causing Damage you deal to Chilled enemies to penetrate some of their Cold Resistance."]="啟用時，對範圍內的敵人施加冰緩，同時增加你所造成的冰緩效果，並使你對被冰緩的敵人造成的傷害穿透一部分冰冷抗性。",
		["While active, inflicts Fire Exposure on enemies within its radius. Additionally, periodically applies a Sunscald debuff to enemies within its radius, with each Sunscald debuff increasing the effect of exposure on affected enemies. Sunscald can stack up to five times."]="啟用時，對其範圍內的敵人造成火焰曝曬。此外，會定期對範圍內的敵人施加日灼減益效果，每層日灼都會增加受影響敵人的曝曬效果。日灼最多可疊加至五次。",
		["While active, periodically adds Crab Barriers to you, and grants additional Physical Damage reduction for each Crab Barrier you have. All Crab Barriers are lost when you take physical damage from a hit."]="啟動時，規率的對你增加蟹將重盾，每層蟹將重盾提供你額外的物理減傷。當你被物理傷害擊中時失去所有蟹將重盾。",
		["While active, periodically applies a Spider's Web debuff to nearby Enemies, and Hinders them. Each Spider's Web on an Enemy increases the Damage they take. Hinder reduces their movement speed."]="啟動時，規率的對附近的敵人造成蛛網減益效果，並阻礙他們。敵人身上每層蛛網都會增加他們所承受傷害。阻礙會減少他們的移動速度。",
		["While active, taking Physical or Elemental Damage will grant you either Lunar Protection or Lunar Resistance, respectively. Aspect of Lunaris lessens incoming Physical Damage for each Lunar Protection on you, and lessens incoming Elemental Damage for each Lunar Resistance on you. These buffs can both stack up to eight times."]="啟用時，受到物理或元素傷害將分別賦予你月影防護或月影抗性。月影祝福會根據你身上的每層月影防護來減免所受到的物理傷害，並根據每層月影抗性來減免所受到的元素傷害。這兩種增益效果皆最多可疊加至八次。",
		["While active, this skill inflicts the Weeping Black debuff on impaled enemies you hit with bow attacks. Weeping Black deals physical damage over time, and can stack up to five times. This skill cannot be cast by Totems."]="此技能生效時，若你使用弓攻擊擊中被穿刺的敵人，將會對其施加潸然之黯減益效果。潸然之黯會造成物理持續傷害，最高可堆疊五層。此技能不能由圖騰施放。",
		["While active, you inflict Wither on hit, and Wither you inflict will be reflected back to you. Additionally, for each stack of Wither on you, your Life recovery rate is increased."]="啟用時，你在擊中時會造成凋零，且你所造成的凋零將會反射回你自己身上。此外，你身上每有一層凋零，你的生命恢復率便會隨之增加。",
		["While active, your bow attacks inflict Cinderflame. Cinderflame deals fire damage over time, and can stack up to ten times. This skill cannot be cast by Totems."]="啟動時，你的弓攻擊將會施加餘灰燼火。餘灰燼火會造成火焰持續傷害，且可以疊加最多十次。此技能無法被圖騰使用。",
		["While afflicted with an Elemental Ailment while this Graft is equipped, it will remove all Elemental Ailments from you and grant you Physical Damage gained as Extra of the Elemental Damage Types that match the removed Ailments."]="當你在裝備此接肢時受到元素異常狀態影響，將會移除你身上所有的異常狀態，並使你獲得等同於被移除異常所屬元素類型的額外物理傷害。",
		["While equipped, this Graft will periodically fling icy mortars at Enemies in range that are Chilled or Frozen."]="裝備此接肢時，會定期向範圍內被冰緩或冰凍的敵人發射冰霜迫擊砲。",
		["While this skill is active, supported spells will be repeatedly triggered."]="此技能生效時，受到輔助的法術將重複觸發",
		["While you are on Low Life, this Graft will periodically apply a buff to you which grants life recovery rate, as well as an Endurance Charge."]="當你貧血時，這個接肢會定期對你施加增益效果，提供生命回復速度，並賦予一個耐力球。",
		["While you channel this skill, it releases pulses of electrical energy, dealing lightning damage in a growing semicircular area in front of you."]="你引導施放此技能時，技能釋放電能脈衝，對你面前弧狀區域內的所有敵人造成傷害，範圍會逐漸擴大。",
		["While you channel this skill, it releases pulses of electrical energy, dealing lightning damage in a semicircular area in front of you."]="你引導施放此技能時，技能釋放電能脈衝，對你面前弧狀區域內的所有敵人造成傷害。",
		["While you have Rage, this Graft will periodically apply a buff to you which grants a chance to inflict an additional Impale and increased effect of Impales you inflict."]="當你有盛怒時，此接肢會週期性的對你施加增益效果，使你施加額外一層穿刺，並且增加你施加的穿刺範圍效果。",
		["While you run, this skill creates a small explosion with each step, dealing fire damage in an area around you."]="此技能在你移動中仍然會持續釋放衝擊波",
		["While you walk, this skill causes corpses near your steps to explode, dealing fire damage in an area. The explosions of the corpses are not affected by modifiers to spell damage, and cannot be reflected."]="當你行走時，此技能會使你腳步附近的屍體爆破，造成範圍火焰傷害。屍體爆炸無法被法術傷害詞綴影響，也無法被反射。",
		["You must gain Valour from melee combat to use this skill, which will consume all Valour to place a banner with an aura. The aura will be larger and more powerful the more Valour was consumed. The banner lasts for a duration, but will end early if you leave the aura, or use the skill again while it's active."]="你必須透過近戰戰鬥獲得英勇值來使用此技能，該技能會消耗所有英勇值放置一面帶有光環的旗幟。消耗的英勇值越多，光環的範圍和強度就越大。旗幟會維持一段時間，但假如你踏出光環的範圍，或在光環持續期間內再次使用該技能，旗幟就會提前消失。",
		["Your melee weapon strikes enemies, converting physical damage to a random element. Then, depending on the element chosen, it releases a fiery explosion, an arcing bolt of lightning, or an icy wave. It will avoid choosing the same element twice in a row."]="使用近戰武器打擊敵人，將部分傷害轉換為隨機的元素傷害。根據轉換成的元素釋放出爆破、閃電或冰霜。會避免連續選擇相同的元素。",
		["Your shield shatters, dealing physical spell damage to enemies in an area, based on the shield's quality. For a short duration after this, you will be unable to block and will gain no defences from your shield, but your spells will deal added physical damage."]="你的盾牌碎裂，根據盾牌的品質對範圍內敵人造成物理法術傷害。為此你會有一小段時間不能格擋和從盾牌獲得防禦，但你的法術會附加物理傷害。",
		["Your ward shatters, dealing physical spell damage to enemies in an area, based on the amount of ward you have. Enemies hit are inflicted with Enervation, a Debuff that lowers Movement Speed by 20% and prevents Life and Energy Shield Recovery for 4 seconds."]="你的護罩破碎，對範圍內的敵人造成物理法術傷害，傷害量取決於你擁有的護罩值。被擊中的敵人會受到神經衰弱效果，使移動速度降低 20%，並在 4 秒內無法回復生命與能量護盾。"
	},
	flavour={
