		["(50% less Life Regeneration Rate. 50% less Maximum total Life Recovery per second from Leech. Energy Shield Recharge instead applies to Life)"]="（ 50% 更少生命回復率。50%  更少來自偷取的每秒總生命恢復。能量護盾回復套用至生命 ）",
		["(50% of Non-Chaos Damage taken bypasses Energy Shield\nGain 15% of Maximum Life as Extra Maximum Energy Shield)"]="（ 50% 承受的非混沌傷害無視能量護盾\n獲得 15% 最大生命的額外最大能量護盾 ）",
		["(50% of Physical, Cold and Lightning Damage Converted to Fire Damage.\nDeal no Non-Fire Damage)"]="（50% 物理、冰冷、閃電傷害轉換成火焰傷害。除火焰傷害外不造成其他傷害。）",
		["(80% of Maximum Mana is Converted to twice that much Armour)"]="（最大魔力的 80% 轉換為該數值雙倍的護甲）",
		["(A Hit that removes at least 15% of Maximum Life is a Savage Hit)"]="（ 當一個一次性的擊中傷害使目標失去 15% 最大生命以上的傷害時，該傷害視為殘暴之擊 ）",
		["(A torrent rushes upwards after a short delay, dealing damage in an area while leaving Brine Ground)"]="（經過短暫延遲後，一劑激流將向上噴湧，在該區域造成傷害並留下鹹水地面）",
		["(Abysses, Beyond Demon Portals, Blight Encounters, Breaches, Expedition Encounters, Legion Encounters, Mercenaries, Mirrors of Delirium and Layers of Delirium, Monsters Imprisoned by Essences, Ore Deposits, Ritual Altars, Rogue Exiles, the Sacred Grove, Shrines, Smuggler's Caches, Strongboxes, Tempests, Tormented Spirits, Ultimatum Encounters, Wildwood Wisps and Alva, Einhar, Jun and Niko Missions are Extra Content)"]="（深淵、超越惡魔傳送門、凋落事件、裂痕、探險事件、戰亂事件、傭兵、譫妄之鏡與譫妄層數、受精髓囚禁的怪物、礦床、祭祀神壇、盜賊流亡者、聖殿密園、神殿、走私者的祕寶、保險箱、風暴、罪魂、通牒事件、荒林妖精，以及艾瓦、埃哈、瓊恩和尼科任務為額外內容）",
		["(Abysses, Blight Encounters, Breaches, Expedition Encounters, Legion Encounters, Mercenaries, Mirrors of Delirium, Ore Deposits, Ritual Altars, the Sacred Grove, Smuggler's Caches, Ultimatum Encounters and Master Missions are Bonus Content)"]="（深淵、凋落事件、裂痕、探險事件、戰亂事件、傭兵、譫妄之鏡、礦床、祭祀神壇、聖殿密園、走私者的祕寶、通牒事件、和大師任務為額外內容）",
		["(Abysses, Blight Encounters, Breaches, Expedition Encounters, Legion Encounters, Mercenaries, Mirrors of Delirium, Ore Deposits, Ritual Altars, the Sacred Grove, Smuggler's Caches, and Ultimatum Encounters are Extra Content that can be turned off through Atlas Passives.)"]="（深淵、凋落事件、裂痕、探險事件、戰亂事件、傭兵、譫妄之鏡、礦床、祭祀神壇、聖殿密園、走私者的祕寶和通牒事件為可透過輿圖天賦關閉的額外內容）",
		["(Added Passive Skills are never considered to be in Radius by other Jewels)"]="（ 附加的天賦點不會被其它珠寶視為範圍內 ）",
		["(Adopt the power of the forest, gradually covering your body in bark. Getting hit by enemy attacks causes bark to be removed. You take reduced damage from physical attack hits the more bark builds up, but higher chance to evade when less covered in bark)"]="（適應森林的力量，逐漸讓木質覆蓋你的身體。被敵人攻擊及中會使木直被移除。隨著累積越多木質，獲得越高的物理傷害減免，但當被少量木質覆蓋時會有更高的閃避率）",
		["(Adrenaline grants 100% increased Damage, 25% increased Attack, Cast and Movement Speed and 10% additional Physical Damage Reduction. You cannot gain Adrenaline if you already have it)"]="（ 腎上腺素提供增加 100% 傷害，增加 25% 攻擊、施放和移動速度、和 10% 額外物理傷害減免。若已經有腎上腺素將不會再獲得一次 ）",
		["(Adrenaline grants 100% increased Damage, 25% increased Attack, Cast and Movement Speed and 10% additional Physical Damage Reduction. You cannot gain Adrenaline if you already have it. Lasts until removed.)"]="（腎上腺素增加 100% 傷害、增加 25% 攻擊、施放和移動速度和 10% 額外物理傷害減免。若你已經有腎上腺素則無法再次獲得。持續至被移除為止）",
		["(Affects Melee Strikes, including the Default Attack. Does not apply to Areas of Effect)"]="（ 影響近戰打擊，包含預設攻擊。不會套用至範圍效果 ）",
		["(Affliction permanently Afflicts any of your damageable minions in a targeted area, causing them to take physical damage over time, at an accelerating rate. Each such minion causes you to regenerate life at a rate based on the current damage of its Affliction debuff. Afflicted Minions explode if their life is lowered to a fifth of maximum)"]="（ 禁咒永久影響目標區域內，你任何可被傷害的召喚物，使他們承受物理持續傷害，且傷害速率倍增。每個此類召喚物，使你的生命回復根據當前禁咒效果傷害率。禁咒召喚物血量低於五分之一時會爆炸 ）",
		["(Aggressive minions have their targeting range raised to a minimum value)"]="（ 侵略性的召喚物將他們瞄準目標距離提升至最大 ）",
		["(Ailments are Bleeding, Ignited, Scorched, Chilled, Frozen, Brittle, Shocked, Sapped, and Poisoned)"]="（異常狀態包含流血、點燃、焦灼、冰緩、冰凍、易碎、感電、殘喘和中毒）",
		["(Ailments that deal Damage are Bleeding, Ignited, and Poisoned)"]="（造成傷害的異常狀態包含流血、點燃和中毒）",
		["(Ailments that do not deal Damage are Scorched, Chilled, Frozen, Brittle, Shocked, and Sapped)"]="（無法造成傷害的異常狀態包含焦灼、冰緩、冰凍、易碎、感電和殘喘）",
		["(Alchemist's Genius increases Flask Charges gained by 20% and effect of Flasks by 10%, for 4 seconds)"]="（ 鍊金之材增加 20% 獲得藥劑充能和 10% 藥劑效果，持續 4 秒 ）",
		["(All Added Passive Skills are Small unless otherwise specified)"]="（ 所有附加的天賦點都為小型，除非有特條件 ）",
		["(All Damage from Hits will cause Elemental Ailments you are suffering. Elemental Ailments you inflict are removed from you)"]="（擊中的所有傷害都會造成你正承受的元素異常狀態。你造成的元素異常狀態將會從你身上移除）",
		["(All Damage taken bypasses Energy Shield\n50% of Elemental Damage taken as Chaos Damage\n+5% to maximum Chaos Resistance)"]="（全部承受傷害無視能量護盾\n承受 50% 元素傷害視為混沌傷害\n+5% 最大混沌抗性）",
		["(Allies on your Consecrated Ground Regenerate a percentage of their Maximum Life per second, and Curses have 50% reduced effect on them)"]="（ 站在奉獻地面上的友方每秒回復他們最大生命的百分比，且減少 50% 他們身上的詛咒效果 ）",
		["(Allies on your Fungal Ground have +25% to Chaos Resistance. Enemies on your Fungal Ground have -10% to all Resistances.)"]="（友方站在你的毒菌地面上獲得 +25% 混沌抗性。在你毒菌地面上的敵人 -10% 所有抗性）",
		["(Allocating a Gateway allows you to allocate Atlas Passive Skills from its connected Gateway)"]="（ 配置大門可讓你配置與它相連大門的輿圖天賦 ）",
		["(Alluring Vaal Side Areas are more dangerous and drop Mortal Fragments)"]="（ 誘人的瓦爾區域更加危險且會掉落凡人碎片 ）",
		["(Always counts the shortest possible path)"]="（ 必定計算最短路徑 ）",
		["(An Oil Extractor destroys an Anointed Item to recover one of the Oils that was used to apply that Anointment)"]="（ 精油淬鍊會破壞抹油的物品，來回復其中一個套用抹油的油瓶 ）",
		["(Any Elemental Damage not Converted by other effects is Converted by this)"]="（任何元素傷害沒有被其它影響轉化，被此轉化）",
		["(Arcane Might causes Increases and Reductions to Spell Damage to also apply to Attack Damage at that percentage of their value)"]="（秘能奇技會使對法術傷害的增減同時以一定比例套用其數值至攻擊傷害）",
		["(Arcane Surge grants 20% increased Cast Speed and 30% increased Mana Regeneration rate)"]="（秘能波動賦予增加 20% 施放速度和 30% 魔力回復速度的效果）",
		["(Arcane Surge grants 20% increased Cast Speed and 30% increased Mana Regeneration rate, for 4 seconds)"]="（秘能波動賦予增加 20% 施放速度和 30% 魔力回復速度的效果，持續 4 秒）",
		["(Armour applies to Fire, Cold and Lightning Damage taken from Hits instead of Physical Damage\n-15% to all maximum Elemental Resistances)"]="（護甲同時作用於承受的擊中火焰、冰冷、和閃電傷害而不僅作用於物理傷害\n-15%全部最大元素抗性）",
		["(Armour is treated as this percentage of its actual value, only for calculating damage mitigation)"]="（ 護甲被視為其實際價值的百分比，僅用於計算減傷 ）",
		["(Armour, Evasion Rating and Energy Shield are the standard Defences)"]="（護甲、閃避和能量護盾是標準防禦）",
		["(Atlas Passive Skills that are not Notable, Keystones or Gateways are Small)"]="（ 非核心、關鍵或崎點輿圖天賦就是小天賦 ）",
		["(Attacks made against Enemies affected by Hallowing Flame gain 25% of Physical Damage as Extra Fire Damage.\nHallowing Flame is removed once an Attack that benefits from this Damage as Extra is successfully made.\nHallowing Flame lasts for six seconds and cannot benefit the one who inflicted it)"]="（攻擊受到聖徒烈火影響的敵人時，會獲得一部分物理傷害的額外火焰傷害。聖徒烈火會在成功發動一次帶有額外傷害的攻擊時移除。聖徒烈火持續6秒，且施加者無法從該增益中受益）",
		["(Attributes are Strength, Dexterity, and Intelligence)"]="（能力值是指力量、敏捷和智慧）",
		["(Auras can only grant bonuses to things they affect)"]="（ 光環只能給予他們影響之物加成 ）",
		["(Auras from your Skills can only affect you. Aura Skills have 1% more Aura Effect per 2% of maximum Mana they Reserve. 40% more Mana Reservation of Aura Skills)"]="（ 來自你技能的光環只會影響你。每 2% 光環保留的最大魔力，使光環技能有 1% 更多光環效果。40% 更多光環技能的魔力保留 ）",
		["(Base Maximum Effect of Shock is 50% increased Damage taken)"]="（ 基礎最大感電效果為增加承受 50% 傷害 ）",
		["(Base Maximum Rage is 30)"]="（ 基礎盛怒最大層數為 30 ）",
		["(Basic Currency includes any currency that drops from non-league content)"]="（基礎通貨包含非聯盟內容的任何通貨）",
		["(Being Blinded causes 20% less Accuracy Rating and Evasion Rating)"]="（ 被致盲有20%更少命中率和閃避值 ）",
		["(Being Blinded causes 20% less Accuracy Rating and Evasion Rating, for 4 seconds)"]="（ 被致盲有20%更少命中率和閃避值，持續4秒 ）",
		["(Being Covered in Ash applies 20% less Movement Speed and 20% increased Fire Damage Taken)"]="（被餘燼纏身的敵人20%更少移動速度並增加承受20%火焰傷害）",
		["(Being Covered in Ash applies 20% less Movement Speed and 20% increased Fire Damage Taken, for 4 seconds)"]="（被餘燼纏身時20%更少移動速度並增加承受20%火焰傷害，持續 4 秒）",
		["(Being Covered in Ash applies 20% less Movement Speed and increases Fire Damage taken, for 4 seconds)"]="（ 餘燼纏身套用 20% 更少移動速度和增加承受 20% 火焰傷害，持續 4 秒 ）",
		["(Being Covered in Frost applies 50% less Critical Strike Chance and 20% increased Cold Damage Taken)"]="（ 被霜寒纏身的敵人有 50% 更少暴擊率和增加承受 20% 冰冷傷害 ）",
		["(Being Covered in Frost applies 50% less Critical Strike Chance and 20% increased Cold Damage Taken, for 4 seconds)"]="（ 被霜寒纏身的敵人有 50% 更少暴擊率和增加承受 20% 冰冷傷害，持續 4 秒 ）",
		["(Bestial Rage increases the Movement Speed, Attack Speed and Damage of the affected Beast)"]="（野獸盛怒會增加被影響野獸的移動速度、攻擊速度、和傷害）",
		["(Beyond Portals and Demons stop spawning after a Unique Beyond Boss is spawned)"]="（ 傳奇超越頭目產出後停止產出超越傳送門和惡魔 ）",
		["(Bleeding can only be inflicted by Attacks)"]="（只有攻擊會造成流血）",
		["(Bleeding deals Physical Damage over time, based on the base Physical Damage of the Skill. Damage is 200% higher while moving)"]="（ 流血造成持續性物理傷害，傷害取決於初始的物理傷害。移動時受到的流血傷害增加 200% ）",
		["(Bleeding which has been Aggravated always deals higher Damage as though the target was moving)"]="（加劇的流血效果宛如對方在移動一樣，總是會造成更高的傷害）",
		["(Blighted Spores last for 10 seconds and have a random Aura)"]="（ 凋落毒孢持續 10 秒並有個隨機光環 ）",
		["(Blightreach grants a chance for Maps found to drop as Blighted Maps instead. Blightreach lasts for 60 seconds)"]="（凋落之境賦予一定機率使掉落的地圖為凋落的地圖。凋落之境會持續 60 秒）",
		["(Blitz Charges have a base Duration of 10 seconds)"]="（閃電球有基礎持續時間 5 秒）",
		["(Bone Armour applies a buff to you and each of your minions, which will take some of the damage from enemy hits before being depleted. The buff also grants immunity to bleeding. Shares a cooldown with other Guard skills)"]="（ 骸骨鎧甲增益效果套用至你和你每個召喚物，在消逝前替你承受部分敵人擊中的傷害。此增益效果同時給予免疫流血。和其他守護技能共享冷卻時間 ）",
		["(Bounty Targets drop a large number of Rogue's Markers and can drop a Contract)"]="（ 賞金目標掉落大量的盜賊之印並會掉落契約書 ）",
		["(Brand Critical Strikes are any Critical Strikes dealt by Brand Skills or by Skills Triggered by a Brand)"]="（ 烙印暴擊為烙印技能或被烙印觸發的技能所造成的所有暴擊 ）",
		["(Brand Damage is any Damage dealt by Brand Skills or by Skills Triggered by a Brand)"]="（ 烙印傷害為烙印技能或被烙印觸發的技能所造成的所有傷害 ）",
		["(By default you gain 1 Valour on Melee Kill, or on Melee Hit against Rare or Unique enemies, no more than once every 0.5 seconds, up to a maximum of 50)"]="（預設情況下，近戰擊殺，或近戰擊中稀有或傳奇敵人可獲得 1 勇氣，每 0.5 秒不超過 1 次，最多獲得 50 勇氣）",
		["(By default, when you complete an objective in a Map within a Shaped Region it collapses, removing itself from the Region. This causes all other Maps in the Region to gain additional modifiers. In cases where the Shaped Region would become bisected, only the Region with the most connected Maps will remain)"]="（默認情況下，當你於幻塑界域中的地圖中完成地圖目標時，該地圖會崩毀，將自身從領域中移除。此會使所有領域中的其他地圖獲得額外詞綴。若此行為會使幻塑界域一分為二，則僅擁有較多地圖的領域區塊會被保留）",
		["(Cannot Evade enemy Attacks. Cannot be Stunned)"]="（無法閃避敵人攻擊。不會被暈眩）",
		["(Cannot Ignite, Chill, Freeze or Shock\nCritical Strikes inflict Scorch, Brittle and Sapped)"]="（ 不能點燃、冰緩、冰凍或感電\n暴擊造成焦灼、易碎和殘喘 ）",
		["(Cannot Recover Energy Shield to above Armour. 3% of Physical Damage prevented from Hits Recently is Regenerated as Energy Shield per second)"]="（ 能量護盾無法回復超過護甲。近期被防止擊中的 3% 物理傷害，以每秒回復為能量護盾 ）",
		["(Cannot Recover Energy Shield to above Evasion Rating. Every 2 seconds, gain a Ghost Shroud, up to a maximum of 3. When Hit, lose a Ghost Shroud to Recover Energy Shield equal to 3% of your Evasion Rating)"]="（ 能量護盾無法回復超過閃避值。每 2 秒獲得 1 層幽魂屍布，最多 3 層。被擊中時，失去 1 層幽魂屍布以回復 3% 等同於你閃避值的能量護盾 ）",
		["(Cannot modifiy Blighted Maps or Maps behind Voidstone sockets on the Atlas)"]="(無法影響凋落地圖或輿圖上虛空石槽位後的地圖)",
		["(Casts an aura that adds chaos damage to the attacks and spells of you and your allies)"]="（施放一個光環，使你與受光環影響友方在攻擊和施放法術時額外附帶混沌傷害。）",
		["(Casts an aura that grants additional energy shield and increased energy shield recharge rate to you and your allies)"]="（施放一個光環，使你與受光環影響友方獲得額外的能量護盾，並增加能量護盾充能率）",
		["(Casts an aura that grants armour to you and your allies)"]="（施放一個光環，使你與受光環影響友方獲得額外的護甲。）",
		["(Casts an aura that grants evasion to you and your allies)"]="（施放一個光環，使你與受光環影響友方獲得額外的閃避。）",
		["(Chance to Block Attack Damage is doubled\nChance to Block Spell Damage is doubled\nYou take 65% of Damage from Blocked Hits)"]="（ 攻擊傷害格擋率被加倍\n法術傷害格擋率被加倍\n你承受 65% 來自格擋擊中的傷害 ）",
		["(Channelling Skills cannot Repeat)"]="（引導技能無法被重複）",
		["(Chaotic Might grants 30% of Physical Damage as extra Chaos Damage)"]="（混沌之力將提供等同30%物理傷害的額外混沌傷害）",
		["(Characters inherently gain +12 Life per Level)"]="（ 角色每級 +12 生命）",
		["(Characters sent to Void Leagues are no longer playable, and cannot be restored for any reason)"]="（ 角色被送入虛空聯盟且不再能遊玩，且不能被復原 ）",
		["(Chill reduces Action Speed by up to 30%)"]="（ 冰緩減少最多 30% 行動速度 ）",
		["(Chill reduces Enemy Action Speed by 10% for 2 seconds)"]="（冰緩減少敵人 10% 行動速度，持續2秒）",
		["(Chill reduces Enemy Action Speed by 10%)"]="（冰緩減少敵人 10% 行動速度）",
		["(Chill reduces Enemy Action Speed by up to 30%, depending on the amount of Cold Damage in the hit, for 2 seconds)"]="（冰緩依據擊中的冰冷傷害總量減少敵人行動速度，至多30%，持續2秒）",
		["(Chill reduces Enemy Action Speed for 2 seconds)"]="（冰緩減少敵人行動速度，持續 2 秒）",
		["(Chilled Ground, Creeping Frost, Frost Shield, and Vortices are Chilling Areas)"]="（冰緩地面、寒霜滲透、寒霜護盾和漩渦為冰緩區域）",
		["(Choose one of the three attached options)"]="（ 請在三個選項中擇一 ）",
		["(Choose one of the two attached options)"]="（ 請在兩個選項中擇一 ）",
		["(Close Range is up to 2 metres)"]="（ 近距離最遠 2 米 ）",
		["(Cold Ailments are Chilled, Frozen and Brittle)"]="（冰冷異常狀態為冰緩、冰凍和易碎）",
		["(Cold Ailments are Chilled, Frozen and Brittle. Hits inherently have 100% chance to inflict Chill and Critical Strikes inherently have 100% chance to inflict Freeze)"]="（冰冷異常狀態為冰緩、冰凍與易碎。擊中固有 100% 機率造成冰緩，且暴擊固有 100% 機率造成凍結）",
		["(Cold Exposure applies -10% to Cold Resistance for 4 seconds)"]="（冰冷曝曬 -10 冰冷抗性，持續 4 秒）",
