		["(Collect four different members of the Grattus line to create a Unique Item)"]="（收集格拉圖斯一族的四位不同成員來製造一件傳奇物品）",
		["(Collect four different members of the Nevalius line to create a Unique Item)"]="（收集涅瓦里烏斯一族的四位不同成員來製造一件傳奇物品）",
		["(Collect four different members of the Perandus line to create a Unique Item)"]="（收集普蘭德斯一族的四位不同成員來製造一件傳奇物品）",
		["(Collect four different members of the Phrecia line to create a Unique Item)"]="（收集費西亞一族的四位不同成員來製造一件傳奇物品）",
		["(Collect four different members of the Veruso line to create a Unique Item)"]="（收集維盧梭一族的四位不同成員來製造一件傳奇物品）",
		["(Conductivity is a Hex which inflicts -17% to Lightning Resistance and causes Hits to have +25% chance to Shock the target. It lasts 8 seconds)"]="（導電為咒術，-17% 閃電抗性，並使擊中目標 +25% 感電機率。持續 8 秒）",
		["(Conquered Passive Skills cannot be modified by other Jewels)"]="（被征服的天賦無法被其它珠寶影響）",
		["(Conquerors are Baran, the Crusader, Veritania, the Redeemer, Al-Hezmin, the Hunter and Drox, the Warlord)"]="（征服者包含聖戰軍王．巴倫、救贖者．維羅提尼亞、狩獵者．奧赫茲明和總督軍．圖拉克斯）",
		["(Convergence grants 30% more Elemental Damage and lasts 4 seconds)"]="（聚輻提供 30% 更多元素傷害並持續 4 秒）",
		["(Converts all Evasion Rating to Armour. Dexterity provides no bonus to Evasion Rating)"]="（將所有閃避值轉換為護甲，敏捷不提供額外閃避值）",
		["(Create Lesser Shrine has an initial Cooldown before it can Trigger)"]="（產生低階神殿有內建冷卻時間）",
		["(Creates a Dark Effigy tethered to you. Damage you take from enemy hits is taken from the Effigy's life before you, and damage the Effigy takes from enemy hits is taken from your life before it, at doubled value. The Effigy is destroyed if you get too far away from it)"]="（ 製造 1 個與你相連的黑暗雕像。敵人對你造成的傷害先由雕像的生命扣除，敵人對雕像造成的傷害先由你的生命扣除，都以兩倍的值。若你離雕像太遠，則雕像會被摧毀 ）",
		["(Creates a Lesser Shrine, which will grant a bonus when touched. The Lesser Shrine will disappear after a short duration, or when used)"]="（創造一個低階神殿，在碰觸時賦予一種加成效果。低階神殿會在持續時間結束或被使用後消失）",
		["(Creates a Suspended Mirage - an astral-infused clone of yourself that is suspended in time, just before the release of the spellcast that triggered them. On reaching three Suspended Mirages, all Suspended Mirages will be released, using the spell which was cast to create them. Suspended Mirages are not created by Vaal spells, channelling spells, instant spells, or spells which create minions)"]="（你施放法術時會創造一道時禁幻影 - 一道以星界能量注能、在創造它的法術被釋放之前會被困在時間之中的星界分身。在你達到三道時禁幻影數量後，所有時禁幻影會一起被釋放，施放創造它的法術。時禁幻影無法透過瓦爾、引導、立即、和會創造召喚物的技能創造。）",
		["(Cruelty makes all Skills Supported by Cruelty Support deal up to 40% more Damage over Time, based on the amount of Damage in the Hit which grants it)"]="（殘酷使所有被殘酷輔助的技能，根據擊中的傷害總量，造成至多 40% 更多持續傷害）",
		["(Crushed lowers Physical Damage Reduction by 15% for 4 seconds)"]="（ 壓碎降低 15% 物理傷害減免，持續 4 秒 ）",
		["(Crushed lowers Physical Damage Reduction by 15%)"]="（ 壓碎降低 15% 物理傷害減免 ）",
		["(Culling Strike means enemies that are on 10% or lower life after your Hit are Killed)"]="（ 對生命等於或少於 10% 最大生命的敵人可以造成撲殺，敵人將直接死亡 ）",
		["(Currency items can be used on non-Corrupted Vaal Side Areas)"]="（ 通貨可以使用於非汙染的瓦爾區域 ）",
		["(Cursed Treasure can be claimed for valuable rewards, but doing so will lose time while in Incursions)"]="（可領取詛咒寶藏以獲得珍貴獎勵，但穿越時損失時間）",
		["(Cursed areas penalise item drops, player experience and restrict certain content from appearing)"]="（受詛咒的區域會有物品掉落和玩家經驗值的懲罰，且不會掉落特定物品）",
		["(Curses a single enemy, making them more vulnerable to Critical Strikes. Killing the cursed enemy will grant life and mana, and a power charge. You can only have one Mark at a time)"]="（詛咒一名敵人，使其面對暴擊傷害時更加脆弱。擊殺被詛咒的敵人時會回復生命與魔力，並獲得一顆暴擊球。你同一時間只能施加一個印記。）",
		["(Damage over Time Multiplier for Ailments is equal to Critical Strike Multiplier. Critical Strikes do not deal extra Damage, Non-Critical Strikes cannot inflict Ailments)"]="（異常狀態的持續傷害加成等同於暴擊加成。暴擊不會造成額外傷害，未暴擊則無法造成異常狀態）",
		["(Damaging Retaliation Skills become Usable every sixth Hit from Enemies instead)"]="（改為每被敵人擊中六次，傷害性復仇技能變為可使用）",
		["(Dash backwards, leaving a short-lived mist copy of yourself that Taunts nearby Enemies for a short duration. The copy can be damaged by Enemies, and copies that are killed by an Enemy will apply a debuff in an area that makes affected targets take 30% increased Damage and deal 30% less Damage for 4 seconds)"]="（向後衝刺，留下一個模仿自身的短暫迷霧複製體。複製體會嘲諷周遭敵人一段時間，且可以被敵人攻擊。被敵人破壞的複製體會在一定範圍內施加使被影響目標承受30%更多傷害、和造成30%更少傷害的減益，持續4秒）",
		["(Debuffs you are Unaffected by can still be placed on you, but will not actually apply their effect)"]="（ 對你沒影響的減益效果仍可以放置你身上，但不會發揮效果 ）",
		["(Defensive minions have their targeting range lowered to a maximum value. They always target enemies around you)"]="（ 防守性的召喚物將他們瞄準目標距離降至最小。他們必定瞄準你附近的敵人 ）",
		["(Demonic Power grants different powerful benefits depending on the Beyond Boss slain)"]="（凶兆惡魔根據被殺死的超越頭目給予不同的強大好處）",
		["(Despair is a Hex which inflicts -15% to Chaos Resistance. It lasts 8 seconds)"]="（絕望為咒術，-15% 混沌抗性。持續 8 秒）",
		["(Dexterity provides no inherent bonus to Evasion Rating. +1% chance to Suppress Spell Damage per 15 Dexterity)"]="（ 敏捷不提供固有的閃避值加成。每 15 點敏捷 +1 法術傷害壓抑率 ）",
		["(Divination Buffs are not Flask Effects, and you cannot have more than one at a time)"]="（命運增益不是藥劑效果，且同一時間只能有一個）",
		["(Dual Wielding inherently grants +20% chance to Block Attack Damage and 10% more Attack Speed)"]="（雙持武器會固定賦予 +20% 格擋攻擊傷害機率與 10% 更多攻擊速度）",
		["(Each Exposure applies -10% to the matching Resistance for 4 seconds)"]="（每個曝曬 -10% 對應的抗性 4 秒）",
		["(Each Exposure applies -10% to the matching Resistance)"]="（ 每個曝曬 -10% 對應的抗性 ）",
		["(Each Exposure subtracts from the matching Elemental Resistance for 4 seconds)"]="（每次曝曬會從匹配的元素抗性中減去，持續 4 秒）",
		["(Each Ghost Inferno grants +5% Fire Damage over Time Multiplier. Each Ghost Inferno lasts for 8 seconds. Maximum 10 Ghost Inferno)"]="（每個幽魂地獄火提供 +5% 火焰持續傷害加成。每個幽魂地獄火持續 8 秒。最多可擁有 10 個幽魂地獄火。）",
		["(Each instance of Gale Force lasts 4 seconds. Maximum 10 Gale Force)"]="（每個颶風之力持續 4 秒。至多 10 個颶風之力）",
		["(Each soul grants 5% increased Attack and Cast speed. You lose 1 soul every 0.5 seconds if you have not eaten any souls Recently. Maximum of 45 souls consumed)"]="（每個靈魂會賦予 5% 攻擊和施放速度。若你近期沒有吞噬靈魂，每 0.5 秒便會失去 1 個靈魂。最多可吞噬 45 個靈魂）",
		["(Each stack of Sulphite Intoxication grants 35% increased Damage, 15% increased Movement Speed and +1% to all maximum Elemental Resistances. Sulphite Intoxication lasts 60 seconds)"]="（每層醉硫酸會增加 35% 傷害、 15% 移動速度和所有最大元素抗性 +1%。醉硫酸可持續 60 秒）",
		["(Effects cannot be slowed below 25% of their normal expiry rate)"]="（ 效果無法減緩至低於它們正常消逝速度的 25% ）",
		["(Elder Guardians are The Enslaver, The Eradicator, The Constrictor and The Purifier)"]="（尊師守護者包含異界．奴役、異界．根除、異界．干擾和異界．淨化）",
		["(Eldritch Bosses are The Searing Exarch, The Black Star, The Eater of Worlds, The Infinite Hunger, and The Elder)"]="（ 異能頭目為灼烙總督、黯星、吞噬天地、無盡渴望和異界尊師 ）",
		["(Elemental Ailments are Ignited, Scorched, Chilled, Frozen, Brittle, Shocked, and Sapped)"]="（元素異常狀態包含點燃、焦灼、冰緩、冰凍、易碎、感電和殘喘）",
		["(Elemental Thorns activates when Hit by Elemental Damage and lasts for 5 seconds. While active, it reflects Damage each time the monster receives a Elemental Hit, dealing Damage of the highest Elemental Damage type in the received Hit. Monsters cannot gain Elemental Thorns more than once every 10 seconds. You can only take Elemental Thorns damage once every 0.1 seconds)"]="（當受到元素傷害擊中時會觸發元素荊棘並持續 5 秒。在此狀態下，怪物每次受到元素擊中時都會反射傷害，造成的傷害類型取決於所受擊中裡傷害最高的元素類型。怪物每 10 秒內最多只能獲得一次元素荊棘。你每 0.1 秒內最多只能受到一次元素荊棘傷害）",
		["(Elemental Weakness is a Hex which inficts -15% to all Elemental Resistances. It lasts 8 seconds)"]="（元素要害為咒術，減少 15% 全部元素抗性。持續 8 秒）",
		["(Elusive initially grants 15% chance to Avoid All Damage from Hits, and 30% increased Movement Speed. The buff reduces its effect over time, removing itself at 0% effect. If you already have an Elusive buff, you cannot gain Elusive)"]="（ 靈巧初始給予 15% 機率避免全部擊中傷害、增加 30% 移動速度。增益效果隨著時間流逝，直到 0% 效果。若你已經有靈巧效果，則不能再獲得靈巧 ）",
		["(Empowerment increases the damage and damage reduction of an enemy\nas well as increasing item yield when killed)"]="（賦予增強敵人的傷害和傷害減免\n以及增加擊殺時的掉落物品產量）",
		["(Enemies affected by Barnacles Convert 5% of Physical Damage to Cold and have 5% increased duration of Chill and Freeze on them. Each instance of Barnacles lasts 30 seconds and can be inflicted up to 10 times)"]="（受到藤壺影響的敵人，會將 5% 的物理傷害轉化為冰冷傷害，且其增加 5% 身上的冰冷異常狀態持續時間。每個藤壺狀態持續 30 秒，且最多可疊加 10 次）",
		["(Enemies on your Brine Ground have 30% increased effect of Lightning and Cold Ailments on them and have 25% reduced Armour and Evasion Rating. Allies on your Brine Ground gain 10% of Physical Damage as extra Cold Damage and as extra Lightning Damage)"]="（位於你的鹹水地面上的敵人，其增加30%所受到的閃電與冰冷異常狀態效果，且減少25%護甲與閃避值。位於你的鹹水地面上的友方，獲得等同10%物理傷害的額外冰冷傷害與額外閃電傷害）",
		["(Enemies on your Brittle Ground are Brittle. Hits have +2% Critical Strike Chance against them)"]="（ 在你易碎地面上的敵人為易碎。對他們的擊中 +2% 暴擊率 ）",
		["(Enemies on your Sapped Ground are Sapped. They deal 6% less Damage)"]="（ 在你殘喘地面上的敵人為殘喘。他們造成 6% 更少傷害 ）",
		["(Enemies on your Scorched Ground are Scorched. They have -10% to Elemental Resistances)"]="（ 在你焦灼地面上的敵人為焦灼。他們 -10% 元素抗性 ）",
		["(Enemies standing in Smoke Clouds are Blinded)"]="（ 站在迷霧中的敵人被致盲 ）",
		["(Enemies that are Debilitated have 20% less Movement Speed and deal 10% less damage)"]="（ 被虛弱的敵人有 20% 更少移動速度和造成 10% 更少傷害 ）",
		["(Enemies you Taunt can only target you, and deal 10% less damage to anyone else. Taunt lasts for 3 seconds)"]="（被你嘲諷敵人只能以你為目標，並對其他人造成 10% 較少傷害。嘲諷持續 3 秒）",
		["(Energy Shield Recharge is not interrupted by Damage if Recharge began Recently\n40% less Energy Shield Recharge Rate)"]="（若近期能量護盾充能開始則不會被阻斷\n40% 更少能量護盾充能率）",
		["(Energy Shield starts at zero. Cannot Recharge or Regenerate Energy Shield. Lose 5% of Energy Shield per second. Life Leech effects are not removed when Unreserved Life is Filled. Life Leech effects Recover Energy Shield instead while on Full Life)"]="（ 能量護盾從 0 開始。無法充能或回復能量護盾。每秒失去 5% 能量護盾。未保留生命滿時，生命偷取效果不會被移除。滿血時生命偷取效果改為回復能量護盾 ）",
		["(Enfeeble is a Hex which reduces the targets' Accuracy Rating by 10% and Damage by 15%, or 9% on Rare or Unique targets. It lasts 8 seconds)"]="（衰弱為咒術，減少 10% 目標命中率和 15% 傷害，或 9% 對稀有或傳奇目標。衰弱持續 8 秒）",
		["(Essences in White Maps can reach a maximum tier of Screaming, and Essences in Yellow or Red Maps can reach a maximum tier of Shrieking)"]="（白色地圖中的精髓可以達到最高的咆哮階級，而黃色或紅色地圖中的則可以達到最高的尖嘯階級）",
		["(Evasion Rating is Doubled against Projectile Attacks, 25% less Evasion Rating against Melee Attacks)"]="（閃避值對投射物攻擊加倍，對近戰攻擊有 25% 更少閃避值）",
		["(Every Rage grants 1% more Attack Damage. Maximum Rage is 30. Lose 10 Rage per second if you have not been Hit or gained Rage in the last 2 seconds)"]="（每獲得 1 層盛怒使攻擊傷害提升 1%，上限為 30 層。若你在過去 2 秒內沒有被擊中或獲得盛怒，每秒失去 10 層盛怒）",
		["(Every Rage has an inherent effect of 1% more Attack Damage, and modifiers can add extra effects to Rage)"]="（每層盛怒固定會賦予 1% 額外攻擊傷害，詞綴可以為盛怒添加額外效果）",
		["(Excommunicated Enemies cannot deal Chaos Damage)"]="（被放逐的敵人無法造成混沌傷害）",
		["(Explodes when your Ward is broken, dealing Physical Spell Damage around you equal to a percentage of your Ward and inflicting Enervation on Hit, a debuff that lowers Movement Speed by 20% and prevents Life and Energy Shield Recovery for 4 seconds)"]="（當你的保護被破壞時爆炸，對你周圍造成相當於你保護一定比例的物理法術傷害，並在命中時施加神經衰弱。神經衰弱是一種會使移動速度降低 20%、並在 4 秒內無法恢復生命與能量護盾的減益效果。）",
		["(Extinguished enemies cannot inflict elemental ailments. Extinguish lasts 4 seconds)"]="（ 被熄滅的敵人不會造成元素異常狀態。熄滅持續 4 秒 ）",
		["(Fanaticism grants Spells you Cast yourself 75% more Cast Speed, 75% less Cost and 75% increased Area of Effect)"]="（狂熱使你自己施放的法術有 75% 更多施放速度， 75% 更少消耗和增加 75% 範圍效果）",
		["(Farrul's Farric Presence is an Aura which grants 80% increased Accuracy Rating, 120% increased Critical Strike Chance and Take no Extra Damage from Critical Hits)"]="（費爾羅的獸性之姿為一種會使受到影響者增加80%命中值、120%暴擊機率，並且不會承受暴擊所帶來的額外傷害的光環）",
		["(Farrul's Fertile Presence is an Aura which grants 100% increased Damage, Regenerate 3% of Life per second and Cannot be Stunned)"]="（費爾羅的繁盛之姿為一種會使受到影響者增加100%傷害、每秒3%最大生命回復、和免疫暈眩的光環）",
		["(Farrul's Wild Presence is an Aura which grants 20% increased Attack, Cast and Movement Speed and prevents Action Speed from being lowered below the Base Value)"]="（ 費爾羅的荒野之姿為一種會使受到影響者增加20%攻擊、施法、和移動速度，且行動速度不能被調整至低於基礎值的光環）",
		["(Feeding Frenzy grants 10% more Minion Damage, 10% increased Minion Movement Speed and 10% increased Minion Attack and Cast Speed)"]="（ 豢養狂熱給予 10% 更多召喚物傷害、增加 10% 召喚物移動速度和增加 10% 召喚物攻擊和施放速度 ）",
		["(Final Map Boss in Tier 14+ Maps have a 2% base chance to drop a Conqueror Map)"]="（階級 14 以上地圖的最終地圖頭目有 2% 基礎機率掉落一張征服者地圖）",
		["(Final Map Boss in Tier 14+ Maps have a 2% base chance to drop a Synthesis Map)"]="（階級 14 以上地圖的最終地圖頭目有 2% 基礎機率掉落一張追憶地圖）",
		["(Final Map Boss in Tier 14+ Maps have a 3% base chance to drop a Shaper Guardian Map)"]="（階級 14 以上地圖的最終地圖頭目有 3% 基礎機率掉落一張塑者守護者地圖）",
		["(Final Map Boss in Tier 14+ Maps have a 3% base chance to drop an Elder Guardian Map)"]="（階級 14 以上地圖的最終地圖頭目有 3% 基礎機率掉落一張尊師守護者地圖）",
		["(Fire Ailments are Ignited and Scorched)"]="（ 火焰異常狀態為點燃和焦灼 ）",
		["(Fire Exposure applies -10% to Fire Resistance for 4 seconds)"]="（火焰曝曬 -10 火焰抗性，持續 4 秒）",
		["(Fire Exposure subtracts from Fire Resistance for 4 seconds)"]="（ 火焰曝曬減少火焰抗性 4 秒 ）",
		["(Fire Spells cannot deal non-Fire Damage\nCold Spells cannot deal non-Cold Damage\nLightning Spells cannot deal non-Lightning Damage\nElemental Spells deal 30% more Damage with Ailments and have 30% more Effect of non-Damaging Ailments)"]="（火焰法術無法造成非火焰傷害\n冰冷法術無法造成非冰冷傷害\n閃電法術無法造成非閃電傷害\n元素法術造成 30% 更多異常狀態傷害 ，且擁有 30% 更多非傷害型異常狀態效果）",
		["(Flammability is a Hex which inflicts -17% to Fire Resistance and causes Hits to have +25% chance to Ignite the target. It lasts 8 seconds)"]="（易燃為咒術，-17% 火焰抗性，並使擊中目標 +25% 點燃機率。持續 8 秒）",
		["(Flasks and Jewels are not Equipped)"]="（藥劑和珠寶不視為裝備）",
		["(Fortifying grants an amount of Fortification based on the Damage of the Hit)"]="（ 護體根據擊中的傷害總量給予護體 ）",
		["(Fragments are non-Map items that can be used in a Map Device)"]="（碎片為可使用於地圖裝置的非地圖物品）",
		["(Freeze lowers Enemy Action Speed to zero, preventing them from acting)"]="（冰凍使敵人行動速度降至 0，使他們無法行動）",
		["(Freeze lowers Enemy Action Speed to zero, preventing them from acting. Duration is based on the Cold Damage of the Hit)"]="（冰凍使敵人行動速度降至 0，使他們無法行動。根據擊中的冰冷傷害決定持續時間）",
		["(Freezes that would have a duration of 0.3 seconds or below are not inflicted)"]="（不會被施加持續時間為 0.3 秒或以下的凍結效果）",
		["(Frostbite is a Hex which inflicts -17% to Cold Resistance and causes Hits to have +25% chance to Freeze the target. It lasts 8 seconds)"]="（凍傷為咒術，-17% 冰冷抗性，並使擊中目標 +25% 冰凍機率。持續 8 秒）",
		["(Gain Added Spell Damage equal to the Damage of your Main Hand Weapon)"]="（獲得等同於你主手武器傷害的附加法術傷害）",
		["(Graft Quality increases the amount of Hiveblood Stored)"]="（接肢品質會提高可儲存的巢裔之血的量。）",
