		["(Gravekeeper's Boon causes you to consume a nearby Corpse every second to recover 10% of Life and Mana for 30 seconds)"]="（守墓人的恩惠會使你每秒消耗一具附近的屍體以恢復 10% 的生命和魔力，持續 30 秒）",
