		["(Hoarfrost lasts 10 seconds and can be inflicted multiple times, each refreshing the duration of existing Hoarfrost on the target. Each Hoarfost increases Freeze Duration on the target by 20%. All Hoarfrost is removed if the target is Frozen)"]="（霜凍會持續 10 秒，且可以對目標重複施加多次，每次施加時都會刷新目標原先的霜凍持續時間。每層霜凍增加目標 20% 冰凍持續時間 。目標被凍結時，移除其身上所有的霜凍層數）",
		["(Hunger of Ghorr gains a Stage every time you cast a different Empowered Spell with Pact of Ghorr, up to a maximum of 3 Stages. Stages are reset back to 0 when you recast Pact of Ghorr )"]="（每當你使用戈沃誓約施放不同的強化技能時，便會獲得一層戈沃之飢渴，最多 3 層。當你重新施放戈沃誓約時，層數將重置為 0）",
		["(Hunters' Cunning grants less damage taken from Beasts, increased damage against Beasts, and increased Quantity and Rarity of items found from slain Beasts)"]="（獵人的狡猾可降低來自巨獸的傷害，同時增加對巨獸造成的傷害，從被殺死的巨獸身上發現的物品數量和稀有度亦增加）",
		["(If both conversions apply, each will convert 50%)"]="（若套用兩個轉化，每個將轉化 50%）",
