		["(Lingering Blades remain on the ground for a duration and can be used by specific skills. If Animated, they count as Daggers)"]="（ 地面上剩餘的劍刃會殘存一段時間，並可被特定技能使用。若被幻化將視為匕首 ）",
		["(Local Modifiers on Weapons that add damage to that Weapon do not grant you Added Damage, so are unchanged by this)"]="（武器上增加該武器傷害的區域詞綴不會給予你附加傷害，因此不受此影響）",
