		["(Molten Burst launches molten projectiles from the point of impact, causing area attack damage to enemies where they land)"]="（熔岩爆發會在擊中的區域彈射出熔岩球，並會在著地時對敵人造成範圍攻擊傷害。）",
		["(Monsters in Stasis do not take any actions)"]="（靜止的怪物不會做任何動作）",
