		["(Pacify curses all targets in an area, having no effect at first, but causing them to deal no damage once 60% of the curse's duration has expired)"]="（ 平靜詛咒區域內全部目標，初始沒有效果，但當詛咒的持續時間失效 60% 時，始他們不造成傷害 ）",
		["(Passive Skills that are not Notable, Masteries, Keystones, or Jewel Sockets are Small)"]="（天賦點不是指核心、專精、關鍵天賦或珠寶插槽，而是小的天賦點）",
		["(Penance Mark curses a single enemy, causing them to spawn multiple phantasms when hit. The phantasms will be allies of the marked enemy with the same monster level. They cast a projectile spell which deals physical damage, and are immune to curses. You can only have one Mark at a time)"]="（ 苦行印記詛咒單一敵人，使它們被擊中時產生多個幻影。幻影為印記敵人的有方且有著相同等級。它們施放造成物理傷害的投射物法術，且免疫詛咒。你同時只能印記 1 個敵人 ）",
		["(Permanent Auras are Auras with no Duration)"]="（ 永久光環為沒有持續時間的光環 ）",
		["(Phantasmal Might grants Added Spell Physical Damage based on the level of the Phantasm. Multiple instances of Phantasmal Might stack)"]="（ 幻影之力根據幻影等級獲得附加法術物理傷害。多個幻影之力可以疊加 ）",
		["(Physical Damage Reduction cannot be negative)"]="（ 物理傷害減免不能為負數 ）",
		["(Physical Damage Reduction is lower against Overwhelming Hits, but cannot go negative)"]="（ 物理傷害減免對鎮壓之擊來說較低，但不能為負數 ）",
		["(Physical Thorns activates when Hit by Physical Damage and lasts for 5 seconds. While active, it reflects Physical Damage each time the monster receives a Physical Hit. Monsters cannot gain Physical Thorns more than once every 10 seconds. You can only take Physical Thorns damage once every 0.1 seconds)"]="（當受到物理傷害擊中時會觸發物理荊棘並持續 5 秒。在此狀態下，怪物每次受到物理擊中時都會反射物理傷害。怪物每 10 秒內最多只能獲得一次物理荊棘。你每 0.1 秒內最多只能受到一次物理荊棘傷害）",
		["(Players Recoup 12% of Elemental Damage taken as Energy Shield per Absorption Charge)"]="（每顆吸收球使玩家補償 12% 承受的元素傷害為能量護盾）",
		["(Players can Touch up to 40 nearby normal or magic Monsters for each Tormented Spirit Possessing them)"]="（玩家身上每個附身的罪魂，可以觸碰附近最多 40 隻普通或魔法怪物）",
		["(Players have 3% chance to deal Triple Damage and 10% increased Stun Threshold per Brutal Charge)"]="（每顆殘暴球使玩家有 3% 機率造成 3 倍傷害和增加 10% 暈眩門檻）",
		["(Players have 8% more Damage with Ailments and 8% more Effect of Non-Damaging Ailments per Affliction Charge)"]="（每顆苦痛球使玩家有 8% 更多異常狀態傷害和 8% 更多非傷害型異常狀態效果）",
		["(Players that are Marked for Death take 50% increased Damage)"]="（具有死亡印記的玩家所受傷害增加 50%）",
		["(Poison deals Chaos Damage over time, based on the base Physical and Chaos Damage of the Skill. Multiple instances of Poison stack)"]="（ 中毒造成持續性混沌傷害，傷害取決於初始的物理和混沌傷害總和。中毒效果可以疊加 ）",
		["(Primal Aegis calls forth a protective aegis which takes elemental damage from hits for you until depleted. The aegis will be restored to its full value after a short delay if you stop taking elemental damage from hits, or if depleted)"]="（ 始祖聖盾召喚 4 個保護聖盾，在消逝前替你承受擊中元素傷害。若你停止承受擊中元素傷害或聖盾消逝，聖盾會在一段時間回復全部 ）",
		["(Projectile Attack Hits deal 20% less Damage to targets at the start of their movement, dealing up to 60% more Damage to targets as the projectile travels farther)"]="（投射物攻擊擊中在它們的初始位置造成 20% 更少傷害，隨著投射物飛行越遠，對目標造成至多 60% 更多傷害。）",
		["(Projectile Attack Hits deal up to 30% more Damage to targets at the start of their movement, dealing less Damage to targets as the projectile travels farther)"]="（投射物攻擊擊中目標時，在起始位置造成至多 30% 更多傷害，隨著投射物飛行越遠對目標造成傷害減少 ）",
		["(Punishment is a Hex which increases Damage taken by 30% while the target is on low life and causes them to be Debilitated for 2 seconds when they Hit. It lasts 8 seconds)"]="（懲戒為咒術，使貧血的目標增加 30% 承受傷害，且當他們被擊中時被虛弱 2 秒）",
		["(Raise two spectral spiders from each nearby corpse that will attack your enemies with Viper Strike. Each raised spider grants you increased Attack Speed and increased Damage with Poison. Enemies will not engage the spiders directly, and they are immune to damage)"]="（周遭每具屍體召喚兩隻幽魂巨蛛，牠們會向你的敵人使用毒蛇打擊。每隻喚醒的蜘蛛增加你的攻擊速度和中毒傷害。敵人不會直接與蜘蛛交戰，且牠們免疫傷害。）",
		["(Raising Modifier Tier Rating excludes lower tier Modifiers from rolling, distributing their roll chance among higher tier Modifiers of the same Modifier type)"]="（提高詞綴評分將使較低階級的詞綴無法被骰到，將其被骰到的機率分配給相同詞綴類型的較高階級詞綴）",
		["(Random Shrine buffs have a base duration of 20 seconds)"]="（隨機神殿增益效果的基礎持續時間為20秒）",
		["(Randomly encountered Masters are Alva, Einhar, Jun and Niko)"]="（ 隨機遇到艾瓦、埃哈、瓊恩和尼科大師 ）",
		["(Ravenous consumes a targeted corpse, granting you a buff that causes you to deal more damage to, and take less damage from, enemies of the same Monster Category as the corpse)"]="（ 貪婪消耗 1 個指定屍體，增益使你對與相同怪物種類屍體的敵人，造成更多傷害、承受更少傷害 ）",
		["(Reaching seven Ruin will prevent you from being able to claim the Reward)"]="（ 到達 7 層毀滅時，會防止你獲得獎勵 ）",
		["(Recently refers to the past 4 seconds)"]="（ 近期內意指 4 秒內 ）",
		["(Removes all Energy Shield\nChance to Evade Hits is based off of 200% of your Ward instead of your Evasion Rating\nPhysical Damage Reduction from Hits is based off of 200% of your Ward instead of your Armour)"]="（移除所有能量護盾\n來自擊中的閃避機率會基於你保護的200%而不是你的閃避值\n來自擊中的物理傷害減免會基於你保護的200%而不是你的護甲）",
		["(Removes all mana. 10% more maximum Life. Skills Cost Life instead of Mana. Skills Reserve Life instead of Mana)"]="（移除魔力。10% 更多最大生命。技能消耗生命而非魔力。技能保留生命而非魔力）",
		["(Resident Architects are those that can be killed to change the Incursion room)"]="（居住的建造者可以被擊殺來改變穿越房間）",
		["(Rogue Exile Bodyguards take 50% less damage, and have additional Rewards.)"]="（ 盜賊流亡者保鑣承受 ５0% 更少傷害，並有額外的獎勵 ）",
		["(Rotten Bulwark will take damage from hits before your Life or Energy Shield. Any Hit Damage taken will break your Rotten Bulwark, causing it to absorb up to the amount of Rotten Bulwark you have available.)"]="（腐爛壁壘會優先於你的生命值或能量護盾承受攻擊傷害。任何受到的擊中傷害都會打破腐爛壁壘，使其吸收傷害，直至達到你目前腐朽壁壘的可用值。）",
		["(Ruin applied by this method will stack additively with other sources of Ruin)"]="（用這個方法施加的毀滅會與其他來源的毀滅疊加）",
		["(Rune Daggers are considered Daggers)"]="（ 符紋匕首視為匕首 ）",
		["(Runesurges cause enemies you kill to have a 20% chance to explode, dealing 100% of their maximum life as the corresponding damage type)"]="（符文奔騰有 20% 機率使你擊殺的敵人爆炸，並造成最大生命 100% 的對應類型傷害）",
		["(Sacrificial Zeal grants Added Spell Physical Damage equal to 25% of the Skill's Mana Cost, if Mana Cost is not higher than the maximum you could spend and causes you to take Physical Damage over Time, for 4 seconds)"]="（犧牲狂熱會賦予等同於 25% 技能魔力消耗的附加法術物理傷害，前提是魔力消耗未超過你可支付的最大魔力，並使你承受物理持續傷害，持續 4 秒）",
		["(Safehouses which have already been Located can still be randomly selected)"]="（已經被定位的藏匿處仍然可以被隨機選擇）",
		["(Sapped Enemies deal 20% less Damage)"]="（ 殘喘的敵人造成 20% 更少傷害 ）",
		["(Sapped Enemies deal 6% less Damage for 4 seconds)"]="（殘喘的敵人造成 6% 更少傷害 4 秒）",
		["(Sapped Enemies deal up to 20% less Damage, based on the Lightning Damage of the Hit, for 4 seconds)"]="（ 根據擊中的閃電傷害，殘喘的敵人造成至多 20% 更少傷害，持續 4 秒 ）",
		["(Scorched Enemies have -10% to Elemental Resistances)"]="（焦灼的敵人 -10% 元素抗性）",
		["(Scorched Enemies have their Elemental Resistances lowered by 10% for 4 seconds)"]="（焦灼的敵人減少 10% 他們的元素抗性 4 秒）",
		["(Scorched Enemies have their Elemental Resistances lowered by up to 30%, based on the Fire Damage of the Hit, for 4 seconds)"]="（焦灼的敵人減少至多 30% 元素抗性，根據擊中的火焰傷害，持續 4 秒）",
		["(Shaper Guardians are Guardian of the Chimera, Guardian of the Minotaur, Guardian of the Hydra and Guardian of the Phoenix)"]="（塑者守護者包含鳳凰守護者、九頭蛇守護者、牛頭人守護者和奇美拉守護者）",
		["(Shaper's Presence causes effects on you and nearby allies to expire 20% slower)"]="（ 塑者光環減緩 20% 你和附近友方身上效果消逝速度 ）",
		["(Share Endurance, Frenzy and Power Charges with nearby party members)"]="（與鄰近的友方分享耐力、狂怒與暴擊球）",
		["(Shock increases Damage taken by 15%)"]="（感電增加15%承受傷害）",
		["(Shock increases Damage taken by 15%, for 2 seconds)"]="（感電增加15%承受傷害，持續2秒）",
		["(Shock increases Damage taken by up to 50%)"]="（ 感電增加承受最多 50% 傷害 ）",
		["(Shock increases Damage taken by up to 50%, depending on the amount of Lightning Damage in the hit, for 2 seconds)"]="（感電根據擊中的閃電傷害總量，增加至多50%承受傷害，持續2秒）",
		["(Silence is a Hex which prevents Casting Spells or Using Warcries. It lasts 3 seconds)"]="（沉默為咒術，無法施放法術或使用戰吼。持續 3 秒）",
		["(Skills that have dealt a Critical Strike in the past 8 seconds deal 40% more Elemental Damage with Hits and Ailments. Your Critical Strikes do not deal extra Damage. Ailments never count as being from Critical Strikes)"]="（過去 8 秒內技能造成暴擊，造成 40% 更多元素擊中和異常狀態傷害。你的暴擊不會造成額外傷害。異常狀態永不透過暴擊計算）",
		["(Socketed Gems gain +10% to Quality in Red, Blue and Green Sockets if the Gem colour matches the Socket colour)"]="（插槽中的寶石在紅色、藍色、綠色插槽中時若寶石顏色和插槽顏色一致，則會 +10% 品質）",
		["(Spectral Totems are intangible, untargetable, and undamageable, have 1 maximum Life, and cannot Taunt enemies. They are no longer counted as Summoned Totems, but modifiers that affect Totems also affect Spectral Totems)"]="（幽魂圖騰無形、無法被傷害或選中、無法嘲諷敵人、且最大生命為1。它們不被視為圖騰，但影響圖騰的詞綴會同時影響幽魂圖騰。）",
		["(Spell cast time is 10% longer for each time the Spell Reoccurs)"]="（每次法術再次觸發時，法術施放速度會延長 10%）",
		["(Spend Energy Shield before Mana for Skill Mana Costs. Energy Shield protects Mana instead of Life. 50% less Energy Shield Recharge Rate)"]="（優先使用能量護盾代替技能魔力消耗。能量護盾從生命護盾變成魔力護盾。50% 更少能量護盾回復速度）",
		["(Strength's Damage bonus also applies to Projectile Attacks)"]="（力量加成的物理傷害套用至投射物攻擊與近戰攻擊）",
		["(Strength's Damage bonus applies to all Spell Damage as well)"]="（力量加成的傷害同時套用至全部法術）",
		["(Summon two Triggerbots which follow you around and run towards enemies. Your Triggered Spells Trigger twice, once from each Triggerbot's location)"]="（ 召喚 2 個觸發機械跟隨你，並朝敵人跑去。你的觸發法術觸發 2 次，從每個觸發機械的位置觸發 1 次 ）",
		["(Summons a Relic of a random element that stays near you. Depending on the element chosen, the relic minion will have an Anger, Hatred, or Wrath aura. These relics explode when they die, dealing elemental damage to enemies around them. If you already have a relic of the chosen element, its duration will be refreshed instead of summoning a new one)"]="（ 召喚隨機元素的聖物待在你身邊。根據所選擇元素，聖物召喚物有憤怒、憎恨或雷霆光環。當聖物死亡時會爆炸，對附近敵人造成元素傷害。若你已經有選擇元素的聖物，召喚時會刷新它的持續時間，而不是照換新的 ）",
		["(Summons a Sentinel of Radiance which follows you and attacks enemies in melee, while burning enemies around it and taking a portion of damage from hits for you. You can only have one Sentinel of Radiance)"]="（ 召喚光輝護衛跟隨你並近戰攻擊敵人，燃燒它附近的敵人和替你承受部分擊中傷害。你只能有一個光輝護衛 ）",
		["(Summons a spectral tiger companion that attacks nearby enemies and dies after a duration. Each spectral tiger grants you a buff that increases Critical Strike Chance, and increases Attack and Cast Speed. If you have the maximum number of them, refreshes the duration and life of an existing one instead)"]="（召喚一隻幽魂虎夥伴攻擊周遭敵人，並在一段時間後死亡。每一隻幽魂虎都為你帶來增加暴擊機率、以及增加攻擊和施放速度的增益。如果你已擁有最大數量的幽魂虎，則改為增加一隻的持續時間並重置其生命。）",
		["(Summons a spectral wolf companion that attacks nearby enemies and dies after a duration. Each spectral wolf grants you a buff that adds damage to your attacks. If you have the maximum number of them, refreshes the duration and life of an existing one instead)"]="（召喚一頭幽靈狼夥伴攻擊附近的敵人，並在持續時間結束後死亡。每頭幽靈狼會賦予你一種增益效果，為你的攻擊增加傷害。如果你的幽靈狼數量達到上限，便會改為刷新現有幽靈狼的持續時間和生命）",
		["(Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion has two buff spells it will cast on you: Arcane Surge, granting increased Cast Speed and Mana Regeneration, and a buff that grants Chance to Shock and Lightning Penetration)"]="（召喚一個不朽的神諭召喚物。該召喚物會對你施放兩種增益法術：能增加你的施放速度和魔力回復的秘能波動，以及一種賦予感電機率和閃電穿透的增益效果。）",
		["(Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion will cast a random buff on you that grants one or all of the following: Fire 2 additional Projectiles, Chain 2 additional times, Projectiles Pierce 2 additional targets, or Projectiles Fork then Fork an additional time)"]="（召喚一個超凡神諭。此神諭隨機對你施放以下一個或全部增益效果：發射 2 個額外投射物、額外連鎖 2 次、投射物穿透 2 個額外目標，或投射物分裂後再額外分裂 1 次）",
		["(Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. The minion will occasionally create an aura on you that increases the Action Speed of you and all allies near you)"]="（召喚一個不朽的神諭召喚物。該召喚物偶爾會為你創造一個光環，使你和你附近友方的行動速度增加。）",
		["(Summons an immortal Harbinger minion. While you are channelling, the minion will occasionally cast a buff on you that reduces the Damage you take, makes you avoid all Stuns and Elemental Ailments, and prevents Curses affecting you)"]="（召喚一個不朽的神諭召喚物。當你在引導時，該召喚物偶爾會對你施加一種增益效果，使你受到的傷害減少、免疫所有暈眩和元素異常狀態，並防止詛咒對你產生影響。）",
		["(Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Kitava tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which makes a percentage of your leech recover instantly)"]="（召喚一個奇塔弗部落的不朽酋長召喚物，在持續時間內與你並肩作戰。該召喚物會賦予你一種增益效果，使你一定百分比的偷取立即恢復）",
		["(Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Ngamahu tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which allows totems to take some damage from hits for you)"]="（召喚一個拿瑪乎部落的不朽酋長召喚物，在持續時間內與你並肩作戰。該召喚物會賦予你一種增益效果，使圖騰能為你承受部分的擊中傷害）",
		["(Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Rongokurai tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which lets a percentage of your armour protect against all damage types)"]="（召喚一個隆格庫萊部落的不朽酋長召喚物，在持續時間內與你並肩作戰。該召喚物會賦予你一種增益效果，使你一定百分比的護甲能防止所有傷害類型）",
		["(Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Tasalio tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which prevents your action speed being lowered)"]="（召喚一個塔薩里奧部落的不朽酋長召喚物，在持續時間內與你並肩作戰。該召喚物會賦予你一種增益效果，使你的行動速度不會被減緩）",
		["(Summons an immortal chieftain minion of the Valako tribe to fight alongside you for a duration. This minion grants you a buff which recovers life, mana and energy shield when you block)"]="（召喚一個瓦拉庫部落的不朽酋長召喚物，在持續時間內與你並肩作戰。該召喚物會賦予你一種增益效果，使你格擋時恢復生命、魔力和能量護盾）",
		["(Supercharged Projectiles have 50% more Area of effect and deal 50% more Damage)"]="（ 超載的投射物有 50% 更多範圍效果和造成 50% 更多傷害 ）",
		["(Tailwind increases Action Speed by 8%)"]="（ 流順之風增加 8%  行動速度 ）",
		["(Take 1% less Damage from Hits per Fortification. Maximum 20 Fortification)"]="（ 每 1 層護體承受 1% 更少擊中傷害。最大 20 層護體）",
		["(Take 1% less Damage from Hits per Fortification. Maximum 20 Fortification. Fortification lasts 6 seconds)"]="（ 每 1 層護體承受 1% 更少擊中傷害。最大 20 層護體。護體持續 5 秒）",
		["(Take 50% less Damage over Time if you've started taking Damage over Time in the past second. 100% more Duration of Ailments on you)"]="（ 若你在過去 1 秒開始受到持續傷害，承受 50% 更少持續傷害。100% 更多你身上異常狀態的持續時間 ）",
		["(Tar reduces Enemy Movement Speed by 50%)"]="（ 焦油減少敵人 50% 移動速度 ）",
		["(Templar Auras have one of the following effects:\n- Gain 15% of Physical Damage as Extra Fire Damage\n- Gain 15% of Physical Damage as Extra Lightning Damage\n- Regenerate 1.5% of Life per second\n- 30% increased Mana Regeneration Rate\n- +23% to Chaos Resistance\n- 50% reduced Effect of Curses on you)"]="（聖堂光環會有以下其中一種效果：\n- 獲得等同15%物理傷害的額外火焰傷害\n- 獲得等同15%物理傷害的額外閃電傷害\n- 每秒回復1.5%生命\n- 增加30%魔力回復率\n- +23%混沌抗性\n- 減少50%作用於你的詛咒效果）",
		["(Temporal Chains is a Hex which reduces Action Speed by 15%, or 9% on Rare or Unique targets, and makes other effects on the target expire 40% slower. It has 50% less effect on Players and lasts 5 seconds)"]="（時空鎖鏈為咒術，減少 15% 行動速度或 9% 對稀有或傳奇目標，並且使目標上的效果比平常慢 40% 失效。對玩家有 50% 更少效果並持續 5 秒）",
		["(The Damage Types are Physical, Fire, Cold, Lightning, and Chaos)"]="（ 傷害種類分為物理、火焰、冰冷、閃電，和混沌 ）",
		["(The Expected Damage of Ignite is its Damage per second multiplied by its Duration)"]="（點燃的預計傷害為每秒傷害乘以持續時間）",
		["(The Expected Damage of Poison is its Damage per second multiplied by its Duration)"]="（ 每秒中毒的預期傷害被它的持續時間所影響 ）",
		["(The Stun Threshold determines how much Damage can Stun something)"]="（造成暈眩所需的傷害量代表暈眩門檻）",
		["(The buff still applies to you after the Ancestor Totem ceases to be Active)"]="（增益在先祖圖騰停止啟動後，仍會套用至你）",
		["(The buff still applies to you after you leave the Banner's area)"]="（離開鬥旗的範圍之後，增益效果仍會套用在你身上）",
		["(The damage they take will be divided evenly between them)"]="（ 他們承受的傷害會平均分擔給他們 ）",
		["(The duration of this flask's effect will still expire while other flask effects are active, even if they are from the same flask)"]="（ 此藥劑效果的持續時間即使在其他藥劑效果作用中仍會失效，即使它們來自同一藥劑 ）",
		["(The effects of the ground still apply to you, allies or enemies after leaving its area)"]="（離開此區域後，這個地面效果仍然影響你、友方或敵人）",
		["(The effects still apply to enemies after leaving the link)"]="（ 離開連結後，此效果仍會套用至敵人 ）",
		["(The higher toughness a monster has, the less damage it takes. A monster with 100% increased Toughness takes 50% less damage, a monster with 200% increased toughness takes 67% less damage, and so on. Reduced toughness causes monsters to take more damage)"]="（怪物的堅韌越高，受到的傷害越低。堅韌增加 100% 的怪物受到 50% 更少傷害，堅韌增加 200% 的怪物受到 67% 更少傷害，以此類推。堅韌被降低會使怪物受到更多傷害）",
		["(These are consecutive)"]="（ 這是連續的 ）",
		["(These are consecutive)\n(Each Conflux means all damage causes that Ailment)"]="（此為連續效果）\n（特定匯流作用時，你所有擊中造成的傷害皆能造對應的異常狀態。）",
		["(They cannot Split, Pierce, Fork, Chain, or Return if they collide with a target)"]="（如果撞擊目標，它們無法裂化、穿透、分裂、連鎖或返回）",
		["(They will also not be put on cooldown if they remain Usable)"]="（若維持可使用，它們也不會進入冷卻）",
		["(They will deal the same total damage over a shorter duration)"]="（在一小段時間後，他們會造成相同總傷害）",
		["(Thirst for Blood reserves some of your life to cause bleeding you inflict to be stronger, and grant life regeneration based on the number bleeding enemies nearby)"]="（嗜血會保留你的一部分生命，並使你施加的流血更強大，並根據周遭流血的敵人獲得生命回復）",
		["(This Jewel has both a minimum and maximum Radius. Only Passives between the two are considered to be in the Jewel's Radius)"]="（ 此珠寶有最小和最大範圍。只有在此兩範圍內的天賦點被視為在珠保範圍內 ）",
		["(This Modifier only applies if this Item is Corrupted)"]="（若此物品為被汙染，此詞綴才有作用）",
		["(This does not make it easier to Freeze enemies)"]="（這不會讓凍結敵人更容易）",
		["(This is used instead of the Critical Strike Chance of the Weapon)"]="（套用此暴擊率，而不是套用武器的暴擊率）",
		["(This modifier does not affect things that check the life of corpses)"]="（ 此詞綴不影響檢測屍體生命的東西 ）",
		["(This only affects the inherent loss of Rage when you haven't been Hit or gained Rage Recently)"]="（ 當你近期沒有被擊中或獲得盛怒時，此只會影響固有失去的盛怒 ）",
		["(This skill is triggered when you use a Slam or Strike skill, and summons a Mirage Chieftain who will use that Slam or Strike skill once before dissipating)"]="（ 當你使用重擊或打擊技能時，觸發此技能，並召喚幻影酋長，並在消散前使用重擊或打擊技能一次 ）",
		["(Throwing Mines takes 10% more time for each additional Mine thrown)"]="（ 每個額外投擲地雷，使投擲地雷花費 10% 更多時間 ）",
		["(Tinctures inflict Weeping Wounds instead of Mana Burn. Effects that interact with Mana Burn interact with Weeping Wounds instead)"]="（萃取物會從魔力灼燒改為造成啼泣創傷。與魔力灼燒互動的效果改為與啼泣創傷互動）",
		["(Tinctures periodically inflict Mana Burn on you while active)"]="（萃取物生效期間會週期性地對你造成魔力灼燒）",
		["(Transfusion prioritises your closest Minion that isn't already at maximum Souls)"]="（輸血會優先作用於最靠近你且尚未達到最大靈魂數的召喚物）",
		["(Unarmed Attacks are any Attacks performed with a hand that is not holding any Item)"]="（ 空手攻擊是攻擊時手沒有持有任何物品 ）",
		["(Unbound Avatar requires 100 Unbound Fury to use and causes you to become Unbound for 10 seconds, which has no effects beyond those listed here)"]="（無縛化身需要 100 層無縛之怒才能使用，並會使你進入無縛狀態，持續 10 秒，除此處列舉的效果外無其他效果）",
		["(Uncapped Chance to Block is the value Chance to Block would have if ignoring Maximum Chance to Block)"]="（ 無上限格擋率是指若無視最大格擋率，格擋率可獲得的值 ）",
		["(Uncapped Resistance is the value Resistance would have if ignoring Maximum Resistance)"]="（不將抗性上限列入計算的抗性絕對值）",
		["(Unexciting things are rolled three times and the middle result used)"]="（平庸物品取三次骰取數值，並取中間數值）",
		["(Unholy Might grants 100% of Physical Damage converted to Chaos Damage and 25% chance to apply Withered on Hit and lasts for 4 seconds)"]="（不潔之力給予100%物理傷害轉換為混沌傷害，且擊中有25%機率施加持續4秒的凋零效果）",
		["(Unholy Might grants 100% of Physical Damage converted to Chaos Damage and 25% chance to apply Withered on Hit)"]="（不潔之力給予將100%的物理傷害轉換成混沌傷害，與25%擊中時施加凋零的機率）",
		["(Unlucky things are rolled twice and the worst result used)"]="（不幸令各種隨機數值計算兩次，並取低值做為結果。）",
		["(Unnerved enemies take 10% increased Spell Damage)"]="（ 膽怯的敵人增加 10% 承受法術傷害 ）",
		["(Untainted Wild Animals do not drop items, and grant increased experience when slain)"]="（ 未玷污的野性動物不會掉落物品，被擊殺時增加經驗 ）",
		["(Up to 10 Vines can grasp you, inflicting 8% less Movement Speed per Vine. Broken by moving)"]="（ 至多 10 條藤蔓可以抓住你，每個藤蔓造成 8% 更少移動速度。移動時掙脫 ）",
		["(Up to 4 Ruptures can be inflicted on a target, lasting 3 seconds each)"]="（每個目標最多可以被施加 4 層撕裂，每層撕裂持續 3 秒）",
		["(Upfront Costs are all Costs that are not paid per-second)"]="（ 前期消耗為每秒未支付的全部消耗 ）",
		["(Vaal Attacks, Channelling Attacks, Retaliation Attacks, and Attacks which Repeat cannot be Exerted)"]="（瓦爾攻擊、引導施放攻擊、復仇攻擊和重複的攻擊不能被竭盡）",
		["(Vaal Non-Aura Skills require 80% less Souls. Vaal Non-Aura Skills require 100% increased Souls per Vaal Skill used in the past 8 seconds)"]="（非光環的瓦爾技能有 80% 更少靈魂消耗。過去 8 秒每個使用的瓦爾技能，都會使非光環的瓦爾技能增加 100% 靈魂消耗）",
		["(Vaal Spells and Brand Spells cannot be Empowered)"]="（瓦爾技能與烙印技能無法被強化）",
		["(Vaal Temptation lasts for the duration that Soul Gain Prevention would have applied and can stack)"]="（瓦爾誘惑會在停止獲得靈魂持續時間內持續，且可以堆疊）",
		["(Valour is gained while you have a Banner skill and augments the power of those skills)"]="（當你有鬥旗技能時可獲得勇氣，並且可增強那些技能的威力）",
		["(Virulence is granted by the Herald of Agony Skill)"]="（毒性是透過苦痛之捷技能獲得）",
		["(Visiblity affects how far away Monsters can see you from)"]="（能見度影響怪物能夠查覺你的範圍）",
		["(Vulnerability is a Hex which increases Physical Damage taken by 15% and causes Hits to have +25% chance to inflict Bleeding on the target. It lasts 8 seconds)"]="（脆弱為咒術，增加 15% 承受物理傷害，使擊中對目標 +25% 流血機率。脆弱持續 8 秒）",
		["(Warstaves are considered Staves)"]="（ 征戰長杖視為長杖 ）",
		["(Weeping Wounds cause you to lose 1% of your maximum Life per second per stack. Tinctures deactivate when you have 1 life remaining)"]="（每層啼泣創傷使你每秒失去 1% 最大生命。萃取物會在你剩餘 1 點生命時失效）",
		["(When adding random explicit modifiers to this item, higher level modifiers will be more common proportional to the number of Memory Strands. Memory Strands are consumed whenever random explicit modifiers are added to this item)"]="（為此物品加入隨機詞綴時，會隨記憶絲縷數量，決定高階詞綴是否更加常見。為此物品添加隨機詞綴時，都會消耗記憶絲縷）",
		["(When an Impaled enemy is hit, the Impale reflects 10% of the physical damage of the Impaling hit to that enemy. Impale lasts for 5 hits or 8 seconds)"]="（ 當被穿刺的敵人被擊中，穿刺會反射 10% 穿刺之擊所造成的物理傷害至敵人。穿刺持續 5 次擊中 ）",
		["(When you interact with Voltaxic Sulphite Veins or Chests in your Maps gain Sulphite Intoxication for each Voltaxic Sulphite Vein or Chest found)"]="（當你與地圖中的魔暴硫酸礦脈或箱子互動時，每找到一個魔暴硫酸或箱子即可獲得醉硫酸）",
		["(When you reach full Energy Shield, Sacrifice all Energy Shield to gain +5% to all Maximum Resistances for 4 seconds)"]="（當你滿能量護盾時，獻祭全部能量護盾以獲得 +5% 全部最大抗性 4 秒）",
		["(When your Hits Impale Enemies, also Impale other Enemies near them. Inflict 5 additional Impales on Enemies you Impale. For 5 seconds after you Impale Enemies, they cannot be Impaled again, and Impales cannot be Called from them)"]="（當你的擊中穿刺敵人時，也會穿刺他們附近的敵人。對被你穿刺的敵人造成 5 次額外穿刺。敵人被你穿刺後 5 秒內不能再被穿刺，且鋼之呼喚無法移除他們身上的穿刺）",
		["(While active, grants the Avian's Might and Avian's Flight buffs in sequence. Avian's Might grants you and your minions a chance to deal Double Damage with hits for a duration. Avian's Flight grants you and your minions increased Movement Speed for a secondary duration. You can only have one Aspect active at a time)"]="（啟動時，照順序獲得飛羽意志和飛羽飄翔增益效果。飛羽意志會在時間內賦予你和你召喚物造成雙倍擊中傷害的機率。飛羽飄翔會在第二段時間內增加你和你召喚物的移動速度。你同時只能啟動一種祝福）",
		["(While active, grants the Cat's Stealth and Cat's Agility buffs in sequence. Cat's Stealth increases your critical strike chance, makes you harder to see, and gives you a chance to avoid damage for a short duration. Cat's Agility increases your attack and cast speed for a longer secondary duration. You can only have one Aspect active at a time)"]="（啟動時，照順序獲得傲貓隱身和傲貓姣捷增益效果。傲貓隱身會在短時間內增加你的暴擊率、使你更難被看見，並給予你避免傷害的機率。傲貓姣捷會在較長的第二段時間內增加你的攻擊和施放速度。你同時只能啟動一種祝福）",
		["(While active, periodically applies a Spider's Web debuff to nearby Enemies, and Hinders them. Each Spider's Web on an Enemy increases the Damage they take. Hinder reduces their movement speed. You can only have one Aspect active at a time)"]="（啟動時，週期性地對附近敵人施加蛛網減益效果，並阻礙它們。敵人身上的每一個蛛網效果會增加其受到的傷害。阻礙會減少它們的移動速度。你同時只能啟動一種祝福）",
		["(While you have Elemental Conflux, all Damage from Hits will cause Chill, Shock, and Ignite)"]="（ 當你有元素匯流時，你所有擊中造成的傷害皆能造成感電、冰緩，和點燃 ）",
		["(While you have Phasing, your movement is not blocked by Enemies)"]="（ 當你進入迷蹤狀態時，你將不會被敵人所阻擋 ）",
		["(While you have Soul Eater, you consume the souls of anything killed nearby, gaining 5% increased Attack and Cast speed for each. You lose 1 soul every 0.5 seconds if you have not eaten any souls Recently. Maximum of 45 souls consumed)"]="（當你有噬魂者時，你會吞噬附近擊殺生物的靈魂，每吞噬一個靈魂，攻擊和施放速度便提高 5%。若你近期沒有吞噬靈魂，每 0.5 秒便會失去 1 個靈魂。最多可吞噬 45 個靈魂）",
		["(While you have Unbroken Ward, your next non-channelling Attack you Use yourself breaks your Ward to gain Added Cold Damage equal to 25% of Ward)"]="（當你有未破損的保護時，你下一次由自身使用的非引導攻擊會打破你的保護以獲得等同於25%保護的附加冰冷傷害）",
		["(While you have this passive allocated, you will have the option to permanently hire Mercenaries found in the wild. Permanently hired Mercenaries and their Minions deal less Damage than temporarily hired Mercenaries, but you can change what gear they have equipped. Passives that affect your Mercenary do not affect temporarily hired Mercenaries. Permanently hired Mercenaries will only follow Luminaries with this passive allocated)"]="（當配置此天賦時，你將可以選擇永久僱用在野外發現的傭兵。永久僱用的傭兵及其召喚物所造成的傷害會低於臨時僱用的傭兵，但你可以更換他們所裝備的裝備。影響你傭兵的被動技能不會對臨時僱用的傭兵生效。永久僱用的傭兵只會跟隨配置了此天賦的輝耀使徒）",
		["(While you run, this skill creates a small explosion with each step, dealing fire damage in an area around you)"]="（跑步時，你的每一步都會使該技能產生小型爆炸，對你的周圍造成火焰傷害。）",
		["(Wild Rogue Exiles are Rogue Exiles that are placed randomly within the Area)"]="（野生盜賊流亡者為隨機於地區內放置的盜賊流亡者）",
		["(Wild Savagery grants 100% increased Physical Damage, 10% increased Action Speed, Hits ignore Enemy Physical Damage Reduction and Cannot be Stunned)"]="（荒野蠻怒給予增加100%物理傷害、10%行動速度、擊中無視敵人物理傷害減免和無法被暈眩）",
		["(Withered applies 6% increased Chaos Damage Taken, and can be inflicted up to 15 times)"]="（凋零增加 6% 承受混沌傷害，至多可以堆疊 15 次）",
		["(Xesht-Ula can drop Breachstones of every Breach type)"]="（ 烈許烏拉會掉落每種裂痕的裂痕石 ）",
		["(You are Chilled while standing in Chilled Ground)"]="（站立於冰冷地面將使你受到冰緩）",
		["(You are Unarmed as long as you have no Equipped Weapons)"]="（ 你未裝備武器時就是空手 ）",
		["(You are Unencumbered while you have no Gloves, no Main Hand Item, and no Off Hand Item Equipped)"]="（ 當你沒有裝備手套、主手或副手道具時，你視為無所拘束 ）",
		["(You are in Blood Stance by default)"]="（預設為血腥姿態）",
		["(You are on Low Energy Shield if you have 50% of your Maximum Energy Shield or less)"]="（能量護盾低於50%時為貧能量護盾狀態）",
		["(You are on Low Life if you have 50% of your Maximum Life or less)"]="（血量低於50%時為貧血狀態）",
		["(You are on Low Mana if you have 50% of your Maximum Mana or less)"]="（魔力低於50%時為貧魔狀態）",
		["(You can inflict Bleeding on an Enemy up to 8 times, Your Bleeding does not deal extra Damage while the Enemy is moving and cannot be Agrravated, 50% less Damage with Bleeding)"]="（你可以對敵人造成最多 8 層的流血，當敵人移動時你的流血不能造成額外傷害和加劇，50% 更少流血傷害）",
		["(You can only have one Herald\n50% more Effect of Herald Buffs on you\n100% more Damage with Hits from Herald Skills\n50% more Damage Over Time with Herald Skills\nMinions from Herald Skills deal 25% more Damage\nYour Aura Skills are Disabled)"]="（你只能擁有一個捷光環\n捷光環的增益效果對你提高 50% \n捷光環技能的擊中傷害提高 100% \n捷光環技能的持續傷害提高 50% \n由捷光環技能召喚的召喚物造成的傷害提高 25% \n你的光環技能被停用）",
		["(You can only take one of the three Duelist Ascendancy passives)"]="（ 你只能在決鬥者的三個昇華職業中選擇一個 ）",
		["(You can only take one of the three Marauder Ascendancy passives)"]="（ 你只能在野蠻人的三個昇華職業中選擇一個 ）",
		["(You can only take one of the three Ranger Ascendancy passives)"]="（ 你只能在遊俠的三個昇華職業中選擇一個 ）",
		["(You can only take one of the three Shadow Ascendancy passives)"]="（ 你只能在暗影刺客的三個昇華職業中選擇一個 ）",
		["(You can only take one of the three Templar Ascendancy passives)"]="（ 你只能在聖堂武僧的三個昇華職業中選擇一個 ）",
		["(You can only take one of the three Warlock Power passives)"]="（ 你只能選擇一個術士之力天賦 ）",
		["(You can only take one of the three Witch Ascendancy passives)"]="（ 你只能在女巫的三個昇華職業中選擇一個 ）",
		["(You can't deal Damage with Skills yourself.  +1 to maximum number of Summoned Totems)"]="（你的技能無法造成傷害。+1 召喚圖騰的最大數量）",
		["(You cannot gain Gluttony while you have Disgorge)"]="（你在擁有噴吐時無法獲得暴食）",
		["(You count as Dual Wielding while you are Unencumbered\n40% more Attack Speed with Melee Skills while you are Unencumbered\nAdds 14 to 20 Attack Physical Damage to Melee Skills per 10 Dexterity while you are Unencumbered)"]="（ 你無所拘束時視為雙持武器\n你無所拘束時，使用近戰技能有 40% 更多攻擊速度\n你無所拘束時，每 10 點敏捷使近戰技能附加 14 至 20 攻擊物理傷害 ）",
		["(You gain 4% of Physical Damage as extra Cold Damage and as extra Lightning Damage per Brine Charge\nMaximum Brine Charges is equal to Maximum Endurance Charges)"]="（每顆海洋球使你獲得 4% 物理傷害的額外冰冷傷害與額外閃電傷害\n最大海洋球數量等同於最大耐力球數量）",
		["(You gain Rampage bonuses for Killing multiple Enemies in quick succession)"]="（迅速擊殺多隻怪物將獲得暴怒加成）",
		["(You lose 10 Rage per second if you have not been Hit or gained Rage in the last 2 seconds)"]="（ 若你在過去 2 秒內沒有被擊中或獲得盛怒，每秒失去 10 層盛怒）",
		["(You take Chaos damage over time while standing in Desecrated Ground)"]="（站立於腐化地面將使你受到混沌持續傷害）",
		["(Your Hexes have infinite Duration\n20% less Effect of your Curses)"]="（你的咒術有無限持續時間\n20% 更少你詛咒的效果）",
		["(Your Warcries do not grant Buffs or Charges to You. 100% more Warcry Duration)"]="（戰吼不會給予你增益效果或充能球。戰吼持續時間增加 100%）",
		["(Your hits can't be Evaded. Never deal Critical Strikes)"]="（你的傷害不能夠被閃避。無法造成暴擊）"
	},
